window.FWN_MADAMS_IDENTITIES_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_MADAMS_IDENTITIES_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":3701,"title":"Chapter 3701: Master Wang Thoughtfully Called Over the Doctor","paragraphs":["Guan Yan was the best investigator in the Red Alliance.","Slim Waist Control was also good at these things, but it was more about hacking techniques, such as destructive computer viruses and program hacking.","He was good at computers and could find many things on the Internet that others could not.","Qiao Nian occasionally asked him to help her investigate people.","But when she wanted to investigate someone’s background, she preferred Guan Yan.","Guan Yan had traveled the world all these years and had unexpected connections everywhere. She knew people from all walks of life.","At the end of it, Guan Yan was still better at this.","Sometimes, David also asked Guan Yan to help him investigate the background of a business partner.","At this moment, a new call popped up on Qiao Nian’s cell phone.","She took a look and whispered to the man on the other end of the video call, \"I’ll answer the dean’s call and call you back later.\"","Then, she hung up on him. Her fingertips swiped across the screen and she accepted Feng Yu’s call.","Feng Yu called to tell her the same thing as Ye Wangchuan. He had heard about the accident outside the research institute from others and guessed that the girl in the accident was Qiao Nian. Hence, he quickly called her to confirm that she was safe.","Of course, Qiao Nian did not say anything. She did not mention the abrasions on her back and knees. She only said she caught him and sent him to Bright Gate.","Feng Yu couldn’t tell anything was wrong with her tone, so he thought she was not injured. After reminding Qiao Nian to be careful, he hung up.","Qiao Nian was already a little tired after the two calls.","She did not call Ye Wangchuan back immediately. Instead, she walked to the computer table and swept everything into the drawer. Then, she turned on the laptop and leaned back in her chair to rest.","With a throbbing pain in her temple, Qiao Nian was too tired and wanted to rest.","To her surprise, she almost fell asleep.","Only when there was a light knock on the door did she wake up.","\"Miss Qiao, are you inside?\"","Knock, knock.","Two more soft knocks on the door.","Then, she heard Gu San’s voice.","\"Miss Qiao? Are you sleeping?\" Gu San was not confident.","Qiao Nian was forced to open her eyes. After a short dizziness, she regained her senses and looked at the sky outside.","Unknowingly, it was already dark.","She pressed her temples with her cold fingertips. Smoke came out of her dry throat as she forced out a hoarse voice. \"Come in.\"","\"Okay, Miss Qiao, I’m coming in.\" Gu San heard her soft voice and carefully turned the doorknob.","The lights in the room were not on. It was pitch-black, with only the natural moonlight coming through the window.","Afraid of knocking into the furniture, Gu San asked in a low voice, \"Miss Qiao, can I turn on the lights?\"","\"Oh.\" Qiao Nian’s head hurt terribly. She only realized that her back and arms were burning with pain when she tried to move. She could endure it. She stood up to get the water on the coffee table as if nothing had happened. Her throat was still smoking. \"Alright.\"","Gu San carefully turned on the lights and saw the girl’s thin back.","Qiao Nian was still wearing the bathrobe. The silver-gray bathrobe was loosely tied around her waist, making her look lazy and casual.","Fortunately, to prevent Ye Wangchuan from seeing the gauze wrapped around her body, Qiao Nian wrapped herself tightly. Nothing could be seen beneath the bathrobe.","It was just that her style was too strong, and she was dressed too casually, which gave people a strong visual impact."]},{"number":3702,"title":"Chapter 3702: As You See, I’m a Doctor","paragraphs":["\"Miss Qiao.\" Gu San did not dare to look at her as he asked, \"Do you want to change your clothes?\"","Qiao Nian took a sip of water to moisten her throat. Her throat was finally not that dry and uncomfortable. Hearing this, she turned around and twisted the bottle cap with her beautiful hand. \"Why are you here?\"","Qiao Nian noticed that he had brought someone with him.","It was a woman.","The clueless 27 or 28-year-old wore gold-framed glasses on her fair face. She seemed a little reserved and curious behind Gu San, carrying a medicine box.","A doctor?","Qiao Nian raised her eyebrows in surprise. She walked over and placed the water bottle on the table. \"He asked you to come?\"","Her voice was lowered by an inch. It was hoarse and pleasant to the ears.","The female doctor did not expect the patient to be such a beautiful young girl. She looked at Qiao Nian’s beautiful eyebrows under the light and had a good impression of her. She smiled and took the initiative to say, \"Hello, Young Master Ye asked me to take a look at you.\"","Qiao Nian’s dark eyes landed on her.","The female doctor was someone who had seen big scenes. She was cheerful and enthusiastic as she waved the medicine box. \"As you can see, I’m a doctor.\"","\"Oh,\" Qiao Nian replied.","The female doctor walked over and put the medicine box on the table. \"Come here. I’ll check you.\"","Only then did she realize that she acted too naturally. She covered her eyes and explained to Qiao Nian in embarrassment, \"I wasn’t informed of your ailment, so I brought the examination tools along. Anyway, since you appear fine now, I’ll just examine you briefly. No charge~\"","Gu San rubbed his face at her nonsense and quickly said to Qiao Nian, \"Hua Ci is Bright Gate’s private doctor. Old Master usually calls her when he’s unwell. She doesn’t know your identity, so... Miss Qiao, don’t hold it against her.\"","He made it relatively simple.","In fact, the woman was strictly considered the Ye family’s adopted daughter and the daughter of Ye Lan’s friend.","Ye Lan’s friend passed away early, leaving her daughter to live overseas. At first, Ye Lan wanted to bring Hua Ci back, but the 10-year-old girl was very resistant to going to an unfamiliar place.","Out of affection for her good friend, Ye Lan hired a butler to stay overseas and take care of her. In addition, she supported her in her studies and other expenses.","The Ye family was rich, and Hua Ci was also hardworking.","At 16, she was admitted to a first-tier university overseas. After that, she continued to study for a master’s degree before going for a doctorate. Last year, after obtaining her doctorate certificate, she was recruited by the top medical teams overseas. She was dedicated to medical research and curing difficult illnesses and was considered a genius among ordinary people.","Of course, because of her relationship with Ye Lan, she would usually help the Ye family in what she could.","For example, she happened to come to the independent continent with the team to meet Elder Zhong from the Pharmacy Association. She rushed over after receiving Ye Wangchuan’s call.","Hua Ci did not expect to meet a young Asian woman. Even though she was also Chinese, she couldn’t help but size up the girl’s overly exquisite eyebrows when she examined Qiao Nian. She removed the gauze and said in surprise, \"I didn’t expect the patient to be a young girl. I think you’re still studying, right? Why did you come to such a place?\""]},{"number":3703,"title":"Chapter 3703: Sister Nian: What a Coincidence, I’m a Doctor Too","paragraphs":["Qiao Nian grew cooperative after finding she was called over by Ye Wangchuan. She sat there and let her remove the gauze. \"What kind of place?\"","Hua Ci did not notice the casualness in her tone. She removed the first gauze and saw the wound on Qiao Nian’s elbow. She took a deep breath. \"It’s the independent continent. Outsiders are usually not allowed to come here. Wangchuan brought you here, right? He’s too irresponsible. Why did he leave you here alone and run back home?\"","In her subconscious mind, places like the independent continent and the illegal district where the law was lacking were very dangerous. A delicate little girl like Qiao Nian should never step foot here.","Qiao Nian placed her uninjured hand on the back of the chair and lowered her dark eyelashes. \"Oh.\"","Hua Ci looked up at her. She kept feeling that the girl was too calm, and a strange feeling rose in her heart. However, she did not say anything, and her hands sped up as she reapplied the medicine and bandaged Qiao Nian’s wound.","\"Bear with it. It’ll hurt a little.\"","She treated Qiao Nian like she was an ignorant little girl. As she applied the medicine, she did not forget to educate her. \"It’s not safe here. I’ll call him and ask him to arrange a plane to send you back.\"","Qiao Nian’s eyes flickered and she glanced at her again. She seemed to have thought of something and faintly asked, \"Are you very familiar with him?\"","Hua Ci bandaged her up beautifully and looked up with a smile in her eyes. \"Of course. He’s my younger brother.\"","\"Oh.\" Qiao Nian smiled.","She knew what to do.","An older-woman younger-man relationship of sorts.","Coincidentally, Gu San had gone out to answer a call. Upon returning, he handed the cell phone to Qiao Nian. \"Miss Qiao, Master Wang wants to talk to you.\"","Qiao Nian’s tone was cold. \"No.\"","Gu San was stunned. \"Huh?\"","He almost blurted out to ask why.","Fortunately, he managed to hold it in.","He put the phone back to his ear and coughed awkwardly. \"Well... Master Wang, Miss Qiao is still being bandaged and can’t talk to you.\"","\"How’s she doing?\"","Actually, Ye Wangchuan heard the girl’s rejection. He was used to it.","He asked gently, \"Is her injury serious?\"","Gu San looked at Qiao Nian’s bandaged arm and thought for a moment. \"Miss Qiao has some abrasions on her body. It’s not serious. Miss Hua is already treating her.\"","At this moment, Hua Ci chased him away.","\"Okay, I want to see her back and other parts. You must leave now.\" She pointed in the door’s direction and motioned for him to leave.","\"Okay.\" Gu San touched his nose and turned to leave.","At this moment, Qiao Nian pulled up the sleeve of her bathrobe and rejected Hua Ci’s good intentions. \"No need. I’ve already dealt with it. Just give me an anti-inflammatory pill.\"","Hua Ci immediately frowned. \"How can that do? I should help you deal with it. I’m a doctor.\"","Qiao Nian’s eyes were a little dry as she looked at her darkly and said in an emotionless voice, \"I’m also a doctor.\"","\"You?\" Hua Ci sized her up from head to toe, clearly not believing Qiao Nian was a doctor at her age.","Before she could continue, Gu San finally realized that Qiao Nian’s patience was running out and quickly stopped Hua Ci. \"Alright, let’s leave.\"","\"Uh, didn’t you ask me to treat her? This wound hasn’t been treated yet...\" Hua Ci did not agree.","However, Gu San was strong and pulled her out.","Then, he hurried back in to pack up the medicine box."]},{"number":3704,"title":"Chapter 3704: She Told on Me Behind My Back?","paragraphs":["He was very obedient. Before leaving, he did not forget to look at Qiao Nian’s expression. \"Miss Qiao, I’ll send the medicine up to you later.\"","\"Mm.\"","Qiao Nian did not like to vent her anger on others, nor did she like the feeling of losing control of her emotions. It was just that she was not in a good mood.","Before Gu San could leave, she said, \"Next time, tell him to handle this himself.\"","Gu San’s heart trembled and he secretly cried out in pain. However, he still explained dutifully, \"Master Wang doesn’t know. He’s usually quite slow in this aspect. He’s also worried about you and is afraid that you were injured but refused to say it... Elder Zhong is taking care of Emperor Ji in the hospital. Coincidentally, Miss Hua is a woman, so Master Wang...\"","Master Wang had grown up like a proud son of heaven.","It could be said that after starting kindergarten, he had never lacked all kinds of adoring gazes.","He had grown up in such an environment and was already immune to the admiration of others. Unless it was the person he liked, it was very difficult for him to pay attention to what others were thinking, because there was no need and he did not have the energy to understand them.","Especially since Hua Ci was Ye Lan’s adopted daughter and did not see Ye Wangchuan even once a year.","Hua Ci did not show any admiration in front of Master Wang. According to what she expressed, she simply said that she treated Ye Wangchuan as her younger brother.","Sometimes, she would even argue with him.","Master Wang could not be bothered to argue with her. Since she grew up overseas, her personality was more enthusiastic.","Gu San only realized later that Hua Ci might be interested in Master Wang.","However, Master Wang had never noticed this before. There was naturally no need for him to bring an unimportant person to Master Wang.","He really did not expect Qiao Nian to see through Hua Ci’s thoughts at a glance.","Gu San panicked. \"Miss Qiao...\"","Qiao Nian had not rested well for a few days to begin with. Coupled with Hua Ci’s nagging, she was unable to suppress her temper.","\"I know.\"","\"Miss Qiao, are you really not angry? I...\"","Gu San was still stealing glances at her.","Qiao Nian’s temper had passed, but she was a little tired and wanted to sleep. \"Send me some anti-inflammatory medicine later.\"","\"Okay.\"","Gu San could see she was fatigued and quickly said, \"Miss Qiao, rest now.\"","He closed the door gently behind him.","Upon reaching the stairs, he saw that Hua Ci was still a little angry.","His head hurt.","\"Miss Hua, what did you say to Miss Qiao?\"","He went out to answer the phone for a while. Did Hua Ci say something while he was out?","Hua Ci was stunned for a moment. Then, her eyes widened and she became unhappy. \"What do you mean? What do you mean by what I said? Did she tell you that I said something about her?\"","She liked Qiao Nian to begin with. At first glance, she felt that this girl had a valiant aura. Why was she complaining behind her back?","Besides, she didn’t say anything. She just said that the independent continent was not safe. She even kindly said she’d tell Wang Chuan to send her back to Beijing... Was this wrong?!","Hua Ci had grown up overseas and had a straightforward personality. She immediately wanted to see Qiao Nian. \"I’ll ask her.\"","\"Stop right there.\" Gu San grabbed her arm and said unhappily, \"Miss Hua, please don’t cause trouble for me. Master Wang asked you to come to take a look at Miss Qiao’s injuries. Since Miss Qiao doesn’t need it, I’ll send you back to the hotel.\"","As he spoke, he firmly dragged Hua Ci down the stairs."]},{"number":3705,"title":"Chapter 3705: You Met Master Zhong?","paragraphs":["Hua Ci felt suffocated. She frowned, still not understanding what she had done wrong. She seemed very enthusiastic the entire time and did not say anything. What did the other party mean by doing this? Was she trying to embarrass her and deliberately play her?","Hua Ci had already treated Qiao Nian as the kind of little girl who liked to play tricks in Beijing. She got more and more dissatisfied.","However, Gu San did not give her a chance to question Qiao Nian. He stuffed her into the car and forcefully sent her back to her residence.","Hua Ci was staying in a decent hotel with the rest of the medical organization.","Gu San sent her to the entrance but didn’t get out of the car. \"Miss Hua, I won’t send you up.\"","Hua Ci bit her lip and silently unbuckled her seatbelt. After leaving the car, she stood by the door and explained angrily, \"I didn’t bully her!\"","\"I know.\" Gu San looked at her in surprise. He did not understand where she got the confidence to think she could bully Miss Qiao. He gave her face and replied, \"Miss Hua, I can’t park my car for too long. You can go up.\"","Hua Ci slammed the door and entered the hotel in her high heels.","Gu San watched her enter the elevator before stepping on the accelerator with relief. He turned the car around and left.","...","Hua Ci returned to her suite and casually placed the medicine box on the table, making a loud knocking sound and causing a blonde female colleague to look at her in surprise.","\"What’s wrong with you?\"","\"Nothing.\"","\"Didn’t you go to see a patient? How’s it? Is her condition serious?\" her colleague asked curiously.","Hua Ci’s expression became even more ugly. She did not know how to describe the feeling Qiao Nian gave her. She ruffled her hair and did not answer the question. \"What kind of mentality do you think young girls have these days? Why do they like to play tricks?\"","\"She’s young.\" The blonde female colleague smiled as she held the glass of water and said casually, \"She’s just a little girl who hasn’t seen much of the world.\"","Hua Ci frowned. Is that so?","The image of the restrained girl sitting on the chair obediently to help her change her dressing appeared in her mind again.","Hua Ci couldn’t associate someone with that kind of temperament with a little girl who liked to complain behind her back.","However, the other party did just that!","Her blonde female colleague came over. \"What’s wrong? Why do you look so pale? Was the patient difficult?\"","\"...I don’t know, I guess.\" Hua Ci forced a smile.","Her female colleague raised her eyebrows and said arrogantly, \"Then don’t worry about it! We’re not doctors who specialize in treating people. It’s her blessing to be treated by you. If she doesn’t cherish it, why are you pitying her?\"","Hua Ci remained silent and did not refute.","As the top medical organization in the world, they were naturally different from the doctors in ordinary hospitals. Their social statuses were different.","Hua Ci rubbed her face and walked back, still distraught. \"I just can’t figure it out.\"","\"If you can’t figure it out, don’t think about it.\" The female colleague held her shoulders and said excitedly, \"I went to the hospital with the others to see Master Zhong today!\"","Hua Ci’s eyes lit up. \"You guys saw him?\"","\"Master Zhong’s busy treating a patient with a special status, so he just briefly met us before leaving,\" the female colleague said sadly.","However, she became excited in the blink of an eye. \"I heard that Master Zhong promised to eat with us tomorrow night to talk about the research project on pharmaceuticals. Are you going?\""]},{"number":3706,"title":"Chapter 3706: She’s the Next Mistress of the Ye family","paragraphs":["Hua Ci finally heard something that made her happy. \"Of course I have to go.\"","The female colleague nudged her with her elbow. \"Are you happy? That’s why I’m asking you why you’re conflicted about a patient. With our status, we’re already giving her face by treating her. But you’re still angry at her and lowering your status!\"","Hua Ci did not want to refute this time.","She tacitly agreed with her colleague.","At this moment, the phone in her bag vibrated.","The female colleague tilted her head at it. \"Someone’s calling you.\"","Hua Ci thanked her and opened her bag to take out her phone. Her brows relaxed when she lowered her eyes and saw it was Ye Lan. She told her female colleague she needed to answer this call and returned to her room.","\"Hello, Aunt Ye.\"","\"I heard that you’re in the independent continent? How is it? Are you used to it?\" Ye Lan was as concerned as ever, but it was just an elder’s general concern; they weren’t very close.","Hua Ci smiled as she walked to the balcony. \"I came with the organization. It’s alright. You have to take care of your health. I’ll visit you in Beijing when I’m free.\"","\"Okay,\" Ye Lan replied and was about to hang up.","Hua Ci hesitated for a moment before asking, \"Aunt Ye, do you know there’s a very young girl around Wangchuan?\"","\"Who are you talking about?\" Ye Lan reacted before realizing who she was referring to.","Immediately, her cold eyes softened. \"Oh, you’re talking about Nian Nian. I know. What’s wrong?\"","Hua Ci did not understand her attitude and asked in confusion, \"You know that she followed him to the independent continent?\"","Ye Lan did not understand. \"I know. What about it?\"","Hua Ci couldn’t help but raise her voice. \"The independent continent is different from other places. It’s very unsafe here. There are all kinds of people. It’s dangerous for a little girl like her to come here... Wangchuan shouldn’t have brought her. You should quickly arrange for someone to send her back.\"","On the other end of the line, initially relaxed in the office chair, Ye Lan’s expression turned cold when Hua Ci talked about Qiao Nian. She interrupted her long speech with a gentle but solemn voice. \"Hua Ci, this is Wangchuan’s own business. I have no right to interfere. Do you understand?\"","Originally expressing her disapproval fiercely, upon hearing this, it was as if Hua Ci had been slapped across the face, and her fair face instantly flushed red.","Extremely embarrassed, she gripped her cell phone tightly. \"I... I’m sorry, Aunt Ye.\"","Ye Lan gave her face. \"Your mother entrusted you to me, and I’ve always treated you as my half-daughter. However, you have to understand that what Wangchuan wants to do, nobody in the Ye family, other than the Old Master, can say anything about him. After all, you and Wangchuan are not blood-related; he’s not your biological brother. It’s fine if you usually joke with him, he won’t embarrass you on my account. However, that doesn’t mean he likes others interfering in his private matters. He has a bad temper, and I can’t suppress him sometimes.\"","Ye Lan was just short of saying, \"You’ve crossed the line.\"","However, Hua Ci could understand the meaning between the lines. After realizing what Ye Lan meant, her mind went blank. She was so embarrassed that she wished she could find a hole to hide in. \"I-I’m sorry.\"","Ye Lan roughly understood something. She reminded her ambiguously, \"Nian Nian is someone that even the Old Master likes very much. I like her too. She will be the next mistress of our Ye family in the future. She’s younger than you, so give in to her.\""]},{"number":3707,"title":"Chapter 3707: Whirlwind Face Slap","paragraphs":["Hua Ci’s face lost all color. She didn’t even notice that her nails had dug into her flesh. \"I... understand.\"","Ye Lan pretended nothing had happened and said a few words of concern before hanging up.","Hua Ci hung up mechanically and slid onto the sofa, unable to calm down for a long time.","The girl’s eye-catching and arrogant face appeared in her mind. Hua Ci couldn’t associate Qiao Nian with the next mistress of the Ye family.","Qiao Nian was the next mistress of the Ye family, which meant that she was... Ye Wangchuan’s fiancée!","Hua Ci’s fingers unconsciously curled up.","She had grown up overseas and advocated freedom overseas. She pursued sincere love and looked down on old-fashioned methods of arranged marriages.","She knew that Ye Wangchuan had a fiancée he had been engaged to since he was young, but she had never seen her before and had always pretended this person did not exist.","Now that this person appeared before her, the impact was too great.","It was only at this moment that Hua Ci realized her feelings. In fact, she had a strange feeling for her ’little brother’, whom she had not seen much growing up.","Her expression turned sad. It looked fragile under the light, but she couldn’t help but think that Qiao Nian wasn’t worthy of Ye Wangchuan.","Hua Ci couldn’t control this thought as it gradually expanded in her heart. She grabbed her cell phone, half her face shrouded in shadows, and sent a message to Ye Wangchuan.","She wrote a long paragraph, roughly explaining what had happened tonight. She expressed that she did not know Qiao Nian’s identity at first, but she did not bully her. She hoped that he would not misunderstand. At the end, she casually asked if all the local girls were more sensitive, or if it was easy for girls of this age to misunderstand.","She still used the playful tone that she was always good at. The distance was just right. It was between a friend and a neighbor’s sister.","However, not long after she sent the message, Ye Wangchuan called her.","Hua Ci’s heart beat like a drum. She stood up nervously and pared twice around the room before excitedly accepting the call. \"Hello, Wangchuan.\"","The other end of the call was rather noisy. Ye Wangchuan should be outside.","She was about to say, \"Don’t worry, I’m fine. I just explained to avoid misunderstandings. I really didn’t bully your girlfriend... I don’t know why she didn’t let me bandage her and change her dressing. Why don’t you call her and coax her?\"","Usually, when faced with her half-joking tone, the man could not say anything out of politeness.","Unexpectedly...","Ye Wangchuan’s deep voice carried a layer of frost as he gave a faint warning. \"Since when are you in charge of my matters?\"","\"Wangchuan?\" Hua Ci froze.","Ye Wangchuan’s nonchalant voice continued, \"The Ye family raised you. Since you’ve grown up, you can help do whatever you can. I thought this was a fair deal. However, I’ll be straightforward since you don’t know your place. From now on, you only need to contact my aunt. You’re her old friend’s daughter, and I respect her as an elder. As for others, you don’t have to contact them anymore. Besides my aunt’s private funding, the Ye family will withdraw all your funding!\"","Hua Ci’s eyes widened, and a chill ran down her spine, feeling like she had fallen into an icehouse. She gritted her teeth and gripped her cell phone tightly. \"I didn’t do anything wrong!\""]},{"number":3708,"title":"Chapter 3708: Didn’t My Aunt Tell You? I’m a Protective Person","paragraphs":["\"I know.\" Ye Wangchuan smiled coldly. \"This wouldn’t have been the outcome if you had made a mistake. Didn’t my aunt tell you? I’m a protective person.\"","Hua Ci couldn’t describe her feelings at this moment. It was like the world collapsing, and the humiliation caused every cell in her body to tremble.","Her hands started trembling as she tried to argue. \"Did she complain to you? Did she say something...\"","However, the answer she got was the busy tone. The other party had already hung up.","Hua Ci stood rooted to the ground as if she had been slapped again. Her ears buzzed and her mind went blank.","She fell back onto the sofa and bent down to cover her face, unable to calm down.","What did she do wrong?","She didn’t even have time to say anything about Qiao Nian’s actions. For example, to prevent her from applying the medicine, Qiao Nian shamelessly said she was a doctor.","She was clearly the wronged one, but no one was on her side. It was as if she had become an evil person.","Moreover, Ye Wangchuan’s seemingly casual words that the Ye family would withdraw all her financial support actually had a huge impact.","The few medical projects she was currently working on relied on the Ye family’s funds and resources. In addition, her studio burned tens of millions of yuan every year maintaining the expenses of various medical research and charitable donations... If the Ye family cut her financial assistance, all the work she was doing now would stop.","Ye Lan was indeed good to her.","However, she had only started receiving large sums of money from the Ye family after helping Ye Wangchuan.","The money Ye Lan gave her could only be considered pocket money. It wasn’t enough for her to develop her career.","After a short moment of pain and absent-mindedness, Hua Ci hurriedly contacted Ye Lan and told her the ins and outs of the matter. She endured her shame and asked Ye Lan to help her ask if this was a joke.","Ye Lan didn’t say anything on her account and went to look for Ye Wangchuan.","However, even her reputation was useless this time. Ye Wangchuan was not joking. He had already called and ordered to cut off Hua Ci’s funding.","Although Ye Lan was angry, she knew Hua Ci was hopeless this time.","It was fine if she provoked Ye Wangchuan himself, but since she provoked Qiao Nian... It was hard for her to plead for mercy.","After all, Hua Ci was the daughter her good friend had asked her to take care of. Qiao Nian saved Ye Qichen’s life and cured his leg... She was already dozens of years older and knew who was more important.","In the end, Hua Ci had crossed the line. Moreover, none of them had sensed Hua Ci’s thoughts. Hua Ci also misunderstood her position and ran to Qiao Nian to spout nonsense, even showing her admiration for Ye Wangchuan in front of Qiao Nian.","Ye Lan had no good way to defend her. She looked for Ye Wangchuan twice but did not even see him. She tacitly agreed with his treatment of Hua Ci this time.","She called Hua Ci back and spoke gently. \"...There’s no room for negotiation in this matter. Don’t worry, I promised your Mom I’d take care of you. I’ll still give you the living expenses that I should give you. As for the rest, it’s something outside of life’s necessities to begin with. You’re still young and can work hard on your own.\"","Hua Ci paled when she heard the words ’it’s something outside of life’s necessities to begin with’. It revealed a fig leaf on her dignity.","Ye Lan had already said so much, even if Hua Ci wanted to say something else, she had nothing else to say and could only painfully accept reality.","**","All of this happened in just one night.","Qiao Nian didn’t know.","After Gu San returned and gave her the <anno data-annotation-id=\"f78cd826-1f55-48ce-b34d-423401097707\" data-title=\"cephalosporins\">cephalosporins 1 </anno>, she took two and turned off the lights and her cell phone before going to sleep.","<annotations style=\"display: none;\">antibiotics.</annotations>"]},{"number":3709,"title":"Chapter 3709: Dinner With Me Tonight","paragraphs":["Qiao Nian had not rested well for three days, only taking a nap in the afternoon. In addition, the medicine she took helped her sleep.","Qiao Nian slept until noon the next day.","After waking up, the first thing she did was take a cold shower. After clearing her mind, she dried her hair and went to the computer to finish what she had left unfinished yesterday.","She was investigating Di Xicheng.","Di Xicheng was extremely cunning. Guan Yan was still tracking him down, but Qiao Nian found something interesting.","Continent M had not been peaceful recently.","Ever since the reclusive families listened to Nie Qingru’s orders and went against Beijing on a large scale, several families that mainly focused on business were tortured.","These families were at the bottom of the hierarchy and did not have much say.","They were angry but did not dare to say anything.","However, ever since Nie Qingru started attacking Beijing with the chip business, she had a conflict of interest with the Leonard family, who was in a position of authority.","The Leonard Family was the first to postpone the supply of the Soaring Corporation that Nie Qingru had invested in. Nie Qingru did not retaliate for now. However, yesterday, something unexpected happened on the surface of the seemingly calm waters. An executive of the Leonard family was reported for dirty tricks and was taken away by the prosecutor’s office.","This news was undoubtedly like a thunderclap.","The Leonard family and Nie Qingru worked together to suppress the explosive news, but it still leaked online. Qiao Nian found out about this yesterday.","Di Xicheng did not show his face, but Qiao Nian’s sixth sense told her he was behind this!","She had slept for a while, and the abrasions on her back and elbows were much better. Now, she supported her chin with her hand as she casually leaned back in the chair. Her eyelashes were lowered, and she couldn’t hide the interest in her eyes. \"Interesting.\"","This Di Xicheng could still multitask.","On one hand, he arranged for someone to warn her.","On the other, he stabbed the Leonard family and threatened them back.","Did Nie Qingru acquiesce to such a radical and crazy act?","Qiao Nian was thinking about this when her phone screen lit up.","She picked it up and looked down at it.","It was a hidden number from Continent M.","[The family is divided into two factions. One faction wants to ask the Empress for an explanation, and the other advocates for peace to generate wealth and deliver Fei Teng’s order. The two factions are arguing fiercely now, but they have yet to make a decision.]","Qiao Nian deleted the message.","She knew that Luke was revealing the truth.","However, she was not interested in knowing about the conflict between the Leonard family and Nie Qingru. What she really wanted was to teach Di Xicheng a big lesson.","Knock knock.","The door was knocked before Gu San’s careful voice sounded outside.","\"Miss Qiao, are you still asleep?\"","Qiao Nian finally noticed the time. It was already four in the afternoon.","She stretched her stiff neck. Just as she was about to get up, her cell phone lit up with a call from Zhong Yiliu.","Qiao Nian accepted it. \"Hello.\"","\"Have dinner with me tonight.\" Zhong Yiliu was as energetic as ever. His voice was loud and clear, and it was obvious that he was healthy.","Gu San fell silent, probably noticing she was on a call.","Qiao Nian glanced at the door and thought for a moment. Then, as she walked towards the door, she asked, \"Tonight? With whom?\"","\"A group of medical researchers.\" Zhong Yiliu was extremely frustrated. \"I didn’t want to go at first, but their leader did me a small favor in the past. He repeatedly invited me, and I couldn’t refuse.\""]},{"number":3710,"title":"Chapter 3710: Master Wang’s Roses Were Ignored","paragraphs":["\"You know I don’t like this kind of occasion. If I have to go alone, I might as well stay in the hospital and read a few pharmaceutical research data reports. However, I don’t know anyone else on the independent continent, and I can’t ask Xiao Ji to go with me. So, I can only ask you to accompany me.","\"Do you think I’m good at dealing with unfamiliar people?\" Qiao Nian asked as she placed a hand on the doorknob.","Zhong Yiliu said matter-of-factly, \"We’ll leave after eating. I heard about their project. It happens to be the field of brain surgery that you’re good at. Just treat it as doing me a favor.\"","\"What time?\" Qiao Nian owed him a lot of favors. Of course, she could not refuse.","Zhong Yiliu replied, \"Six o’clock, at the hotel in the city center.\"","Qiao Nian nodded casually. \"Just send me the address. I’ll be there on time.\"","\"Okay.\"","Zhong Yiliu was still busy. After getting her agreement, he hurriedly hung up and went back to work.","Qiao Nian put away her phone and opened the door.","The first thing she saw was a sea of red roses. The gorgeous damask roses covered the corridor. Just by looking at them, she could tell that there were a lot of them.","Gu San, a big man, stood cautiously in the middle of the pile of roses, seemingly video-calling someone. Seeing Qiao Nian open the door, he said with a low voice, \"Miss Qiao is out.\"","Qiao Nian had already guessed what was going on.","Before Gu San could say anything else, she stepped over the roses and walked out. \"I’m going out tonight. I won’t be eating at home.\"","Miss Qiao didn’t see the flowers at the door?","Gu San was stunned. He looked at the girl’s back view as she went down the stairs, not knowing if he should chase after her.","\"Master Wang—\"","He quickly picked up his phone and looked at the man on the screen. \"Should I still hand my phone to Miss Qiao?\"","\"No need. Wait for me to go back.\"","Ye Wangchuan should have just gotten to Beijing. It was nighttime over there. The tall and noble man was wearing a bathrobe and holding a glass as he stood by the window. Water droplets dribbled on his short black hair, and his contours looked even more sexy and charming under the hazy light.","Even Gu San was stunned. He hesitated before saying, \"Miss Qiao must have misunderstood. Why don’t I explain it to her?\"","\"It’s fine. You don’t have to worry about it.\" Ye Wangchuan took a sip of water to moisten his throat, causing his moistened lips to become even more beautiful and red. He smiled patiently. \"This is the first time she’s angry. She’s quite obedient.\"","Gu San glanced at the roses covering the corridor and then at the girl’s back view as she walked away without looking back. She was so valiant.","Where did Master Wang see that she was ’obedient’?","Nothing about this word was related to Miss Qiao.","\"I’ll be back as soon as possible.\" Ye Wangchuan did not explain much. He also knew that Qiao Nian did not actually misunderstand his relationship with Hua Ci.","Gu San replied, \"Okay.\"","**","5:30 P.M.","Qiao Nian left on time.","She asked Gu San to drive her to the hospital to pick up Zhong Yiliu first before going to the agreed location.","The medical organization was treating Zhong Yiliu, so the other party booked a private room.","At six o’clock, the waiter led the way for Qiao Nian and Zhong Yiliu while introducing the place."]},{"number":3711,"title":"Chapter 3711: Let Me Introduce You, This Is Q","paragraphs":["The waiter led them to a large private room that could accommodate two tables, with a recreation area for tea.","However, there was only one table tonight. Cold dishes, wine, and snacks were already served on the big, round table. In addition, everyone from the medical organization was present.","The leader was a middle-aged woman with a buzz cut. She warmly welcomed Zhong Yiliu upon seeing him. \"Boss Zhong, it’s an honor to have you here. Come in, come in.\"","Zhong Yiliu led Qiao Nian in.","The waiter was very observant. After they entered, he closed the door so they would not be disturbed.","Qiao Nian was one step behind Zhong Yiliu, wearing casual clothes and only a round-necked T-shirt under her white cotton suit. She was unafraid of the cold.","She didn’t pay much attention to the others in the private room upon stepping through the door as just casually waited for Zhong Yiliu to exchange pleasantries. During this period, she did not even raise her eyelids, as if she was not interested in such social events.","She was not outgoing.","However, Qiao Nian’s looks were too outstanding and she was young. In addition, she was accompanying Zhong Yiliu. Moreover, it was rare for her not to wear a baseball cap. Her outstanding face was exposed to everyone, so how could they ignore her appearance?","\"Who is this?\"","\"So young.\"","\"I’ve never heard of Elder Zhong having a granddaughter.\"","Zhong Yiliu exchanged simple pleasantries with the middle-aged woman while the others quietly spoke to each other. Their gazes were all attracted by the arrogant-looking girl.","Only one person watched in shock as Qiao Nian entered the private room. Her face was slightly pale, and her knuckles gripped the tablecloth tightly.","... Wasn’t this the person from yesterday?","Hua Ci’s eyes almost popped out. She tried her best to adjust her breathing, not wanting to lose her composure in front of the others.","However, her heart pounded like it had been bombarded into countless pieces. She couldn’t describe how she felt at this moment. Was she more shocked, more suspicious, or something else... She did not want to face it. She wanted to escape this nightmare.","\"You are?\"","Zhong Yiliu also did not like to socialize. The middle-aged woman knew him and naturally understood his temper. After a simple greeting, she shifted the topic to Qiao Nian, who was beside Zhong Yiliu. She sized up her curiously and smiled. \"She’s so young. Could she be your relative?\"","Zhong Yiliu couldn’t hide his pride at the mention of Qiao Nian. \"No. Let me introduce you, she’s Q.\"","He tilted his head and revealed Qiao Nian’s identity to the middle-aged woman. She was one of the founders of a medical organization and was very famous internationally.","Qiao Nian was not interested in these things, but she still nodded and politely said, \"Hello, it’s nice to meet you.\"","The middle-aged woman seemed to have lost her composure from the shock. She stared at Qiao Nian’s face and cried out, \"You’re Q???\"","Of course she knew about Q.","Goddess Q from the Pharmacy Association. She was not from the association, but the few prescriptions left in the library were recognized by Zhong Yiliu’s eldest disciple.","In addition, Q published articles in many top journals.","Her articles were not ordinary research papers used to embellish her resumé. Every article that came out would cause a discussion in the medical field.","She remembered information about Q previously, but for some reason, she could not find it online.","Q was actually so young.","Moreover, she was also in the independent continent."]},{"number":3712,"title":"Chapter 3712: Some People Are Born to Be the Focus","paragraphs":["The middle-aged woman did not hide her surprise as she shook Qiao Nian’s hand and said in a heavier tone, \"I’ve read your article. I’m very interested in the techniques you wrote in the article about brain surgery. I’ve always wanted to discuss these techniques with you. I didn’t expect to meet you here at the end of my life. I’ll take this opportunity to ask for guidance.\"","\"You’re too kind.\"","Qiao Nian’s attitude was good.","The middle-aged woman’s attitude towards Qiao Nian warmed and she invited them to sit. During this period, she mainly asked Zhong Yiliu and Qiao Nian many technical questions.","Qiao Nian mentioned Chinese Medicine, saying there were records of craniotomy in ancient times. Some herbs were natural anesthetics, discovered by Chinese Medicine a long time ago.","The middle-aged woman was mesmerized as she listened. It was as if a door to a new world had been opened. She asked Qiao Nian more about Chinese Medicine.","Qiao Nian was very patient when it came to Chinese Medicine. She answered her every question and also talked about the effects of acupuncture and rehabilitation on stroke and polio.","China’s 5,000-year-old civilization did not happen by random. From Qiao Nian’s mention of craniotomy to acupuncture treatment for stroke and polio...","The more the middle-aged woman listened, the more solemn she became. Halfway through, she even fell into deep thought several times, as if thinking about it.","The others at the table heard everything.","They quickly realized that Qiao Nian was not a random person brought by Zhong Yiliu. She was calm and composed, had a lot of knowledge they did not touch on, and smoothly answered many technical questions... She was someone with true ability.","Hua Ci sat among them. At first, she was worried that she would be embarrassed if Qiao Nian recognized her. But later on, she realized that Qiao Nian did not notice her at all... Then, she noticed that everyone was controlled by the girl’s convincing aura, subconsciously hanging onto Qiao Nian’s every word.","Her expression became complicated.","Qiao Nian did not like to be in the limelight, and her words were not meant for socializing. Instead, she was unrestrained and even carefree.","However, she was like a ray of light among those present. She was the focus of everyone’s attention!","Hua Ci recalled her mocking question yesterday—’Are you a doctor?’","At this moment, as the girl casually told her team leader about skills she was not qualified to come into contact with, she only felt like she had been slapped in a place that no one could see. No one cared, but it was very, very painful.","The guests and hosts enjoyed the meal to the fullest.","After the middle-aged woman finished eating, she still wanted to keep Qiao Nian to continue the discussion. She wanted to ask more.","However, Qiao Nian was not familiar with them. She was not obligated to answer their questions. She was just helping Zhong Yiliu return a small favor.","Therefore, when the other party suggested they go somewhere else to continue the conversation, she used an excuse to refuse.","Zhong Yiliu also suggested returning to the hospital.","Although the middle-aged woman was extremely disappointed, she and the others still politely sent Zhong Yiliu and Qiao Nian out. She thanked Zhong Yiliu again for taking the time to eat with them.","Qiao Nian had helped Zhong Yiliu block most of the disturbance tonight. At this moment, she was no longer interested in listening to the other party’s social interactions. She walked to the side and lowered her head to play with her phone.","At this moment, Hua Ci found an opportunity to approach her. \"Q-Qiao Nian.\""]},{"number":3713,"title":"Chapter 3713: Do You Have to Act One Way in Front of Others and One Way Behind Their Backs?","paragraphs":["Qiao Nian looked up. Looking at the other party, she thought for a second before remembering who she was. She looked away calmly.","\"What’s the matter?\"","Her attitude was cold.","Hua Ci bit her lower lip awkwardly as if she could feel gazes from all directions, especially from her colleagues.","\"You’ve misunderstood.\"","Silence.","Qiao Nian stood casually with one hand in her pocket, her other hand was still holding her cell phone. Hearing this, she raised her black eyebrows and looked at her strangely.","Hua Ci gritted her teeth and made things clear. \"Qiao Nian, I think you’ve misunderstood my relationship with Wangchuan. We’re siblings, not the kind of relationship you think. I didn’t expect you to misunderstand, but since you misunderstood our relationship, I think I have to explain there’s nothing between us.\"","Qiao Nian finally understood why she was speaking to her.","She immediately put away her cell phone and sneered. They were about the same height, but Qiao Nian gave off a condescending pressure. \"Who asked you to explain? Him?\"","Hua Ci was surprised by her attitude.","Ye Wangchuan had a noble status. Even though she had grown up overseas, she knew some people were destined to be different from ordinary people. They were born favored by the heavens. When others spoke to him, they should be careful not to offend him.","She had never thought Qiao Nian would have such an attitude towards Ye Wangchuan.","She thought that even if Qiao Nian had somewhat obtained the Ye family’s recognition, she would still be his little wife.","\"Uh, I... No, it was my idea to explain to you.\" Hua Ci recovered after a short surprise. \"I think you’ve misunderstood...\"","\"I’ve never misunderstood anything, and I’ve never told anyone about you,\" Qiao Nian interrupted. \"If you think I’ve talked about you behind your back, you’re overthinking. I have no ill intentions towards you. I’m not interested.\"","Hua Ci’s face turned pale. She pinched her palms and watched helplessly as the girl walked past her toward Zhong Yiliu. She didn’t know where her courage came from, but she suddenly questioned loudly, \"If you didn’t say anything, why did Aunt Ye and Wangchuan call me? You clearly said something. Why won’t you admit it! I don’t understand why the girls in your country like to do one thing in front of others and another behind their backs. Is there a point?! I’ve already cleared the matter with you. Can’t you openly admit it?\"","Her voice was loud, instantly attracting everyone’s attention.","The middle-aged woman still chatting with Zhong Yiliu turned around upon hearing her teammate’s shout. It seemed like there was a personal conflict.","She was stunned for a moment before quickly looking back at Zhong Yiliu’s expression. \"T-This should be a misunderstanding.\"","Zhong Yiliu’s face was dark, visibly turning cold. \"What kind of misunderstanding requires you to shout at my friend?\"","The middle-aged woman was embarrassed and apologized profusely.","\"I’m not the one you should apologize to!\" However, Zhong Yiliu’s attitude had already turned cold. He shook her off before walking towards Qiao Nian.","...","On the other side, Qiao Nian had already shaken her off and was about to leave, but Hua Ci still shouted at her.","Qiao Nian did not like arguing with people who had lost their minds, but Hua Ci crossed her bottom line.","Qiao Nian stopped and turned around to look at her coldly. \"You want to talk it out in person?\""]},{"number":3714,"title":"Chapter 3714: Sister Nian Slapped Her Face in Front of Everyone","paragraphs":["Hua Ci actually regretted it a little right after. After all, Ye Lan’s warning was still ringing in her ears. In fact, she did not have to talk about them being siblings.","However, there was no reason to take back what she said.","She pursed her lips and met her colleagues’ gazes. \"I just feel that it’s meaningless for you to act one way in front of me and another way behind my back.\"","\"Okay. Let’s do something interesting like you said.\" Qiao Nian walked back and took out her cell phone. After finding a certain someone’s WeChat account, she sent a request for a video call in front of Hua Ci.","The other end picked up almost instantly.","The video call connected, and a handsome man immediately appeared on the screen. His cold eyes were beautiful.","Hua Ci’s heart skipped a beat, and she tried to snatch the cell phone. \"What are you doing?!\"","How could Qiao Nian let her get her cell phone? She evaded her hand before saying to the person on the other end of the video call, \"I mentioned the doctor from yesterday to you?\"","Ye Wangchuan could determine the situation in just a second. His eyebrows twitched, and he looked at Hua Ci coldly as he replied, \"No.\"","\"Alright.\"","Qiao Nian asked him patiently, \"You have an elder sister?\"","Ye Wangchuan chuckled and said helplessly, \"My mother only gave birth to me.\"","\"Oh,\" Qiao Nian replied and told him to hang up first.","After hanging up the video call, she looked up at Hua Ci and asked in a frustrated tone, \"Do you still need me to call Aunt Ye?\"","Hua Ci’s blood turned cold. She was so embarrassed that she wished she could find a hole to hide in. She opened her mouth but was still afraid that Qiao Nian would really hit her. She barely managed to say in a voice as soft as a mosquito, \"No, there’s no need.\"","Qiao Nian raised her eyebrows at her. \"So you understand now that I didn’t say anything about you behind your back?\"","\"I’ve misunderstood you. I’m sorry.\" Hua Ci felt the death by a thousand cuts.","However, Qiao Nian did not accept her apology. \"You don’t have to apologize, and I don’t need your apology. I just want to tell you that foreign education hasn’t made you a better person, and the girls in the country aren’t as inferior as you think. Your so-called freedom and passion are built on pretending to be superior and thinking about other people’s boyfriends. No matter where you go to educate yourself, it won’t change your character.\"","These words were indeed harsh!","Moreover, she spoke in front of so many people.","Even Zhong Yiliu was shocked.","Qiao Nian had a cold personality, but she had always been tolerant of the elderly and women. It was rare for her to be so sharp and not give them face.","Qiao Nian did not look at Hua Ci’s pale face. She turned around to leave but then paused and said coldly, \"My boyfriend doesn’t have an elder sister. Please don’t act like a sister next time. He’ll be willing to ignore you if I ask. But I didn’t do that. I feel that liking someone isn’t wrong, and I’ve never thought of trampling on anyone’s feelings. If you trample on it yourself, your liking will really be worthless!\"","She did not say anything else.","She walked to Zhong Yiliu’s side and patted his shoulder. \"Let’s go.\"","\"Okay.\"","Actually, Hua Ci was an outstanding woman, so in the end, even Zhong Yiliu could tell that behind Qiao Nian’s stern appearance, she maintained a tolerance for those of the same sex. At the very least, she had no intention of humiliating Hua Ci.","He only hoped that Hua Ci could reflect on Qiao Nian’s last words and on what she had done wrong.","Zhong Yiliu turned around and looked at Hua Ci, who was still stunned. He shook his head and sighed before leaving with Qiao Nian."]},{"number":3715,"title":"Chapter 3715: Master Wang Avenges Sister Nian","paragraphs":["In the car.","Qiao Nian’s temples hurt as she leaned against the window, not wanting to speak.","Zhong Yiliu sat in the front passenger seat. Turning around and seeing her frustrated expression, he considerately did not try to speak to her and let her rest.","Gu San sent Zhong Yiliu back to the hospital first.","After watching his back disappear at the entrance, he turned the car around and asked the girl in the backseat, \"Miss Qiao, are we going back?\"","\"Mm.\"","Qiao Nian had already adjusted her mood. She took out her cell phone from her pocket and played two games. She was just as she was about to start the third round.","Qiao Nian opened the window and rested her elbows as the night wind slipped through her fingers. \"What’s wrong?\"","\"You haven’t eaten?\" Guan Yan probably asked because she had returned to the villa.","Qiao Nian looked at the intersection. \"We’re going back soon.\"","Guan Yan nodded and immediately mentioned it to her. \"Did you see the news?\"","\"What news?\" Qiao Nian was eating and did not have time to check her cell phone. Previously, she had been playing games for a while. In addition, she did not usually check the news, so she really did not know what news Guan Yan was talking about.","\"Eh, he didn’t tell you?\" Guan Yan sounded very surprised.","Qiao Nian’s eyes moved. She felt that the person she was talking about was Ye Wangchuan.","Before she could ask, Guan Yan said, \"While you were eating, there was a shooting at the entrance of the Smith Bank building. One person was injured, but the culprit was not caught.\"","Such accidents often happened in Continent M, and the news stopped reporting them.","Qiao Nian knew that since Guan Yan had specially mentioned this, there must be more.","\"The shooting isn’t the main point. The main point is... I’ve been investigating Di Xicheng’s whereabouts, right? So I’ve hired two groups of people. One to track down Di Xicheng’s whereabouts, and the other to keep an eye on Nie Qingru. You know their relationship, so I thought I might find something. In the end, I really found something. Not long after the shooting, Nie Qingru rushed to the hospital to visit the victim. She deliberately kept a low profile.\"","Guan Yan voiced her guess. \"Do you think the victim is Di Xicheng, whom we’ve been looking for?\"","Moreover, she felt that it was not an accident that Di Xicheng was suddenly shot in the street. It was very likely done by the protective Young Master Ye.","After all, Sun had almost been tricked a few days ago and had even suffered a small injury. In the blink of an eye, something had happened in Continent M. It couldn’t have been this coincidental.","That was why Guan Yan was so surprised when Qiao Nian said she didn’t know.","\"I don’t know.\" Qiao Nian really did not know. Her guess was similar to Guan Yan’s. She glanced at Gu San driving in front. \"I’m hanging up first.\"","Guan Yan muttered, \"Then come back quickly. I’ll wait for you here.\"","Qiao Nian hung up and put down her cell phone. She looked at the person in the driver’s seat and thought for a moment before asking, \"He’s the one behind the incident in Continent M?\"","Gu San happened to stop the car at the red light. Hearing Qiao Nian’s question, he sincerely said, \"I don’t know, Miss Qiao. I’ve been staying with you. I’m only responsible for your safety.\"","Qiao Nian did not say anything else.","However, she could tell from what Gu San said that he at least knew about this, so the probability of Ye Wangchuan being behind it was very high.","He avenged her?","Qiao Nian couldn’t describe her feelings. Her heart felt like it had been bitten by an ant, and a numbing feeling spread throughout her entire body. She covered her chest, feeling her heartbeat thumping against her palm, again and again, powerful and reliable..."]},{"number":3716,"title":"Chapter 3716: Nie Qingru Is About to Go Crazy","paragraphs":["Qiao Nian suddenly understood how Qiao Chen felt whenever she saw Fu Ge standing up for her. It was the feeling of being protected.","Even if she didn’t need anyone to protect her, that person always stood up for her. The unhappiness from before dissipated and became less important.","Qiao Nian thought before picking up her phone to call someone. \"Hello, didn’t you say you wanted to return the favor? Do me a favor.\"","**","Outside the emergency room in the hospital, Continent M.","Nie Qingru walked out of the emergency room with an ashen face. The lingering smell of blood still stimulated her nerves, reminding her of the past.","Shadow said goodbye to the doctor and walked over, observing her carefully. \"Empress, are you alright? You look very pale.\"","Nie Qingru held onto the railing with closed eyes.","Shadow saw that she did not look too good. \"The doctor said that Young Master Di is only injured. The bullet needs to be taken out of his shoulder. It will not be life-threatening. He just needs to rest for a few days.\"","Di Xicheng had only been shot in the shoulder, so his injuries were not serious. Furthermore, the other party had no intention of taking his life. After taking the shot, he immediately ran away.","When their men ran to the building opposite at the sniping spot, they only found a floor full of cigarette butts. The cigarette butts had been carefully burned, leaving no information behind.","\"The other party has no intention of taking Young Master Di’s life,\" Shadow said honestly.","However, his words stimulated Nie Qingru’s already fragile nerves. She raised her head almost neurotically, her red eyes murderous. \"If she wants Xicheng’s life, can I only watch helplessly?\"","\"Empress...\" Shadow’s breathing stopped. He reached out to touch her, but he had no choice but to lower his head. \"Young Master Di is not that person.\"","He wanted to tell Nie Qingru that that person died a long time ago.","He had been dead for decades.","However, he did not dare to say it.","He only vaguely mentioned it, but Nie Qingru’s reaction was as if she had been provoked. \"If it were him, I would have cut that evil creature into a thousand pieces! No, I should have done this long ago. I should have killed her long ago without caring about the consequences. As long as she dies, all the troubles will be resolved, and there will be nothing to worry about.\"","The veins on Nie Qingru’s forehead bulged as if she had made up her mind. \"Go contact...\"","Shadow was afraid she would do something irreversible on impulse, so he quickly interrupted her. \"Empress, Qiao Nian can die, but she can’t die suddenly. Otherwise, we won’t be able to answer to Continent F, the First Research Institute, and the illegal district.\"","Nie Qingru glared as if she wanted to eat him alive.","Shadow stood firm, refusing to back down.","Fortunately, Nie Qingru quickly controlled her emotions and said in a low voice, \"I really can’t take it anymore.\"","Shadow looked at her again and did not say anything.","He knew Nie Qingru’s bottom line.","If the Empress cared about benefits and power the most, then there was someone who was above these two things. It was just that that person had died too long ago.","Di Xicheng was not that person.","Shadow felt he was not worthy of what Nie Qingru had risked to get for him.","\"Young Master Di is fine.\" Shadow only said this.","The little crow’s feet at the corners of Nie Qingru’s eyes became more prominent. She was silent for a moment before sneering. \"I know. I just think I’ve endured enough!\"","This time, she made up her mind. \"Find out who’s behind it. I won’t let Qiao Nian off if she’s behind it!\"","\"Yes, Your Majesty.\"","Before leaving, Shadow’s subordinates rushed over to report. \"Empress, Boss, the people from the Leonard family are here.\""]},{"number":3717,"title":"Chapter 3717: Looking for Di Xicheng","paragraphs":["Nie Qingru still had not sorted out her emotions. \"What are they doing here?\"","Shadow looked at her before lowering his head to stare at the tip of his leather shoes. He did not say anything.","Nie Qingru pinched the space between her eyebrows and suppressed the haze in her eyes before saying in a deep voice, \"Let them come.\"","The people from the Leonard family quickly arrived, with one young man among a group of old men in their sixties and seventies. It was Luke, who had grown up with Leonard.","Luke greeted Shadow and tactfully walked to the corner to stand next to him as background.","Shadow observed him solemnly. Luke did not show any abnormalities, so Shadow looked away in confusion.","\"Empress, we heard about a small accident outside Smith Bank.\" The old man in the lead was the first to break the silence. \"We specially came over to take a look.\"","\"Thank you for your hard work. He’s fine and is still being bandaged inside.\" Nie Qingru nodded, as noble and arrogant as ever.","The old man did not mind. He looked in the direction she was looking and suddenly asked meaningfully, \"Does the Empress know the person who was shot this time?\"","Nie Qingru stared at him. \"What’s the meaning of this? Are you questioning me?\"","The old man did not act arrogantly. He hurriedly bowed and apologized. \"Of course, I have no intention of doubting the Empress. It’s just... we’ve found the identity of the person who reported us behind the scenes.\"","\"Oh?\" Nie Qingru’s heart raced.","The old man met her gaze. \"Coincidentally, it’s the young man who was shot this time.\"","Nie Qingru immediately narrowed her eyes, her face expressionless. She only reminded him indifferently, \"Have you investigated thoroughly? Don’t be used by others.\"","She had been in a high position for decades and was very oppressive.","The old man was affected but still straightened his back and smiled. \"Empress, we wouldn’t have come to you without evidence.\"","They were asking for him?","Nie Qingru did not have the time to sneer.","The old man continued coldly, \"An hour ago, we found that our account book had been stolen. We can’t be sure when it was stolen because all the surveillance cameras have been destroyed. The technicians haven’t been able to recover the data yet. However, that account book contains all the income and expenditure of our various factories worldwide this year. In other words... the reported accounts are also recorded on it. Moreover, this account book can be used as the most primitive evidence.\"","Nie Qingru felt as if she was being choked by an invisible hand. Her expression kept changing. \"You mean...\"","She felt that Di Xicheng was not that insensible.","However, she couldn’t be 100% sure. At this juncture, it was too ambiguous. Only Di Xicheng was the most suspicious.","These elders of the Leonard family obviously thought so. The old man’s tone was rude. \"Empress, we’re all members of the reclusive families. If we have any conflicts in private, we can discuss them in private. We don’t need to discuss if we’re right or wrong about the matter we reported previously. However, the theft of the account book has already crossed our bottom line! Regardless of whether this matter is brought out or discussed here, we definitely want an explanation. And the account book... We must get it back!\"","Nie Qingru was well aware of how important the account book of a large family was. She also knew the severity of the matter. She could only purse her lips and endure the other party’s criticism.","\"His wounds are still being bandaged, and he’s not conscious. I’ll give you an explanation when he’s awake.\""]},{"number":3718,"title":"Chapter 3718: Nie Qingru Wasn’t Even Sure It Was Di Xicheng","paragraphs":["\"We can wait...\" The old man was unwilling to relent.","Nie Qingru’s face was as cold as ice. \"You mean you don’t trust me anymore?\"","These words were a few degrees colder.","The elders from the Leonard family did not look too good either. No one would be happy to have an important account book stolen from them. Moreover, the other party had reported them, causing them to be overwrought... If it weren’t for Nie Qingru, they wouldn’t have come to talk today. Instead, they would have directly arrested him.","At this moment, Luke stopped the old man trying to confront Nie Qingru. \"Uncle, don’t be angry. Let’s trust the Empress this time.\"","The old man heaved a sigh of relief, as if he had found a way out. He looked indifferently at Nie Qingru, no longer as polite and respectful as before. \"In short, this account book is very important to us. I hope the Empress will take it to heart and give us an explanation as soon as possible.\"","\"Of course.\"","After agreeing, Nie Qingru replied indifferently, \"It’s still not certain my people took your account book. I only agreed to help ask. If it turns out not to be him, I won’t be able to manage your family matters. I can only trouble you to work harder to find out how you lost the account book!\"","\"Hmph!\" The old man snorted coldly. Then, he waved his hand and said to the others behind him, \"Let’s go!\"","Luke politely bade goodbye to Nie Qingru before following them.","Shadow walked closer. \"Empress, why do I feel that something is amiss?\"","\"Of course I know it’s unlikely, but at this time...\" She was extremely annoyed and said in a low voice, \"I’ll ask him.\"","**","In the treatment room.","The doctor had already treated the man and was exhorting him to take note.","Nie Qingru smelled the blood in the room. Looking to the side, she saw the bloody bullets, scissors, and tweezers on the tray.","Moreover, with his jacket off, Di Xicheng revealed the bulletproof vest underneath.","The angle of the shot was very tricky. It hit where the bulletproof vest could not cover. If it had moved an inch forward, it would have crippled his arm.","Of course, the other party did not deliberately let him off. Instead, Di Xicheng realized the danger and dodged 0.001 seconds in advance, avoiding his arm from being crippled.","That shot missed the joint on his left shoulder and barely saved his arm.","The doctor did not give him anesthesia according to his request. He did not make a sound throughout, as if he did not know pain and endured it numbly.","However, the sweat on his forehead and the pale color of his lips betrayed that he was not a blockhead who did not know pain. In fact, he endured pain that no ordinary person could tolerate.","\"Don’t let the wound get wet for the next few days. Also, try to use this arm as little as possible...","\"Avoid spice, tobacco, alcohol, etc.","\"Rest early. Don’t tire yourself. Come every three days to change the dressing until the wound scabs over.\"","\"Okay.\"","Di Xicheng’s voice was hoarse.","Nie Qingru walked in from behind him. Seeing this scene, most of her anger dissipated, and an indescribable frustration rose in her heart.","Just as she clenched her fists, Di Xicheng suddenly turned around and saw her. His eyes flashed, and he barely managed to call out, \"Auntie.\""]},{"number":3719,"title":"Chapter 3719: Of Course It’s Your Sister Nian","paragraphs":["Nie Qingru’s tense nerves were stirred again. She didn’t even notice her anger had already subsided as she walked over and asked, \"Are you alright?\"","\"The doctor said I need to recuperate.\" Di Xicheng picked up his jacket with his right hand and was about to put it on.","Nie Qingru grabbed his jacket with a frown. \"You’re already injured. Why are you still moving around?!\"","She did not go overboard and called out coldly, \"Shadow.\"","The man following her walked over and took the jacket from her. He silently draped them over Di Xicheng’s shoulders and pushed them aside.","Nie Qingru’s gaze swept across Di Xicheng’s face, which was 50% similar to the person in her memory. She pressed a hand between her eyebrows. \"Xicheng, let me ask you. Did you get someone to take the Leonard family’s account book?\"","While Shadow was putting on the jacket, Di Xicheng was thinking about the one responsible for his injury. Upon hearing this, he was stunned for a moment. \"What account book?\"","\"You don’t know?\" Nie Qingru was the one stunned this time. She observed his expression before saying, \"The Leonard family just came over and said their account book was missing. You also know that this is a sensitive time. Their account is the best evidence to report...\"","\"I didn’t take it,\" Di Xicheng said firmly. \"I’m not that rash. I was indeed the one who reported them. But I just wanted to give them a warning. It’s hard for you to do it, so I did it. However, I didn’t touch their account book... I know what can be touched and what can’t be touched. Once I touch the account, I’ll have crossed the bottom line.\"","Nie Qingru saw that he did not appear to be lying, and her expression gradually became serious. \"If you didn’t do it, then who did?\"","The Leonard family was no small family that anyone could just sneak into.","Not to mention finding such an important account book and successfully taking it away, even destroying the surveillance cameras along the way.","She believed in Di Xicheng’s ability, and that’s why she didn’t strongly deny it when the Leonard family accused him.","But now, Di Xicheng denied it.","So who did it?","Di Xicheng’s eyes darkened. \"Qiao Nian.\"","Nie Qingru looked at him in astonishment. \"Her?\"","She immediately denied it. \"Impossible! How did she do it in such a short time? Continent M is not her territory. She can’t do it so easily.\"","If Qiao Nian could sneak into the Leonard family’s nest and steal such an important account book without anyone knowing, she wouldn’t have almost lost her life to enter her vault.","Di Xicheng thought of a possibility. \"Is it possible that someone from the Leonard family helped her?\"","Nie Qingru looked at him strangely. \"Do you know what you’re talking about? Someone who has access to the account book must have a high status. Why would that person help her? This is not a small favor. Moreover, it involves the family’s interests...\"","Di Xicheng didn’t care. \"As long as that account book is not circulated, it will not harm the family’s interests! It will only indirectly cause them to go against us.\"","Nie Qingru fell into deep thought.","Di Xicheng was even more certain that his guess was right. \"They’re after me!\"","Until now, he still couldn’t be sure if the sniper and the stolen account book were the same people or two different groups.","However, whether it was all part of the same group or two groups, they had cleverly trapped him this time."]},{"number":3720,"title":"Chapter 3720: Master Wang Finally Knows to Send Sister Nian a Message","paragraphs":["After all, Di Xicheng was not an ordinary person. In the blink of an eye, his pale lips curled in a smile. \"Aunt, I have an idea.\"","**","On the other side.","After sending the elders off, Luke entered the SUV before taking out his phone and sending a message.","Within half a minute, the person on the other end replied to him.","[Q: Thanks.]","Looking at the message for half a second, Luke narrowed his eyes and deleted it without hesitation. He emptied the trash can, took out his SIM card, and broke it before throwing it out of the window.","He changed his phone number and turned it on again. His cell phone was so quiet that it was as if he had not contacted anyone.","Only now did he start the car. Before stepping on the accelerator, he looked at the account book hidden in the car. His eyes darkened an inch. He put the account book away, grabbed the steering wheel with both hands, stepped on the pedal, turned the car around, and left the parking lot.","He was the one who took the account book.","However, he agreed with Qiao Nian that he would not publicize it. Qiao Nian wouldn’t look at it, either. The account book was with him to begin with. After a while, it would be ’coincidentally’ found...","After doing this, he would completely repay the favor he owed the girl back then. From then on, he would have a clear conscience and have nothing to do with her.","Luke knew what he did was a little unfair to his family, but which family did not have dirty thoughts?","Back then, when Elder Leo suddenly died, not many people in the family were willing to investigate the real culprit. In fact, when they found out the culprit was closely related to the Empress, all of them became deaf and blind for the sake of benefits, almost causing Elder Leo to die unjustly.","Therefore, he only did this to give those people, including the Empress, a little payback!","The black SUV disappeared from the road like an arrow leaving the bow.","**","Qiao Nian received Luke’s message, telling her he no longer owed her a favor.","She deleted the message and blocked the number. Then, she turned on her computer and erased all traces of her contact with Luke.","The girl had just closed her laptop when her gaze landed on her cell phone, which had yet to light up.","She was waiting for Ye Wangchuan to contact her.","Di Xicheng had been shot in the afternoon. Until now, he had not contacted her or even mentioned this.","She waited until the next morning. After waking up, it was almost 9:30 am when she received the message from Beijing.","[Y: Still angry?]","Qiao Nian had just finished her breakfast. Without him around, Gu San did not dare to prepare milk for her. That was mainly because she would not drink it anyway.","She held the Evian bottle in her hand and looked down at her cell phone in her other hand at the short sentence in the dialog box.","\"Tsk.\"","Qiao Nian flattened the bottle and threw it into the trash can, then impatiently looked up and said to the person on the sofa, \"I’m not playing anymore.\"","\"Ah, Sister Qiao, you’re not coming?\" Qin Si got her to play games. They had only played one round and were waiting for the second round. He craned his neck indignantly.","Guan Yan happened to come out at this time. She kicked him and took out her cell phone. \"What game? I’ll play with you for a while.\"","Qin Si had always valued his lover over his friends. He immediately abandoned Qiao Nian and introduced the game to Guan Yan. He told her how to download it and create an account.","They were quite harmonious while playing, chatting the entire time.","Qiao Nian took a deep breath and suppressed her surging frustration. Then, she grabbed her cell phone expressionlessly and prepared to go upstairs to change."]},{"number":3721,"title":"Chapter 3721: Sister Qiao Doesn’t Look Angry","paragraphs":["It was nearing the end of winter.","The independent continent was getting colder by the day.","Qiao Nian was wearing a knitted sweater and a camel-colored woolen coat. She was also carrying the ever-present black shoulder bag.","She went down from the second floor and greeted Gu San, telling him she was going to the First Research Institute.","Gu Yan waited for the girl’s back to disappear at the entrance before putting down her cell phone and lifting the chestnut curly hair beside her ear. Her long and peach blossom eyes narrowed as she bumped Qin Si’s chest with her fist and gossiped in a low voice, \"What’s wrong with Young Master Ye? He hasn’t coaxed her yet. I think Sun is still angry.\"","Qin Si had just told Zhang Yang and the others that he invited his girlfriend to play a round and asked them to give him the limelight so he could impress her. Hearing this, he did not look up and said slowly, \"Sister Qiao isn’t angry. I think she’s fine. She’s eating and drinking as usual, doesn’t look angry at all.\"","Guan Yan stared at him for a few seconds as if looking at a fool. She realized that Qin Si was quite serious and that these were his real thoughts.","She was speechless. \"You’ve been in so many relationships. Who did you date?\"","\"Huh?\" Qin Si looked up. He was still immersed in the excitement of leading her to kill in the canyon later. His eyes were blank, and he did not react for a moment.","Guan Yan slapped him with the cell phone and stood up speechlessly. \"I’m not playing anymore.\"","Qin Si pulled her back. \"What? Didn’t you just say you wanted to play with me?\"","Why did she not want to play anymore?","Guan Yan glanced at him from the corner of her eye. After confirming he still didn’t know, she pursed her cherry lips and looked at him fully. \"I used to think that you were the popular guy. Tsk, I’ve misjudged you.\"","What?","Guan Yan flipped her hair and said in a deafening voice, \"Other popular guys rely on their skills, but you...\"","Qin Si’s eyelids twitched. He was a little angry. \"What about me?\"","Guan Yan replied expressionlessly, \"You rely on your background.\"","If Qin Si had not reincarnated well enough, he really would not have been able to get this far. His ability to read body language was not even as good as the dogs on the roadside. It would be strange if he could find a girlfriend.","He had been the center of attention since he was young. He was good-looking and could play around. He was a born young master.","Qin Si’s head hurt, but he still couldn’t understand what she meant.","The beautiful and flamboyant woman covered half her eyes with one hand and sighed as if she had been deceived. \"So I played with an innocent boy.\"","The innocent boy, Qin Si, was speechless.","Thank you!","Guan Yan dropped her hand. Then, she thought of something and stared at him with a burning gaze. She wished she could stare at him until he turned into a flower. Qin Si felt his blood run cold. At the same time, she said faintly, \"Then... let me ask you a question... Don’t tell me you’re still that?\"","\"That?\"","Qin Si swore that he did not hear anything at first. He met the woman’s overly beautiful peach blossom eyes in confusion.","He didn’t know where the thought came from, but he suddenly reacted. His ears reddened, and he bounced up. \"Damn!\"","\"Are you still a woman? Why would you ask such a question? Is this a suitable question to ask in the living room?\" His words were half-baked, but his burning reaction was not fake.","Guan Yan got her answer. She sighed and turned around. \"I’m going back to my room to calm down.\""]},{"number":3722,"title":"Chapter 3722: I’m Not Just Playing","paragraphs":["No matter how slow Qin Si was, he could tell he was being despised!","Even though he did not understand why he was being despised for not having had his first time, he immediately threw down his cell phone and chased after her.","\"And you?\"","Silence.","\"You just asked me. You haven’t said anything about yourself.\"","Silence.","Guan Yan was already inside her room and trying to close the door. However, Qin Si was smart and placed one foot in the crack, trying to squeeze in.","\"And you?\"","\"I...\" She couldn’t say that her ex-boyfriends had contributed to her image as a scumbag.","Guan Yan met those burning, flamboyant, frank, and clean eyes. The lie she was about to blurt out was stuck in her throat for some reason and turned against her will. \"It has nothing to do with you.\"","Qin Si still blocked the door. His handsome face was quite serious as he blocked the door and looked at her, saying in a low voice, \"The past isn’t important. I don’t care. What I want is the path we’ll walk and the things we’ll experience in the future... These are the most important things in life.\"","Guan Yan’s heart was struck, and she looked at him in a daze.","Qin Si did not avoid her gaze. He looked at her seriously, his eyes filled with sincerity, like raging waves in the blue sea.","Guan Yan exhaled. She had lost. \"We’ll talk about it when the time comes.\"","In the past, she had always said that it was just for fun.","There was no need to be responsible.","This time, she did not use \"we’re just playing\" to define this relationship. It was already a pleasant surprise for Qin Si.","He did not try to press her. He took a small step back so Guan Yan could close the door.","However, before she did, he muttered softly, \"Master Wang met Sister Qiao at 25 years old. The old tree bloomed, and he doted on her so much.","\"Although I didn’t know what love was in the past, from the moment I saw you, my heart couldn’t deceive me. Guan Yan, think about it carefully. I’m not just playing around.\"","**","Qiao Nian finished her first experiment at almost six in the afternoon and obtained the data of the reactor.","She jotted down the data and was about to re-do it to calibrate and see if the data was consistent.","Unexpectedly, Xu Yi, staying up late with her, took off his white coat and walked over with it draped over his arm, saying apologetically, \"My mother has caught a cold recently, and her health isn’t good. I have to leave early to take care of her. I’m sorry, I can’t work overtime these few days.\"","Qiao Nian paused before asking, \"Does Auntie need to go to the hospital? I have a friend in the hospital who can treat Auntie.\"","Xu Yi smiled. His indifferent eyes were like melting icebergs, breathtaking. \"Your friend is Master Zhong, right?\"","\"Mm,\" Qiao Nian replied.","Xu Yi smiled before hanging his white coat and saying, \"My mother only has a small cold. She’ll be fine after recuperating.\"","\"Are you sure?\" Qiao Nian looked at him.","Xu Yi turned around and said helplessly, \"If I let the President of the Pharmacy Association treat my Mom’s cold, I’ll drown in people’s saliva if word gets out.\"","Zhong Yiliu was famous. Many people spent a lot of money and still were not able to meet him.","Xu Yi did not exaggerate.","\"You’re my friend, and Auntie is my elder. Elder Zhong is my friend, but he’s also a teacher. We all know each other, so there’s no need to be particular about that.\"","Qiao Nian was tired. Her fair skin and white coat accentuated her exquisite facial features. She was very eye-catching.","\"If that bothers you, I can take a look at Auntie myself.\""]},{"number":3723,"title":"Chapter 3723: Master Wang Is Finally Here","paragraphs":["Xu Yi could tell she really wanted to help. He rubbed his eyebrows and faced the girl seriously. \"My mother just has a small cold. There’s no need to go through so much trouble.\"","He paused and explained, \"I’m not being polite.\"","Qiao Nian met his gaze and saw he was serious. She turned away and said, \"Then you don’t have to come to the laboratory for the next few days. I’ll help you apply for leave from the dean and the rest. Stay at home and accompany Auntie.\"","Xu Yi looked at her thin shoulders. He knew she had always wanted to break through that complicated experiment. He opened his mouth and was about to say that he could hold on a little longer.","Turning around and seeing he was still there, Qiao Nian stared at him in surprise before remembering something. \"Wait for me.\"","She went to the locker and took out a transparent glass bottle containing seven or eight brandless white pills from her shoulder bag.","Qiao Nian handed him the glass bottle. \"This is for you. Hand it to Auntie.\"","Xu Yi took it. \"This is...\"","\"Health supplements,\" the girl said casually. \"Tell Auntie to take one a month. There are not many. I’ll try to get more for her next time.\"","Xu Yi thought of something and opened his mouth.","Qiao Nian beat him to it. \"You’ve helped me so much. If you’re even going to argue with me about such a small gift, I’ll find someone else to help.\"","Xu Yi gripped the glass bottle tightly, unable to control his emotions. He watched as she casually put the shoulder bag back into the locker.","Actually, he wanted to say that she had helped him a lot back then. She was the one who pulled him out of the dark abyss.","However, he was not good at expressing himself and could not say it out loud.","In the end, Xu Yi only put away the glass bottle and stubbornly said, \"Three days. I’ll stay home to take care of my mother for three days. I’ll come to the laboratory on time in three days.\"","\"Okay.\"","Qiao Nian had already sat in front of the computer again, recording the data. Hearing this, she raised her chin slightly, but her gaze did not move away from the screen.","Xu Yi saw that she was immersed in her work and did not disturb her anymore. He grabbed his things and tiptoed out.","He opened the door to see a man leaning against the wall with his head lowered, looking at his cell phone.","The man was wearing a black windbreaker and a thin sweater of the same color. His hair was messy, and his lips were red.","It was obvious that he had rushed back from overseas and had not had the time to rest.","The other party seemed to have sensed his gaze. He looked up and met his gaze. His face was not inferior to Qiao Nian’s.","Ye Wangchuan.","This person’s name appeared in Xu Yi’s mind. He nodded expressionlessly and left without looking back.","Ye Wangchuan looked at his back. He thought of something, and a deep meaning flashed across his eyes. He seemed a little frustrated, but he did not show any other emotions. He just put his hand in his pocket and quietly looked at the closed laboratory door, waiting for the girl to come out.","**","Qiao Nian did not know that the person who had sent her a message in the morning to ask if she was still angry was already waiting for her in the corridor outside the laboratory in the afternoon.","She recorded the experiment’s result according to her own rhythm before completing another experiment alone, recording the results again."]},{"number":3724,"title":"Chapter 3724: I’m Quite Happy That You’re Angry","paragraphs":["When everything was over, she glanced sideways and saw that it was already 9:30 PM in the bottom right corner of the screen.","It was so late...","Qiao Nian rubbed the back of her neck, got up, booted off the computer, and prepared to leave.","She took off her lab coat and picked up her jacket, not forgetting to turn on her cell phone to see if there were any new messages.","In the end, besides Gu San and Qin Si asking her if she was coming for dinner, there was no other message.","Qiao Nian clicked on the profile picture on the top with her fingertips. Their dialog box was still at 9 AM when Ye Wangchuan asked her if she was still angry.","It was rare for her to frown. She thought before putting her phone into her pocket. She took her things and opened the door.","The temperature at night was very low.","Many people from the First Research Institute had already left.","However, the incandescent light in the corridor was still on, illuminating the way as brightly as day.","Her eyesight was good. She saw the man leaning against the wall almost at a glance, and her gaze met his.","Ye Wangchuan walked over the moment he met her gaze, naturally taking the bag from her. \"I waited too long for you. My cell phone ran out of battery, so I didn’t send you a message.\"","Qiao Nian could tell he was wearing the same jacket after leaving Beijing. It was thin and outlined his shoulders.","She stood still temporarily, but her brows were furrowed.","Ye Wangchuan smiled. He held her bag in one hand and naturally intertwined his fingers with hers with the other.","\"Sorry I’m late.\"","Silence.","Ye Wangchuan seemed to see through her thoughts. He felt helpless and a little impulsive. \"I wanted to surprise you, but it seems there’s only shock.\"","\"How long have you been waiting outside?\" Qiao Nian finally spoke, tilting her head to look at him.","A pair of clear eyes reflected his eyebrows. He was very good-looking.","Seeing himself in her eyes, the anger in Ye Wangchuan’s heart dissipated. He smiled. He had never thought of being an unknown hero. \"Six hours.\"","Qiao Nian’s pupils constricted.","\"I rushed over when I landed at four in the afternoon. I thought you would finish at six, so I waited outside... Who knew you would only come out now?\"","Qiao Nian’s fingers twitched. There did not seem to be much emotion on her face, but in fact, her blood was flowing faster. \"You could have come in.\"","Ye Wangchuan suddenly lowered his head. His breathing was close to hers, and his long eyelashes seemed to sweep across her face. They flickered. \"Aren’t you still angry with me? I’m here to apologize to you. Of course, I’ll have to be sincere.\"","Qiao Nian could see his flawless skin and his striking face up close. She opened her mouth and was about to retort.","However, he suddenly lowered his head and kissed her.","A kiss and a breath intertwined, as if he had thought about it for a long time.","Only when Qiao Nian’s breathing was disrupted did he slowly leave her a little space. \"I missed you.\"","In just a short sentence, he had crossed an ocean and more than 10 hours of flying distance.","Qiao Nian’s heart skipped a beat. His forehead was pressed against hers, and her breathing became warm. A faint, minty fragrance lingered on her body.","She heard a soft, seductive laugh.","\"Nian Nian, although you’re angry, I want to say that I’m quite happy. Because you... actually got angry.\"","\"What’s there to be happy about if I’m angry?\" Qiao Nian retorted."]},{"number":3725,"title":"Chapter 3725: Master Wang Coaxes His Wife","paragraphs":["Ye Wangchuan looked at her enchantingly and pressed his forehead against hers. \"What do you think?\"","Qiao Nian’s heart felt like it had been burned as she met his gaze. She pushed him away without a trace. \"Stand properly.\"","\"Phew.\"","Ye Wangchuan chuckled and stood up lazily. \"Nian Nian, I’m back.\"","Thud, thud, thud.","Qiao Nian’s heart was brushed by an invisible feather again. It was a very gentle and soothing moment, but it was impossible to ignore its existence.","Her heart beat strongly, and the discomfort from before dissipated.","Qiao Nian’s left hand was still being held. She felt his warmth through her skin when her fingers were clenched tightly.","\"Why did you come back so suddenly?\"","\"It’s not sudden.\"","Ye Wangchuan paused and looked at her with his seductive eyes. \"My girlfriend is angry, so I came back early.\"","He even specially squeezed the girl’s slender fingers. He looked at her lazily and asked in an intoxicating voice, \"Nian Nian, are you still angry?\"","Qiao Nian’s pinky was pinched. She was indescribably frustrated. \"I’m not angry. I’m just a little annoyed.\"","She wouldn’t be angry because of Hua Ci or suspect that he had an ambiguous relationship with her.","She just felt that Hua Ci’s actions were a little annoying.","Ye Wangchuan observed her expression and saw that Qiao Nian was being honest. She did not misunderstand him. His eyebrows relaxed, and he smiled. \"I was wrong.\"","Qiao Nian glanced at him. What was he doing?","He met her gaze and smiled, looking noble and proud. \"I admit my mistake.\"","Qiao Nian pursed her lips as he placed an arm on her shoulder and pulled her over. The man apologized kindly, as if coaxing her. \"Since I admit my mistake and have a good attitude, and it’s my first time committing a crime, Goddess Qiao, you’re magnanimous. Forgive me this once? Don’t be angry anymore... Hmm?\"","In the end, his slightly raised voice was like a small hook carrying a dark and hoarse tone. It was like the wind blowing across the lake, causing some ripples.","Qiao Nian covered her eyes. \"I’m not angry.\"","After saying that, she felt that it was not her style to spend so much time with him in the corridor over Hua Ci.","She dropped her hand, adjusted her emotions, and said seriously, \"At least, I didn’t misunderstand your relationship, and I didn’t think you were looking for her on purpose. In that case...\"","Since that was the case, she had no reason to be angry.","Ye Wangchuan had nothing to do with this matter from beginning to end, but her subsequent reactions were all about venting her anger.","This was out of character for her.","Qiao Nian frowned, feeling a little frustrated.","Ye Wangchuan originally wanted to smile and say, \"Then why didn’t you reply to my message later?\" However, he touched the girl’s exhausted side profile and threw the words to the back of his mind. \"What are we having for dinner?\"","Qiao Nian turned her head. \"Huh?\"","Ye Wangchuan took a step forward and held her hand. They walked side by side very naturally. \"Let’s go. I’ll treat you to hotpot.\"","**","The next day.","When Qiao Nian woke up in the morning, she saw an apology message from Hua Ci.","The text was long, apologizing for what she had said and how she had spoken, hoping Qiao Nian would not take it seriously.","She also said that she would leave the independent continent today. Before she left, she wanted to ask Qiao Nian if she had time to come out for a meal. She wanted to apologize in person and hoped that Qiao Nian would come."]},{"number":3726,"title":"Chapter 3726: Do You Want to Learn Investment from Ji Nan?","paragraphs":["Qiao Nian looked at the unfamiliar number and lowered her eyes. In the end, she did not blacklist Hua Ci’s number. Of course, she did not reply to her either.","Zhong Yiliu knew her better.","She rarely bickered with girls, but Hua Ci’s words the day before yesterday were too much, especially her belittling the girls in the country. She did not want to blacklist Hua Ci, but she was too lazy to maintain a superficial peace with her. It was best to be strangers.","Qiao Nian put her cell phone in her pocket and went downstairs with one hand in her pocket.","...","Downstairs.","Qin Si was talking to Ye Wangchuan.","Qiao Nian heard them talking about Beijing when she approached.","She didn’t pay attention to what they said. She lazily walked to the refrigerator and opened the door to take out a bottle of mineral water.","Ye Wangchuan had not been at home for the past few days. When she woke up in the morning, she would basically drink a bottle of ice water to refresh herself. She subconsciously repeated the process.","However, when she returned to the living room, he snatched the bottle from her hand and naturally stuffed a carton of warm milk into her hands.","\"You’ve just woken up. Drink something warm to save your stomach from discomfort.\"","Ye Wangchuan’s voice was low.","As he spoke, he looked at Qin Si again as if nothing had happened and said lazily, \"The Old Master is there to hold the fort. I don’t have to worry. On the other hand, I bumped into your mother before returning. She chatted with me for a while, asking when you’re going back.\"","\"Why did you bump into her again?\" Qin Si looked at him as if he were looking at an unlucky person. Then, he curled his lips and said unhappily, \"Why should I go back? I’m still playing games all day. It’s the same everywhere. I don’t understand why they want me to go back.\"","\"You really don’t know?\" Ye Wangchuan glanced at him indifferently as he took the milk carton from Qiao Nian’s hand, took off the straw, and inserted it into the carton before returning it to her.","Qin Si looked at their reconciliation as if he had been hit on the side of the road early in the morning. He was envious of them.","\"I can’t possibly accept their arrangement.\"","Ye Wangchuan nodded noncommittally, as if he was not interested. \"Up to you.\"","Qiao Nian bit the straw and impatiently sat down. Then, she glanced at the depressed person.","\"What was your major in university?\" she asked casually.","Qin Si was stunned. \"Finance.\"","\"Oh.\" Qiao Nian nodded.","He scratched his head. \"Sister Qiao, why are you asking me this?\"","Qiao Nian let go of the straw and lowered her hand. She looked at him with her dark eyes and asked calmly, \"Are you interested in learning from Ji Nan?\"","Ji Nan was known as the Buffett of the stock market. He was famous in the independent continent and even in other places. He could be considered a top big boss in finance.","If word got out, he would definitely be an impressive figure in the financial industry.","It was just that the Ji family wanted him to have such achievements in black gunpowder, not finance.","Overall, Ji Nan was still very good at investment. This could be seen from how Qiao Nian got to know him and became friends back then.","\"If you’re willing to learn from him, I’ll ask him to guide you,\" Qiao Nian said casually, as if chatting with a friend. \"It’s fine if you don’t want to learn.\"","Before Qin Si could speak, she tilted her head as if she had thought of something. \"By the way, Guan Yan is rich.\"","Qin Si was speechless.","\"Besides me, she’s in charge of most of the business in the Red Alliance. She has also invested in many companies and projects. That’s why she runs around the world.\""]},{"number":3727,"title":"Chapter 3727: Face Slapping Comes Fast Like a Tornado","paragraphs":["Qiao Nian put her elbows on the armrest and casually chatted with Qin Si. \"Every time she goes out, she doesn’t go out to play. She goes out to earn money.\"","\"She likes to make money?\"","\"Not really.\" Qiao Nian thought for a moment and found an accurate description. \"She enjoys the process of earning money... If you’re just looking at the current figures, she actually doesn’t have to worry about the rest of her life.\"","Qin Si had been born with a silver spoon in his mouth. He had never lacked money, nor did he think that money was important. However, being stared at by Qiao Nian, he suddenly had the illusion that he was so poor that his clothes were not covering his body.","He knew very well how much money Qiao Nian had. It could be said that besides Master Wang, it was this big boss who had a mountain of gold and silver in her possession.","Even Qiao Nian said that Guan Yan was rich. How much money did Guan Yan have?","Qin Si’s temples throbbed as he hardened his heart. \"I’ll learn.\"","Ye Wangchuan went to bring the girl breakfast. Hearing this, he raised his eyes and restrained his smile. \"Didn’t you say that you only want to eat, drink, and have fun in this life and don’t plan to work hard? Otherwise, you’ll be letting down your reincarnation.\"","\"Woah, the slap in the face came quickly like a tornado.\" Qin Si was thick-skinned and admitted readily, \"Before I said this, I thought my reincarnation was all about eating my fill and not dating. Master Wang, if you hadn’t been abusing single folks like me with Sister Qiao every day, I wouldn’t have thought of standing up on my own two feet.\"","In the blink of an eye, he changed his attitude and looked at Qiao Nian seriously. \"Sister Qiao, sorry to trouble you.\"","\"Okay.\" Qiao Nian agreed.","\"Thank you,\" Qin Si said again.","He was not stupid. He could tell that Qiao Nian was helping him and also supporting him in getting closer to Guan Yan.","In fact, he was not a rich second-generation heir who only knew how to eat, drink, and have fun. He had also invested in many companies and new projects in Beijing.","He just used to believe in the principle of having fun on time and was unwilling to spend too much time earning money and doing business.","Just as he had said.","Wasn’t his reincarnation so good because God wanted him to live peacefully? Since he could have everything lying down, why should he work hard?","However, he had someone he wanted to be with now. To get close to that person, he had to change himself.","\"I’ll remember this favor.\" Qin Si hammered his chest, his eyes burning with passion and seriousness.","Qiao Nian was already typing a message to Ji Nan. Seeing his face from the corner of her eye, she took a photo before scrolling down her contact list and sending it to Guan Yan.","Guan Yan: [???]","After a while, she called Qiao Nian.","Qiao Nian saw the caller ID and got up to answer the call.","**","Continent M.","The old man from the Leonard family, the leader of the troublemakers, came to the hospital and entered Di Xicheng’s ward.","Half an hour later, the old man left the ward with a livid expression. Before leaving, he did not forget to warn him fiercely, \"This is the last time. If you have any ideas about my family in the future, I will definitely not let you off!\"","For the past two days, Di Xicheng had been staying in the hospital, according to Nie Qingru’s arrangements, to avoid being pestered by the Leonard family.","He looked weak and haggard as he lay on the hospital bed, but he gave off a terrifying, viper-like feeling. \"Goodbye, Mr. Jin.\"","\"Hmph!\" The old man slammed the door.","As Di Xicheng watched him leave, his smile disappeared, and he returned to his cold and gloomy nature. He pressed the bedside bell and asked the nurse to change the dressing.","The person taking care of him was a young female nurse. During the process of changing his dressing, she peeped at his face, and then her thin earlobes reddened."]},{"number":3728,"title":"Chapter 3728: Does Aunt Know That You Talk To Me Like This?","paragraphs":["\"Sir, it will hurt a little. Bear with it.\"","The nurse’s voice was gentle.","Di Xicheng’s face was without emotion. It was as if he was not the one who had been injured. He did not even look at the nurse.","The nurse quickly changed his dressing and bandaged his wound. Seeing that he had ignored her the entire time, her face paled slightly, but she did not say anything else. She quietly put the medicine on the tray and then left.","In the blink of an eye, he was alone in the ward.","Di Xicheng leaned against the head of the bed and took out his phone from under his pillow. He turned on a search engine and checked the news.","After the account book went missing, he quickly arranged for someone to withdraw the letter and used his connections to settle the matter with the prosecutor’s office.","Moreover, he seized the family secrets of the elder with the most authority in the Leonard family and used them as a condition to negotiate with him.","Although the other party was so angry that he wanted to kill him, that was the outcome he wanted.","Di Xicheng was not worried about how the other party would make the Leonard family stop pestering him. He just wanted to know what Qiao Nian was going to do.","At this thought, he exited the search engine and casually opened the photo album.","There were only three photos in his photo album.","One of the photos had a bright X drawn on it.","The person pictured in it was Ji Qing.","Di Xicheng clicked on one of the remaining two photos and looked at the girl’s arrogant face.","She was extremely beautiful.","\"It’s a pity that she’s a member of the Ji family.\" Di Xicheng’s voice was extremely low, and the corners of his lips curled up happily. He rubbed against the girl’s face and then raised his hand to make a gun pose. With narrowed eyes, he aimed at the girl’s forehead and made a shooting motion. \"Bang!\"","It was as if he had really shot Qiao Nian. He blew at the \"muzzle\", his eyes flickering with a crazy light.","At this moment, there was a knock on the door.","\"Young Master Di.\"","Di Xicheng turned toward the door and saw Shadow standing there. He probably saw what he had done just now. Shadow knocked on the door but did not walk in.","\"Come in.\" Di Xicheng exited the photo album again before putting the phone away. His face was devoid of emotion, the cheerfulness he showed in front of Nie Qingru nowhere in sight.","Shadow came in and told him the time of discharge.","Di Xicheng replied calmly, \"Got it.\"","Shadow was only here to inform the discharge time. Before leaving, he stopped and looked sideways at the person lying on the hospital bed.","\"I don’t know what you want to do, but you’d better remember not to betray her trust.\"","Di Xicheng did not even raise his head at his warning. He unhurriedly said, \"Does Aunt know you’re talking to me like this?\"","Shadow’s expression immediately changed, and he pursed his lips into a line.","Only then did Di Xicheng look up, sneering as if he was watching a joke. \"Don’t worry, I won’t let Aunt’s trust down!\"","Shadow was displeased at the emphasis on the word ’trust’, but he knew that Nie Qingru was very protective of Di Xicheng and did not want to have a direct conflict with him.","Di Xicheng looked at his departing figure and sneered coldly. He picked up his phone and entered a number he knew by heart before sending a message.","It had been so many days.","He should also greet Qiao Nian in case she forgot him."]},{"number":3729,"title":"Chapter 3729: No Matter How Important You Are, You’re Not As Important As My Family","paragraphs":["10 minutes later.","The independent continent.","Qiao Nian received a trashy message from an unknown number.","She lowered her eyelashes and looked at the screen. Then, she swiped her fair fingertips across the screen and deleted the message, not sparing another glance at it.","...","The next day.","Hua Ci greeted the medical team and stayed behind alone. After sending her companions off at the hotel, she called Ye Lan.","This time, she started a video call.","Her suite had a projector.","Her phone was connected to Bluetooth, and Ye Lan’s face was projected on the screen. Judging from the background, she should be in the company.","\"Hua Ci, what’s wrong?\"","Holding a document, Ye Lan looked at her in puzzlement. \"Aren’t you coming back today? Why are you still in the hotel?\"","\"Aunt Ye.\" Hua Ci found it hard to speak. \"I messaged Qiao Nian asking her out for a meal to apologize, but she hasn’t replied yet, so I...\"","Hence, she did not leave with her colleagues. Instead, she changed her flight time to two days later.","Ye Lan could tell what she was implying and put down the document. \"You want to treat Nian Nian to a meal? Why?\"","\"After what had happened, I bumped into her again and had a conflict with her. She said something to me. I went back and thought about it and felt that I said something wrong.\"","Hua Ci stammered, not wanting to make things clear to Ye Lan. Then, she took a deep breath and looked at her expectantly. \"Aunt Ye, can you help me ask her out?\"","Before Ye Lan could answer, she quickly emphasized, \"I really want to apologize to her.\"","Ye Lan was silent for two seconds, her sharp and capable eyes staring fixedly at her. \"I promised your mother that I would take care of you.\"","Hua Ci heaved a sigh of relief. \"I know you’ve taken good care of me all these years. Without you, I wouldn’t have my current achievements. I’m very grateful to you.\"","\"That’s not what I meant.\"","Hua Ci looked at her in confusion. \"Aunt Ye, you mean?\"","Ye Lan did not want to make things too unpleasant. \"I promised your mother to take care of you, but it’s only limited to taking care of you. Your mother and I were good friends, but we didn’t have that deep of a relationship. In other words, even if your mother was still alive, she wouldn’t be more important than my family. I told you before that Nian Nian will marry Wangchuan in the future. But you went to provoke her... I can’t understand what you’re doing.\"","\"Aunt Ye—\" Hua Ci was a little embarrassed.","Ye Lan stopped her. \"You don’t have to explain. I know her personality. She’s not the kind of person who easily argues with someone. Since you said she had a conflict with you, it means what you said is definitely not ordinary. You must have crossed her bottom line for her to act this way.\"","Hua Ci did not expect Ye Lan to scold her without asking anything. She was extremely disappointed in her.","Not only was she embarrassed, but she was also a little flustered. \"Aunt Ye...\"","Seeing her fair face turn red and then pale, Ye Lan did not make things difficult for her on account of her deceased friend. \"Wangchuan has gone back.\"","\"Tell me...\" Hua Ci’s eyes lit up, and her fingers subconsciously curled.","Ye Lan saw her agitation and said coldly, \"He’s in the independent continent. I can’t call Nian Nian, or he’ll be angry if he finds out. You’re an adult. You’ll settle the matter yourself. If you can’t, you’ll take responsibility. I have to go to a meeting. I won’t talk to you anymore.\""]},{"number":3730,"title":"Chapter 3730: Master Wang, Aren’t You Answering the Call?","paragraphs":["Hua Ci opened her mouth, but Ye Lan said, \"I’ll hang up first.\"","There was a beep, and the figure on the projector disappeared into the light.","Ye Lan had already hung up.","Hua Ci bit her lip. Embarrassment surged in her heart. Then, she bent down, picked up her cell phone, and found the number on her contact list. She hesitated for a moment before calling.","Beep...","The call went through as soon as it was made.","Hua Ci’s heart raced.","Her blood flowed faster and focused on her heart. Every second was magnified infinitely, and time seemed to freeze at this moment.","\"Beep, beep...\"","The phone rang a dozen times, but no one picked up.","From the initial excitement, Hua Ci became a little nervous and flustered. Did he not bring his cell phone with him?","Another two seconds passed.","No one picked up the call, and it was automatically hung up.","Hua Ci heard a robotic female voice. \"I’m sorry, the number you dialed is unavailable. Please try again later.\"","Hua Ci hesitated for a moment before calling again.","**","In a white European-style villa.","The independent continent.","Mo Dong was reporting to Ye Wangchuan on the developments of the various large factions in the independent continent in the past few days, including the movements at the various docks.","\"... The Ji family’s more powerful docks are much quieter. Those people are afraid of Miss Qiao. Miss Qiao is in the independent continent, and they don’t dare cause any trouble, obediently following Young Master Ji’s arrangements. Therefore, things in the Ji family have been relatively peaceful lately.","\"... During your absence, things in the Chamber of Commerce Alliance have been rather chaotic. Simon’s sudden departure has caused chaos within. Several projects have been annexed by other forces, and their strength declined. They are also divided into two factions. One faction is following the arrangements Simon imparted before he left and is biding their time. The other faction is very close to the Xie family and seems to want to curry favor with Miss Qiao by building a relationship with them. The Xie family are acting dumb. They clearly don’t have any relationship with Miss Qiao, but they used the in-law relationship between the Xie family and the Ji family to reap benefits from the Chamber of Commerce Alliance.\"","Simon’s sudden departure left the Chamber of Commerce Alliance leaderless.","Some people knew the inside story and learned that the President had left the office that day after Qiao Nian came to their headquarters.","They were afraid she would take revenge on the Chamber of Commerce Alliance. Desperate times called for desperate measures, and they took a detour in the form of Old Madam Xie.","Old Madam Xie was used to using facades to deceive people. This time, she took a lot of the benefits from the Chamber of Commerce Alliance.","However, Xie Yun had long fallen out with her family, and Ji Nan did not buy his grandmother’s words... In fact, Old Madam Xie had taken a lot of benefits from the Chamber of Commerce Alliance, but she could not contact Qiao Nian at all.","Some people from the Chamber of Commerce Alliance were already dissatisfied with her behavior and stirring up trouble.","\"... If they get into a fight, I’m afraid Old Madam Xie won’t be able to keep her integrity anymore. It won’t be worth it.\"","As Mo Dong spoke, he noticed that Master Wang’s phone kept vibrating, and he kept glancing at the coffee table.","Seeing that Ye Wangchuan had no intention of answering the call, Mo Dong couldn’t help but remind him, \"Master Wang, aren’t you going to answer the call?\"","Under his scrutiny, Ye Wangchuan bent down slightly, picked up the cell phone, smoothly rejected the call, and then proceeded to blacklist the number.","After putting his cell phone on the sofa, he stood up and asked Mo Dong, \"What time is it?\"","Mo Dong looked at the watch on the wall. \"11:30.\""]},{"number":3731,"title":"Chapter 3731: Sister Nian Knows About This","paragraphs":["Ye Wangchuan grabbed his jacket from the armrest before saying, \"Let’s go to the First Research Institute to deliver the food.\"","Mo Dong was speechless.","Qiao Nian had been so busy recently that she often forgot to eat lunch.","Ever since Ye Wangchuan returned from Beijing and realized she would sometimes forget to eat, he would always appear at the research institute when it was time for meals.","Every time, there would be a feast.","Not only did he bring food for Qiao Nian, but he also brought food for Feng Yu and Shi Fu. Sometimes, he even prepared Zhou Zhou’s portion.","This way, no one would gossip about him entering and exiting the First Research Institute every day.","After all, from the dean, the Deputy Director, to Team Leader Zhou... Everyone had benefited from him. So what if he came to deliver food to his girlfriend?","Ye Wangchuan relied on this to enter and leave the research institute freely.","**","\"Sorry, the number you have dialed is currently engaged.\"","\"Sorry, the number you have dialed is currently engaged.\"","...","The first time Hua Ci heard this mechanical female voice, she really thought that Ye Wangchuan was on the phone with someone.","However, after trying almost ten times in a row and always hearing the same robotic female voice, Hua Ci finally understood that she had been blacklisted.","Ye Wangchuan had blacklisted her!","At first, Hua Ci found it unbelievable. Unwilling to give up, she called Ye Lan again and told her this.","Ye Lan was silent. She did not comfort her nor say she would tell Ye Wangchuan to add her back. Instead, she told her to forget it since he had already blacklisted her number.","Only now did Hua Ci realize what she had missed.","She seemed to be ostracized by the entire Ye family!","All these years overseas, the care and preferential treatment Ye Lan gave her had always made her feel like she was half a member of the Ye family.","But because of such a small matter, she was exiled from the circle. Hua Ci couldn’t accept the difference.","She had always believed that the problem lay with Qiao Nian.","Even though she felt that the possibility of Qiao Nian causing trouble behind the scenes was not high, she still returned her plane ticket and ran to the hospital to wait for Zhong Yiliu a few times.","She was not familiar with him, nor did she really know him.","She knew Zhong Yiliu, but Zhong Yiliu had only seen her once at the dinner that night.","Hua Ci had no choice. Besides Zhong Yiliu, she couldn’t think of anyone else who could be related to Qiao Nian.","After meeting and rejecting to help her after hearing her intentions, Zhong Yiliu had not seen her since.","However, Hua Ci persistently guarded outside the hospital. Even if the security guards did not let her in, she would not leave. She stubbornly insisted on seeing Zhong Yiliu.","**","Qiao Nian only found out from Zhong Yiliu a week later that Hua Ci was waiting outside the hospital. After roughly figuring out what she wanted to do, she came out of the room in frustration and knocked on the door of the room opposite.","Knock knock.","\"Come in.\"","The man’s voice was slightly hoarse and low.","After Qiao Nian opened the door and entered, she saw Ye Wangchuan leaving the bathroom. He seemed to have just taken a shower. His short black hair was still dripping, his forehead was messy, and his eyes were deep and beautiful. Behind a layer of mist, it was as if an aurora was hidden in the night sky.","The grayish-silver bathrobe was loose. The silk felt heavy, and the simple cut relied on his figure to accentuate his nobility.","He wiped his hair with a towel and looked at the girl before pointing at the armchair and saying, \"Sit.\""]},{"number":3732,"title":"Chapter 3732: Sister Nian Is Thinking About Science and Technology","paragraphs":["Before Qiao Nian could move, he put the towel aside and naturally went to get her a cup of warm water.","\"Keep your hands warm.\"","Ye Wangchuan grabbed her hand and passed the glass to her. Then, he picked up the air conditioner remote control on the bed and turned on the heater.","Then, he leaned against the cabinet a step away from Qiao Nian and picked up a towel to wipe the dripping water from his neck with lowered eyes, looking lazy and sexy. \"Why did you come to look for me so late at night?\"","Qiao Nian almost got tempted right then. Fortunately, she had strong self-control. She held the warm glass and walked over to the sofa before sitting down. \"Hua Ci hasn’t left yet.\"","What?","Ye Wangchuan paused for half a second before realizing who she was talking about. He paused and frowned.","Qiao Nian wouldn’t snitch. She said truthfully, \"She’s been blocking the hospital entrance recently and insisting on seeing Elder Zhong, causing trouble for him. I plan to get the security guards to ’invite’ her to leave.\"","She knew what Hua Ci wanted by insisting on meeting Zhong Yiliu. She even knew what Hua Ci would say to her if she were willing to meet her.","It was precisely because Qiao Nian could guess everything that she felt that Hua Ci’s actions were meaningless.","Not long ago, she said that country girls liked to play tricks. However, what she was doing now was even more ridiculous than the tricks she had used to look down on.","Hua Ci could now be considered a stalker, right?","However, perhaps in her eyes, she was just a bold and unrestrained foreigner who would never give up.","Qiao Nian did not want to understand Hua Ci’s thoughts. She just felt annoyed.","She looked up at a certain someone. \"You’ve provoked a rotten peach blossom. Why don’t you resolve this problem?\"","\"I provoked her?\" Ye Wangchuan held the towel with his slender fingers, not knowing whether to laugh or cry. \"I don’t think I provoked her.\"","Qiao Nian sized him up before nodding sincerely. \"Your face is provocative.\"","Silence.","Ye Wangchuan had never heard of such a reason before. He half-jokingly asked, \"Then, should I cover my face when I go out in the future?\"","Unexpectedly, the girl thought about it seriously. \"It’s not impossible.\"","He was completely speechless. Smiling, he put down the towel and said casually, \"Later, I’ll call Aunt and ask her to get rid of her.\"","\"Alright.\"","It was inappropriate for Qiao Nian to call Ye Lan, but it was reasonable for Ye Wangchuan to step forward.","Qiao Nian had invited Zhong Yiliu to help with the treatment. It was indeed inappropriate for Hua Ci to harass him at the hospital entrance.","Ye Wangchuan noticed that her fair skin looked even more beautiful under the light. He walked over and bent down to tuck her hair behind her ear. \"Goddess Qiao is angry?\"","Qiao Nian raised her eyelids slightly. Her thin eyelids narrowed her beautiful pupils, and his face was reflected in them. She felt an inexplicable heat inside. \"I’m thinking...\"","Ye Wangchuan listened attentively while playing with her hair, looking lazy and arrogant. \"What are you thinking?\"","\"Is there a technique in the world that can shrink you to the size of a thumb? Then I’ll carry you around with me in my pocket. Save you the trouble of being provocative.\"","Silence.","Ye Wangchuan paused for half a second before laughing happily. After a while, he replied seriously, \"Then study it. I’ll wait for your results.\"","Qiao Nian felt bored.","She looked at him again and thought about it. Suddenly, she pulled him, bent down, and buried her head in his collarbone before opening her mouth and biting him."]},{"number":3733,"title":"Chapter 3733: Ji Lingfeng Wants to See Her","paragraphs":["Ye Wangchuan felt a tingling sensation on his collarbone when her teeth rubbed against it. It was not particularly painful, but he was licked as if he was being comforted. His tailbone trembled.","The troublemaking girl calmly raised her head and met his eyes. She provocatively stared at the mark on his collarbone and snapped her fingers. \"Putting a seal on it.\"","Ye Wangchuan’s eyes were misty with red streaks. His long eyelashes were slightly lowered as he stared at the person below him.","\"It’s not obvious.\"","What?","\"Do you want to leave another seal?\"","Qiao Nian raised her neck slightly and swallowed. Before she could say anything, the man standing with his hands on the sofa’s armrest leaned down and pressed his soft lips against hers. He pried open her lips and teeth and said in a hoarse voice, \"Open your mouth.\"","A kiss occupied all of Qiao Nian’s thoughts.","\"Oh.\" She even had to raise her head to feel better.","Fortunately, Ye Wangchuan was restrained. A few minutes later, he pulled away. The veins on his backhand were visibly tight as he straightened his back and hurriedly said, \"I’m going to take a shower.\"","Qiao Nian only reacted when she saw him disappear into the bathroom. The light enveloped her, making her skin look as fair as jade as she tapped her red lips with her fingers. Then, she shook her head and chuckled.","She was in a good mood.","Qiao Nian was even in the mood to remind him, \"Tsk, didn’t you just come out of the shower?\"","The next second, she heard water splashing in the bathroom, blocking her voice.","Qiao Nian stretched out on the sofa and took out her cell phone.","She was about to start a game to pass the time when she received a call from Ji Nan.","She got up and walked out before answering it. \"Hello?\"","Ji Nan was probably outside as the background was noisy. \"Nian Nian, my father has been discharged from the hospital. He wants to see you. Do you have time?\"","Qiao Nian closed the bedroom door and leaned against the wall before reaching for the lighter in her pocket.","In the end, her hand grabbed nothing.","Only now did she remember leaving the lighter in her room.","Qiao Nian rubbed her eyebrows in frustration and did not answer Ji Nan right away.","Ji Nan knew about her complicated relationship with his father and hesitated before saying softly, \"It’s okay if you don’t want to see him. I’ll talk to him. You don’t have to make it hard for yourself.\"","Qiao Nian stuffed her hand into her pocket and raised her head slightly; her dark eyes were especially cold in the dimly lit corridor. \"Why does he suddenly want to see me?\"","\"This... I’m not sure either,\" Ji Nan said honestly.","Qiao Nian pursed her lips and thought for a moment. \"I’ll be at the hospital in about an hour.\"","\"Y-You’re willing—\" Ji Nan was a little surprised. Then, he became excited and raised his voice.","Qiao Nian calmly said, \"I just want to know what he wants to say.\"","\"Alright.\" Ji Nan did not care so much and said excitedly, \"I’ll wait for you outside the hospital. Send me a message when you arrive.\"","Qiao Nian opened her mouth, but Ji Nan hung up before she could say anything.","She stood quietly in the corridor for a while longer before sending Ye Wangchuan a WeChat message. Then, she returned to her room to change. She put on her baseball cap, lowered the brim, and went out.","***","It was 40 minutes later when she arrived at the hospital."]},{"number":3734,"title":"Chapter 3734: I’ve Been Out for So Long, It’s Time to Go Back","paragraphs":["Qiao Nian saw Ji Nan squatting by the roadside the moment she got out of the car. She walked over and patted his shoulder from behind. \"What are you squatting here for?\"","Ji Nan was quite frustrated, thinking it was a stranger. Looking up and realizing it was Qiao Nian, his frustration disappeared and he looked happy. Then, he pulled Qiao Nian’s arm. \"Let’s go. My mother and the others are waiting for you inside.\"","Inpatient department.","Zhong Yiliu was telling Xie Yun about the things to take note of when caring for the patient. Xie Yun listened seriously, asking questions from time to time.","Zhong Yiliu answered patiently.","A few Ji family elders were outside the huge ward. The second and fourth elders were also present. Qiao Nian also noticed a few familiar faces she had seen before.","These people were originally gathered together with a strong aura. Even in front of Xie Yun, they were not that respectful. They just stood there watching.","Now, seeing Ji Nan leading a girl over, everyone inadvertently exchanged gazes. In an instant, everyone was in high spirits.","Especially the Second Elder, upon seeing the girl’s arrogant and despotic face, recalled how stifled he felt at the Intercontinental Hotel not long ago.","\"M-Miss Qiao.\" Although he was unwilling to greet Qiao Nian, Simon’s example case was enough for him. He stiffly called her out.","Among the elders, he was the most senior and experienced. He took the lead in greeting Qiao Nian, and the others hurriedly followed.","\"Hello, Miss Qiao.\"","\"Miss Qiao is here.\"","Zhong Yiliu raised his eyebrows upon seeing this, finding it interesting. \"Q, you’re here.\"","Qiao Nian nodded and stopped before him. \"Can he be discharged now?\"","Zhong Yiliu mentioned his condition seriously. \"It’s all thanks to you finding the antidote from Continent M. The surgery was successful, and he’s almost recovered. The rest will depend on him. You’re a doctor, so you know that recuperation is the same everywhere. It’s more convenient for you to have a family doctor. There’s no need to stay in the hospital.\"","Most patients insisted on staying in the hospital in case any accidents happened. They couldn’t afford to delay treatment if they were not sent to the hospital in time.","Ji Lingfeng’s situation was special.","The Ji family had its own private doctor, an expert. The doctor would stay at home to take care of him, so it was very unlikely for any accidents to happen.","Zhong Yiliu only agreed to Ji Lingfeng’s discharge after considering this.","\"I’m going back too. There are still many things for me to do in the association.\" Zhong Yiliu put away his pen and added, \"I’ve been out for so long, with only those brats guarding the place. I don’t know how chaotic the laboratory has become. I have to go back and take a look.\"","The Pharmacy Association was filled with medical maniacs. Their favorite thing was to soak in the laboratory and play with all kinds of strange medicine.","Without Zhong Yiliu around, Robert could not suppress the situation.","Sometimes, it was inevitable for things to get out of hand without Zhong Yiliu around. That’s why he was in a hurry to go back.","Qiao Nian put her hands in her pockets and nodded. \"I’ll get someone to arrange a plane for you.\"","Guan Yan flew all over the world, so she had many private planes. One of them was currently parked at the airport. Qiao Nian did not need it, so she did not purchase any of her own, and only used Guan Yan’s.","Zhong Yiliu patted her shoulder twice with a loving and gentle gaze. \"The patient wants to see you. Go on.\"","\"Okay.\"","Since Qiao Nian was already here, she agreed without hesitation."]},{"number":3735,"title":"Chapter 3735: Those Who Don’t Know Would Think You’re the Patriarch","paragraphs":["Before Zhong Yiliu let go, he smiled and winked, indicating for her to notice her surroundings. \"To be honest, if I didn’t know about your situation, I would have thought that you were the Patriarch of the Ji family.\"","Qiao Nian glanced at him indifferently. Clearly, she did not care about this joke. \"I’ll go in first.\"","Zhong Yiliu was just joking. He immediately waved at her. \"Go on.\"","Before entering, Qiao Nian greeted Xie Yun and asked how she was doing. Then, she unhurriedly entered the ward.","She only spoke to the two of them the entire time.","Zhong Yiliu and Xie Yun.","As for the rest of the Ji family, including the Second Elder who greeted her first, Qiao Nian did not even look at them.","How arrogant!","The Second Elder and the rest had ugly expressions. They could only take a deep breath and find a way out for themselves. \"Miss Qiao is still as cold as ever.\"","Xie Yun and Ji Nan knew why Qiao Nian did not give him a way out. They did not say anything, as if they did not hear him.","The Second Elder’s gloomy expression became even more reserved and embarrassed. When his temper rose, he even wanted to leave. However, he remembered that Ji Lingfeng’s health was fine and he was about to be discharged.","He knew that this was not the time to throw a tantrum. He could only suppress his anger and turn his head away.","**","In the ward.","After entering, Qiao Nian pulled a chair and sat in front of the bed, looking at the man with his eyes closed and propped up with a pillow. She was the first to speak. \"I heard you wanted to speak.\"","Ji Lingfeng had heard her footsteps the moment she entered. He just thought it was Ji Nan or Xie Yun. That’s why he did not open his eyes.","Hearing the girl’s casual tone, he immediately opened his eyes and saw Qiao Nian sitting in front of his bed.","Their gazes met briefly before quickly separating.","\"I thought you wouldn’t come.\" Ji Lingfeng propped himself up. He was still sick, and his voice was hoarse.","Qiao Nian replied, \"I’ve even got you the antidote. There’s no need to be pretentious over such a small matter.\"","Ji Lingfeng was stunned. Then, his brows relaxed and he revealed a rare smile. \"You’re right.\"","Ji Nan had told him everything.","Qiao Nian had risked going to Nie Qingru’s vault in Continent M to find the antidote for him, and she almost did not come back.","His reaction was big. He wanted to see her, but after slowly thinking it over, he only asked to see her now that he was about to be discharged.","\"Are you alright?\" Ji Lingfeng looked at her.","The girl’s eyebrows were frivolous. She looked a little like the woman in his memory, but not completely.","Ji Qing was more gentle. Her eyes were always filled with bits and pieces of starlight. They were radiant as well but not scorching.","Qiao Nian was the opposite. She was more like the aurora of the North Pole. It was unforgettable, but it was accompanied by ice and snow.","She was distant and aggressive.","What?","Ji Lingfeng could see the confusion in her gaze and realized his question was stupid. However, he blurted out at that moment, \"It’s nothing. I was just asking casually.\"","Qiao Nian looked at the white hair at his temples and was silent for a moment before replying casually, \"It’s been alright. That’s all.\"","Ji Lingfeng’s reaction was short. When he realized she was answering his previous question, his eyes lit up and his voice became much lighter. \"You’re not like your mother at all. She... won’t do anything like stealing. She has never disobeyed that person. Ever since she was young, she only wanted to work hard to make that person happy.\""]},{"number":3736,"title":"Chapter 3736: The Fog of the Past Finally Dissipated","paragraphs":["\"That’s why she died.\" Qiao Nian cut him off directly.","Ji Lingfeng seemed to be strangled as his expression sank into pain. \"Yes, she’s dead. She’s been dead for many years. I was also one of the people who encouraged it. I was the one who killed her.\"","If this had been said in the past, Qiao Nian might have believed it. However, as she looked at the man clutching his head in extreme pain, she suddenly felt a wave of understanding.","\"You don’t have it in you.\"","Ji Lingfeng raised his head. \"What?\"","Qiao Nian crossed her arms, her eyes cold but calm. \"You’re not ruthless enough.\"","If he weren’t ruthless enough, he wouldn’t be able to kill anyone.","Only a heartless person like Nie Qingru could kill Ji Qing. How could a man like Ji Lingfeng, who still felt pain after all these years, kill Ji Qing...","\"How did she die?\" Qiao Nian looked at him and asked the question she had always wanted to ask.","Ji Lingfeng seemed to fall into a painful memory. His handsome and mature face gradually wrinkled and distorted as he recalled. \"I don’t know what happened that day either. I rushed over with all my might when I heard the news. When I got there, I only saw a mess. She... couldn’t even have her corpse preserved completely.\"","Ji Qing had died without a burial place. Not even her corpse was left behind. She had been blown into countless pieces and thrown into the deep sea to feed the fish. The entire scene was too horrible to look at.","Ji Lingfeng still remembered almost going into a mental breakdown. The sky had collapsed. He only wanted to avenge her at all costs.","But he couldn’t do it.","At that time, Xie Yun had already given birth. The day before, he had even held the infant in his arms. The child was very young and weak as he lay in his arms, blowing bubbles at him. He even held one of his fingers tightly. He couldn’t forget that feeling.","In addition, besides his newborn child and wife who he couldn’t let down, everyone in the Ji family was watching him.","Some of the older generation knew what he was thinking. That night, they knelt outside the old residence and asked him to give up on revenge. Those great-uncles remained kneeling until they fainted.","In the end, he let her down and could not investigate to the end to avenge her. He could only set her name as a taboo and not allow anyone to mention it.","Of course, he also looked for the child Ji Qing told him she was pregnant with.","Before finding Qiao Nian, Ji Lingfeng couldn’t even be sure if the child had been born. He could only rely on his numb beliefs to support his life day by day.","\"She had been researching a project. That project seemed very dangerous and affected the interests of too many people. At that time, many forces warned her openly and secretly to drop the research. However, she refused to listen and stubbornly insisted on doing it. She even quietly left the independent continent and hid in Beijing for a few years. It was only when... she was found again that her peaceful life was broken.\"","Ji Lingfeng tried his best to recall everything that happened back then. \"I don’t know what her research project was, but her death must be related to it.\"","Qiao Nian was expressionless as she sat in front of the bed.","However, those familiar with her knew she was not really calm and even a little angry.","\"That’s why she killed her own daughter?\"","Ji Lingfeng was surprised. \"You know?\"","Qiao Nian did not answer him directly. Instead, she looked at him with clear eyes. \"She didn’t participate?\"","Ji Lingfeng avoided her eyes, not knowing how to answer. \"She did.\""]},{"number":3737,"title":"Chapter 3737: That Loveless Marriage Buried Everyone","paragraphs":["\"There’s a reason she did that. Her relationship with your grandfather was bad. Your grandfather did something and let her down, so she took revenge on your mother.\"","\"So she’s just incompetent in venting her anger.\" Qiao Nian finally understood, and her eyes filled with ice. \"She can’t win against the bully, so she bullied those weaker than her. Pfft, she’s really capable!\"","Ji Lingfeng did not refute her. \"The past is too complicated and involves the grudges of the previous generation. I can’t say who’s right and who’s wrong.\"","\"So what kind of grudge is it?\" Qiao Nian grew impatient.","Ji Lingfeng saw the impatient expression on the girl’s cold face and moved his dry lips. \"Your grandfather... was an outstanding person. He was extremely successful in all aspects... He could even be said to be a genius among geniuses who appeared out of nowhere. No one knew his background. They only knew he became famous in the illegal district and independent continent at 18. He quickly became the uncrowned king of the independent continent...\"","Ji Lingfeng was shrouded in the light by the window, giving his silhouette a thin layer of light as he immersed himself in his memories.","\"He was very strong, very powerful. But he was not a good person.\"","What?","Qiao Nian frowned but did not comment.","Ji Lingfeng smiled lightly and continued, \"His lifelong pursuit was to become stronger and reach a higher level. His talent and intelligence made him lack empathy for others.","\"At that time, he had already dominated the independent continent and become its master. When expanding his sphere of influence, he inevitably encountered the reclusive families. Your grandfather had always been used to being domineering, so he fought with the reclusive families for a long time. He was also the first to challenge and force the reclusive families into a dead end.","\"The reclusive families did not want to continue wasting time like that, so they negotiated with him and agreed to a series of conditions. At the same time, the reclusive families proposed a marriage alliance to consolidate their relationship.\"","\"He chose your grandmother.\" Ji Lingfeng sighed.","Qiao Nian interrupted him expressionlessly. \"She’s not my grandmother.\"","Very determined.","No room for negotiation.","Ji Lingfeng looked at her. \"At that time, your... Nie Qingru had a boyfriend who she had been dating for many years. The two of them were childhood sweethearts and their relationship was so deep that it was at the stage of discussing marriage. Of course, she didn’t agree to her family arranging for her to marry a stranger, so she went on a hunger strike to protest and insisted on breaking off the engagement.","\"The marriage between uniting the independent continent and Continent M was already a sure thing. The Nie family wouldn’t allow her to do this, and your grandfather wouldn’t allow her to do this either.\"","\"So what did he do?\" Qiao Nian thought of the old photo carefully hidden and looked at him with dark eyes.","The corner of Ji Lingfeng’s mouth twitched as he slowly continued in a deep voice, \"He captured her boyfriend and gave Nie Qingru an ultimatum. In the end, Nie Qingru compromised and got married in a wedding dress. They held the wedding in front of everyone.","\"There was no love in this wedding. Including your grandfather, everyone treated the marriage as a transaction. After that, because this marriage involved the two continents, even if they didn’t love each other, they couldn’t divorce. She was imprisoned in the independent continent. It wasn’t until your grandfather passed away that she looked for the man again. But she discovered he died in the first year of her marriage...\""]},{"number":3738,"title":"Chapter 3738: Even With Tens of Millions In My Way, I Will Not Regret the Pursuit Even If I Die","paragraphs":["Ji Lingfeng was unable to calm down after he finished speaking.","He hated Nie Qingru for killing the woman he loved the most, but in this matter, he couldn’t criticize her madness.","Nie Qingru had endured for 20 years for love, only to find that the person she had risked her life to protect was long dead. When she found him, only bones were left.","The pain was enough to drive a person crazy.","\"She hated your grandfather and everyone in the Ji family... She also harbored such hatred for your mother... that’s why she did such a thing.\"","Ji Lingfeng was silent for a moment. \"After I found out about your existence, I also wanted you to come back, but I realized that time didn’t erase her hatred for your grandfather. Instead, it became stronger. I was afraid she would go after you, so I pretended not to accept you. I hoped she wouldn’t implicate you in the grudges of the older generation on account of your innocence. Qiao Nian, I was too naive.\"","Qiao Nian leaned back slightly against the chair. Her slender neck was exposed, her fair skin dazzling the eyes.","She pinched the bridge of her nose and looked at the man lying on the bed with her sharp and rational eyes.","\"So you feel sorry for her?\"","\"I...\"","\"No matter how pitiful she is, she shouldn’t make others pay for her pain!\" Qiao Nian’s eyes were cold, but a ball of fire suddenly burned in her heart, as if any sparks could set a prairie on fire. \"The person who owes her is Ji Wusun, the reclusive families, and those in her Nie family who forced her to marry. Of these three, one she didn’t have time to take revenge on, one she did not dare to take revenge on, and the last one she couldn’t take revenge on... Hence, she put all her hatred onto her daughter. Don’t you think it’s ridiculous? Did life become a tragedy because of Ji Qing? Did Ji Qing kill that man? Or was Ji Qing the one to make her compromise?","\"Besides not reincarnating well, what did Ji Qing do wrong to be born to her?","\"When she said she hated that person, she stood on the moral high ground and sentenced the innocent to death. This is the biggest joke I’ve ever heard!\"","Qiao Nian rarely spoke so much. She stabbed Ji Lingfeng’s heart with every word, tearing his heart into pieces. She tore the surface and revealed what his timid self couldn’t face.","\"You... are right.\"","He could avenge Ji Qing, but he didn’t dare to pursue what happened back then.","He didn’t even have the right to miss her.","Sizzle—","Suddenly, Qiao Nian stood up and looked down at him. \"Now I know everything you wanted to tell me. Since you don’t know who went after her back then, I’ll find out for myself.\"","Seeing that the girl was about to leave, Ji Lingfeng called out, \"Qiao Nian.\"","The girl who opened the door but did not turn around. Instead, she stood with her back facing him, waiting for him to speak.","Ji Lingfeng’s expression was obscure. \"Do you know what it means for you to investigate this matter?\"","\"I know.\" The girl’s voice was sloppy. \"I found what she hid in the Ji family’s old residence. There was a folder inside with a sentence written on it. Her last words.\"","Ji Lingfeng’s eyebrows twitched. He suddenly looked up with a racing heart. \"W-What?\"","\"Where values lie, even with tens of millions in my way, I will not regret the pursuit even if I die!\"","The wind blew her voice away, but it was as firm as ever.","\"I want to find out what it is that she would die to protect.\""]},{"number":3739,"title":"Chapter 3739: Sister Nian Sends Zhong Yiliu Off","paragraphs":["She wanted to see what made Ji Qing not regret death. She would rather die in the sea than hide something.","—Where values lie...","—Even with tens of millions in my way, I will not regret the pursuit even if I die.","Qiao Nian left silently, leaving Ji Lingfeng reaching out to grab onto nothing but the ray of sunlight.","The air smelled of disinfectant.","It was as if he had returned to 20 years ago...","**","Outside.","Ji Nan and Xie Yun waited for her to come out before approaching. Ji Nan touched her shoulder and asked in concern, \"What did my father say to you?\"","Qiao Nian was in low spirits. She couldn’t even be bothered to look at him. \"Nothing.\"","They had been inside for so long, Ji Nan knew his father would say something to her. He was about to ask again when Xie Yun tugged at his sleeve, indicating for him to stop asking.","Ji Nan suppressed his curiosity and grabbed his car keys. \"Let’s go. I’ll send you back.\"","Qiao Nian refused. She asked him to accompany Ji Lingfeng back to the old residence. She then went to look for Zhong Yiliu and arranged a plane.","She called Guan Yan, who arranged the itinerary in just a few minutes and sent a car to pick them up.","Qiao Nian called Zhong Yiliu to the independent continent. Upon leaving, she was the one sending him off. She watched as Zhong Yiliu boarded the plane and it taxied away, disappearing into the blue sky.","Only then did she turn around.","...","After Ji Lingfeng recovered and was discharged from the hospital, the Ji family, which had been in turmoil for more than half a year, finally calmed down.","Ji Lingfeng was a decisive person.","On the third day after returning, he started to deal with the people who had been restless during his absence.","He then called the few elders to the Righteousness Hall.","He had always been valiant. After everyone arrived, Xie Yun pushed the wheelchair to the conference table and he threw a thick stack of investigation documents before the elders.","\"See for yourselves.\"","The elders silently picked up the documents amid the solemn atmosphere. They looked at the documents one by one, and the more they looked at them, the worse their expressions became.","These documents carefully listed their private dealings during this period, including forming cliques and colluding with external forces.","The few elders who were called out sneered and dropped the documents, not daring to continue reading.","\"Are you done?\" Ji Lingfeng asked indifferently when he saw they stopped reading.","The Second Elder and the rest were embarrassed. Covering their mouths, they coughed awkwardly and their eyes darted around. \"Patriarch, why did you show us this? This is all a misunderstanding. The situation at that time was too complicated. We...\"","\"All of you are my elders. Granduncle, Uncle, and the rest,\" Ji Lingfeng interrupted.","The Second Elder’s anxiety eased slightly. It seemed the Patriarch was not as serious as he thought.","Unexpectedly, Ji Lingfeng changed the topic. \"Logically speaking, I shouldn’t argue with you guys. However, I’ve been through the gates of hell once and have gotten over many things. Second Uncle is old and should rest now. Don’t you think so?\"","He called out a few names in succession.","They were all the powerful elders who were the most active during this time.","These people were able to do so much during this period not only because they were senior in the Ji family, but also because of their high status. They controlled many of the Ji family’s businesses.","Ji Lingfeng’s sudden attack was undoubtedly a slap to everyone’s face."]},{"number":3740,"title":"Chapter 3740: Only Sacrifice on the Throne","paragraphs":["The Second Elder suddenly slammed the table and stood up. \"Patriarch, what do you mean by this?\"","Ji Lingfeng was seriously ill. Although he did not look energetic, it did not affect his aura as a direct descendant of the Ji family.","\"Second Uncle, it’s time to rest.\"","Silence.","He was oppressive as he looked at everyone and slowly said, \"Of course, it’s fine if you don’t want to rest. To prevent the family from turning chaotic again, I’ve already thought of a solution. If you want to maintain your position, I can only forbid you from having descendants. The Ji family can only have one Patriarch. The thoughts of the people occupying your positions can only be used to assist the Patriarch. To prevent anyone from having selfish motives, I can only use the most primitive and simplest method—eliminating the root of the problem.\"","The entire hall fell silent.","The elders looked at each other, no one daring to say anything.","The Second Elder’s eyes widened in disbelief. \"Patriarch, you...\"","\"The old patriarch made this rule when he was still around. I took over this position at a young age and thought this rule was inhumane, so I tacitly agreed to abolish it. But after all kinds of things, I now understand this rule’s deeper meaning. This rule is very good. I’ll reinstall it.\"","Silence.","The hall fell silent again.","Anyone with eyes could tell that Ji Lingfeng was serious.","He was different from the previous time. This time, he looked gentle and easygoing, as if he was negotiating with them.","However, it was even more oppressive and suffocating before.","The Second Elder returned to his seat dejectedly. \"Who do you want to support?\"","Without waiting for Ji Lingfeng’s reply, the Second Elder looked up sharply. \"Qiao Nian? She’s unsuitable to be the Patriarch. She doesn’t consider the consequences of her actions. She’s too stubborn and doesn’t know how to be tactful. I don’t deny her ability, and I believe the Ji family will rise to a higher level in her leadership. However, chances are equally high that the Ji family might be completely destroyed! Because she dares to do anything. However, the Patriarch can’t be like this. She has to learn to think for the family and sacrifice some things.\"","Ji Lingfeng smiled. \"Sacrifice...\"","He thought of himself.","Then, his hawk-like eyes landed on the Second Elder, and he slowly said, \"You’re right, so I’ve never thought of asking her to take over my position.","\"In the next few years, I’ll nurture Ji Nan well until he can take over my place. During this period, I hope that all of you will behave and not disappoint me.\"","His tone was calm, with a hint of surging hostility hidden below.","No matter how unconvinced the elders were, they knew this was not a good time to go against Ji Lingfeng.","The Patriarch had made up his mind this time. He would probably not give them face anymore.","Smart people knew how to adapt to the situation.","They didn’t want their bloodline to be lost in a moment of pride.","\"Then I’ll have to trouble all the uncles to look for He Lin for the handover,\" Ji Lingfeng said indifferently when he saw they were all listless and no longer spoke.","The second Elder opened his mouth. He could tell Ji Lingfeng was suppressing his anger under his calmness, but he did not object.","Xie Yun patiently pushed him out of the Righteousness Hall.","They did not speak along the way. When they were almost back in the room, Xie Yun faintly asked, \"Have you thought it through?\"","After this incident, Xie Yun no longer cared who would inherit the Ji family. However, she did not expect someone as stubborn as Ji Lingfeng to change his mind.","\"Ji Nan needs to grow.\" Ji Lingfeng did not say much. \"Thank you for all these years.\"","Tears welled up in Xie Yun’s eyes, but she did not say anything. She silently wheeled him in and brought him a cup of hot water to take the medicine."]},{"number":3741,"title":"Chapter 3741: Sister Nian: No, I’ll Take Two Times The Price","paragraphs":["In the next few days, Qiao Nian locked herself in the laboratory to solve the last secret of the USB drive.","She went out at eight every morning and only returned at nine at night.","If not for Ye Wangchuan insisting on sending her food and picking her up, Qiao Nian might have moved into the laboratory.","Fortunately, Ye Wangchuan was at home and someone was watching over her. That’s why Qiao Nian did not stay at the First Research Institute like before.","...","Time went by.","In the blink of an eye, half a month passed.","Since the account book was lost, Di Xicheng was quick, accurate, and ruthless to grab hold of the person in charge of the Leonard family and force him to let him go.","However, the report that he had painstakingly come up with was also left unsettled.","This way, the Leonard family was naturally unwilling to endure their disgust and continue working for Nie Qingru. They resolutely rejected the Country C project.","Next, Nie Qingru thought of other families to accept this project. However, the technical requirements were too high.","Besides the Leonard family, the other factions in Continent M were helpless even if they wanted to get this project.","They showed the sample to Country C several times but were unable to satisfy the other party. Country C also realized they might have been deceived.","Therefore, Country C quickly contacted Qing University’s research team and shamelessly proposed to pick up cooperation again.","Ye Maoshan called Qiao Nian as soon as he received the news.","Qiao Nian was still in the laboratory at this time. Upon receiving the call, she leaned against the experiment table. Her eyelashes drooped slightly as she licked her lips and said in a dry tone, \"They want to work together again?\"","Ye Maoshan asked seriously, \"Nian Nian, do we take it?\"","Qiao Nian paused for a second before smiling. \"Sure, but the price is different this time!\"","She quickly gave Ye Maoshan a number, almost flipping from a 10-figure to an 11-figure.","Ye Maoshan was a little hesitant. \"Isn’t this price too high?\"","Qiao Nian was very confident. \"They have no choice. They will accept this price.\"","She paused, and before Ye Maoshan could speak, she continued casually, \"If we don’t teach them a lesson, such things will continue to happen.\"","Ye Maoshan understood. \"Alright, I’ll discuss it with your father and the others.\"","\"By the way, you haven’t been busy recently, have you?\" After Ye Maoshan finished his business, he became concerned. \"You have to rest well.\"","Qiao Nian replied vaguely. After Ye Maoshan hung up, she put her phone in the locker and said to Xu Yi, \"Come on, let’s continue.\"","**","The team from Country C quickly received Beijing’s reply.","Beijing agreed to accept the order, and the conditions were discussed separately.","In the beginning, their team was optimistic. They felt that with Beijing’s benevolent style of doing things, the so-called conditions were just a formality.","Unexpectedly, when they arrived at the negotiation venue, Bo Jingxing threw out a string of harsh conditions without hesitation, causing Country C’s negotiation team’s expression to darken on the spot.","After a round of bargaining, the negotiation team led by Bo Jingxing had no intention of giving in. The price was still the same. It was up to them.","This way, Country C’s team could only say with a dark expression that they would go back and discuss it. They couldn’t give an immediate answer.","Bo Jingxing calmly stood up and shook the other party’s hand.","His thin lips twitched and he said, \"Go ahead. We’ll wait for the news.\"","He looked polite, but in fact, he had already won in terms of aura."]},{"number":3742,"title":"Chapter 3742: This Little Wolf Is Really Ruthless","paragraphs":["The Country C team left with a flick of their sleeves.","The negotiators following Bo Jingxing were still worried as they watched the other party leave in anger. \"Young Master Bo, do you think this collaboration will fail?\"","Bo Jingxing did not look up as he finished tidying up the documents. He was very relaxed and willful. \"We’ll wait for the results.\"","A few negotiators left the conference room with heavy expressions, not as relaxed as him.","Three days later, things were as Qiao Nian had expected.","After some discussion, Country C angrily agreed. The price Qiao Nian quoted to Ye Maoshan was actually double the original price.","Country C also understood that besides Beijing, they couldn’t find any other partners. They were very happy upon signing the contract.","At the press conference, both sides made statements on the prospects and expectations of the cooperation.","This news conference was also broadcast live on Instagram, causing a small-scale discussion in this field.","[Since when did Beijing accept chip orders? What did I miss?]","[Previously, I said that Beijing would definitely be the only other chip capital outside of Continent M. It seems I was right. This press conference is enough to explain everything.]","[I want to know what Continent M is doing. What are we doing? What happened to the blockade and sanctions? What a disappointing day.]","...","Compared to the passionate discussions on Instagram, Nie Qingru was under immense pressure.","Country C had already reached the step of signing a contract with Beijing. She was the one who interfered and successfully intercepted it through the base price and connections.","Later on, she was unable to complete the project, causing Country C to have no choice but to seek Beijing again. The other party doubled the price and even signed a harsh cooperation contract.","Country C was furious. At the same time they negotiated with Beijing, they sent out a legal team to fight a lawsuit and asked them to make up for their losses.","This was just a small matter.","It was not that Nie Qingru could not afford it.","However, Country C’s actions were a little humiliating.","This was why she was angry and found it unacceptable.","\"When will the lawyers from Country C arrive?\" Nie Qingru poured herself a glass of water and asked Shadow, standing quietly beside her.","Shadow raised his head and said calmly, \"They’ll be here tomorrow.\"","Nie Qingru took a sip of water before looking up and saying coldly, \"Tell our legal team to get ready. If they want to make connections, we’ll play along with them. However, public opinion must be in our hands. Try your best to focus on their pettiness for the failure of the cooperation.\"","\"I understand.\"","Nie Qingru frowned. \"That wolf cub is really ruthless. She actually asked for twice the original price.","\"She had long expected this price to be the psychological limit that Country C could accept. She just wanted to anger them and use them as a tool to inflict more harm on us.\"","She could even be so ruthless to her grandmother.","No wonder she was that person’s child.","It was like a wolf staring at its prey. Even if it had to chase for thousands of miles, it had to bite the prey’s neck.","Nie Qingru felt a wave of impatience and pressed down on her wildly beating eyebrows before calmly asking, \"How’s Xicheng? Is he feeling better?\"","She had been too busy for the past two weeks.","She couldn’t find the time to visit Di Xicheng at the hospital.","Shadow watched Nie Qingru walk to the sofa and sit down. She looked so tired. \"Young Master Di was discharged from the hospital the day before yesterday. He’s recuperating at home and has not gone out.\""]},{"number":3743,"title":"Chapter 3743: Finally Reaching a Cooperation with Country C","paragraphs":["\"Mm.\"","Nie Qingru’s expression eased as if she had finally heard good news.","\"Empress.\" Shadow looked at her in hesitation. \"Young Master Di...\"","Nie Qingru turned her head. Her cold and pale face was already filled with the traces of time. If there were still a trace of warmth in her eyes, which were only driven by benefits, it would probably be now.","She raised her hand to stop Shadow from continuing.","\"Stop. I know what you’re trying to say. I owe it to his family.\"","\"...Yes.\"","Shadow lowered his head.","Nie Qingru rested for a while before thinking of a solution. \"Keep an eye on Beijing.\"","Shadow looked up. \"What do you mean?\"","\"Didn’t the wolf cub want to use this opportunity to slap my face? Coincidentally, I’ll let her know that, in this world, things won’t go her way so easily.\"","Nie Qingru gently touched her velvet glove. Her thin lips curled up, resembling the peerless beauty of her youth a little.","It was just that her gaze was too cold.","\"It’s time for us to bury nails in Beijing.\"","**","The smooth progress of the negotiation with Country C was far beyond Beijing’s expectations. However, after successfully agreeing on the cooperation, everyone was very happy.","Even Jiang Zongjin had drunk a lot and was sent back to the staff dormitory after getting drunk at the celebration party.","\"Uncle Jiang, I’ll leave first.\"","The person who sent him back was Bo Jingxing. After settling him on the sofa, he turned around to change his shoes and leave.","Unexpectedly, he heard a low whimper behind him.","Bo Jingxing was stunned. He turned around and saw that the man lying on the sofa had sat up. His shadow was projected on the wall, bent over in pain like a disappointed man.","\"I did it.\"","Bo Jingxing did not expect this and hesitated to leave. Then, he heard Jiang Zongjin’s drunken murmur. \"Ji Qing, I did it.\"","Ji Qing...","Bo Jingxing seemed to have heard this name somewhere. His hand holding the car keys paused. He remembered hearing this name in the independent continent.","Qiao Nian’s mother?","Jiang Zongjin was still babbling and whimpering in pain. He was depressed, and it seemed he had endured it for a long time before he could vent his emotions.","\"But you’re no longer around.","\"...I couldn’t take care of our daughter without you.","\"Nian Nian...\"","At this point, Jiang Zongjin lowered his voice. He was sad and guilty, mixed with indescribable discomfort.","\"Nian Nian is too tired.\"","Bo Jingxing lowered his hand and recalled what he said to Qiao Nian that night in the independent continent.","His conscience seemed to be cut into pieces. Tonight, he couldn’t face the words he thought he would not regret saying.","Bo Jingxing walked over to get a glass of water for Jiang Zongjin and quietly comforted him. \"Uncle Jiang, have a glass of water.\"","He wanted to stay and take care of him.","Although he felt that Jiang Zongjin did not need his care, being able to do something was better than never making up for what he did wrong.","Bo Jingxing took care of Jiang Zongjin until he fell asleep in a drunken state. Then, he went inside and came out with a blanket.","Looking at the shabby furniture, he walked out to smoke a cigarette. A few minutes later, he sighed and dialed Ye Wangchuan’s number.","The other party did not pick up the call the first time.","He persevered and called a few more times.","Ye Wangchuan finally picked up. \"Speak.\"","His voice was quite cold."]},{"number":3744,"title":"Chapter 3744: Something Happened","paragraphs":["Bo Jingxing wondered why his good friend was treating him so indifferently. He smiled bitterly and said sincerely, \"I apologize for what happened previously.\"","Silence.","\"I shouldn’t have said that. I was too anxious. If Qiao Nian... needs my apology, I’m willing to apologize in person. I’ll apologize until you’re satisfied. I’m sorry, Wangchuan.\"","A few seconds passed.","A cold and arrogant male voice came from the other end. \"This is the last time.\"","Bo Jingxing immediately understood what he meant. He smiled and relaxed. He threw away the cigarette butt and was in the mood to joke. \"We’ve known each other for 20 years. Just because I’ve made Qiao Nian angry once, you wanted to cut ties with me and almost tortured me to death. You’re really my brother~!\"","Before Ye Wangchuan met Qiao Nian, Bo Jingxing had never thought his good friend would be so heartless once in love.","How was this dating? He was basically a ruler!","Bo Jingxing smiled. \"I’ll remember. There won’t be a next time.\"","\"Tsk.\"","Ye Wangchuan responded lazily. This matter was over.","Bo Jingxing looked at the moon and thought of something. Before hanging up, he asked, \"By the way, do you know what kind of person Qiao Nian’s mother is?\"","Uncle Jiang only dared to say it once drunk. He even kept his heart clean for 20 years and almost tortured himself to live to fulfill their promise.","He suddenly wondered what kind of person Ji Qing was.","After a long time, Ye Wangchuan’s lazy and clear voice came from the other end of the call. \"I don’t know. But to give birth to such a daughter, she must be someone to miss.\"","\"Tsk, can you not show off your love?\" Bo Jingxing smiled, but he agreed in his heart.","A person who could make everyone miss her was at least a good person.","Unfortunately, good people did not live long.","**","After the cooperation between Beijing and Country C was reached, it also meant that everyone from the scientific research team to the Ninth Branch would start to get busy.","Jiang Zongjin threw himself into work after sobering up. He worked overtime as if he did not care about his life and stared at every step of the work process.","Bo Jingxing was in charge at the Ninth Branch. He was also in charge of coordination with various units and tried his best to arrange the most reasonable assembly line plan.","After a few days of hard work, Beijing delivered the first batch of finished products to Country C for inspection.","Country C immediately tested the finished products. The quality was very high, living up to the extra price they paid.","Country C quickly reported this result to Beijing. Upon receiving the other party’s satisfactory news, they began large-scale production.","According to the agreement, the first batch of deliveries would be at the end of the month.","The end of December.","The first batch of goods from Beijing was rushed out. Everyone heaved a sigh of relief and did not forget to share this good news with Qiao Nian and Ye Wangchuan, who were far away in the independent continent.","There were still seven to eight days before the delivery. Originally, everyone was going to take a break to have a good rest so they could enter the second batch of production.","Unexpectedly, the day after everyone’s happy gathering, something happened. The staff in charge of inspection found many defective goods.","This was like a bolt from the blue that struck everyone’s hearts, catching the people from the Ninth Branch and the Qing University scientific research team off guard.","No one expected such a huge mess to happen in the last few days..."]},{"number":3745,"title":"Chapter 3745: Find the Mole First","paragraphs":["Bo Jingxing and Jiang Zongjin rushed to the event location to check.","\"Uncle Jiang, how is it?\" Bo Jingxing wasn’t from this field and was not very clear about the problem with the defective goods.","Jiang Zongjin squatted down to pick up one of the chips. He carefully examined it and inserted it into the detector. His expression became more and more solemn. In the end, he put down the chip and turned to Bo Jingxing. \"These chips are all missing one part of the process.\"","\"Missing one part?\" Bo Jingxing was in a daze. \"Why is there a part of the process missing?\"","There was someone in charge of every step of the process. They were strictly in charge to ensure that nothing would go wrong.","There was no problem with the previous test products given to Country C, but there was a problem with the first batch.","Jiang Zongjin shook his head. \"Chips are very small and look simple. In fact, the technology involved is complicated. If there’s a slight problem with the process, the chip can’t be used.","\"I checked this batch of goods. They all have the same problem. Someone must have been negligent, or—\" He did not want to say that. He looked at Bo Jingxing solemnly. \"Or someone deliberately tampered with it.\"","The people participating in the Country C project this time were all core members of the Ninth Branch and the scientific research team. Everyone had worked together for many years. Even if there was only a one in ten thousand chance of it being a mere coincidence, Jiang Zongjin was unwilling to think that it was deliberate.","However, the truth was right in front of him. This was a serious mistake in the first batch of goods. It could no longer be described as a coincidence. It could only be deliberate!","This person was too vicious.","Bo Jingxing had seen many dark sides of human nature. With a cold expression, he continued, \"Uncle Jiang, see which process is wrong. I’ll investigate immediately. No matter what the truth is, let’s find this person first!\"","\"Okay.\"","Jiang Zongjin only hesitated for half a second before agreeing.","They split up.","One studied the batch of defective chips again to confirm he had not missed anything. The other told Old Master Ye and the others about the situation and discussed countermeasures.","***","Ye Residence.","Before receiving the news, Ye Maoshan was playing with the birds. He used a grass root to play with the thrush in the cage, feeding it some food from time to time.","The thrush had long developed a personality. As soon as it saw him, it jumped to the front of the cage, spread its wings, and jumped up and down as if dancing. It was beautiful.","Ye Maoshan liked birds. It was a typical hobby of the old people in Beijing. He was even thinking of taking it out for a walk after feeding it.","Unexpectedly, the butler said Young Master Bo called him.","\"Why is he looking for me at this hour?\" Ye Maoshan put down the bird food. Puzzled, he wiped his hands and took the phone.","\"Hello, Jingxing.\" He greeted him.","\"Elder Ye, you finally picked up.\" Bo Jingxing heaved a sigh of relief and quickly told him in detail about the situation.","The more Ye Maoshan listened, the uglier his expression became. No longer in the mood to play with birds, he strode out. \"Where are you? Have you found that person?\"","Bo Jingxing then said that Jiang Zongjin was checking all the faulty chips. He had caught the person in charge of the process and had already confirmed it.","Furious, Ye Maoshan said in a deep voice, \"I’ll be right there.\"","Such a huge incident, he couldn’t go alone.","Ye Maoshan hung up on Bo Jingxing and got the chauffeur to drive him to the Wen and Wei residences. The three families then headed to the Ninth Branch together."]},{"number":3746,"title":"Chapter 3746: Caught a Mole, It’s Really Not Me","paragraphs":["Everyone in the Ninth Branch felt that something was amiss today. The atmosphere was extremely solemn. Even those not involved in the chip project could sense the signs of trouble.","Everyone was in a hurry and tried their best to reduce their presence. It was a stark contrast to the relaxed atmosphere in the Ninth Branch two days ago.","It was already two hours later when Ye Maoshan rushed over.","Wei Lou represented the Wei Family this time.","The one representing the Wen Family was Old Master Wen.","Among the three of them, Wei Lou was the youngest. He walked at the back humbly.","He was completely different from two years ago in Rao City. No longer with the eye-catching bird feathers on his head, his hair was shaved into an inch-long cut, and he was dressed in a neat leather jacket. He relied on his handsome and unyielding face with distinct edges and corners to support his appearance, looking strong and manly.","Old Master Wei had passed away two years ago and his father was not in Beijing. Today, he would represent the Wei Family.","Fortunately, Wei Lou took over the Wei Family’s matters for the past two years. He was not completely ignorant. Not only did he know how to be humble, but he was also considerate to open the door for the two elders.","\"Grandpa Ye, Grandpa Wen, you guys go in first.\"","\"Mm.\"","Ye Maoshan was straightforward and did not stand on ceremony with him. He nodded and walked in.","Old Master Wen walked behind and praised him with a smile, \"You’ve grown up.\"","Wei Lou was stunned for a moment. Then, he thought of something and smiled without saying anything. He waited for the two of them to enter before following them in.","...","The scene that greeted them when they entered was of someone with clenched fists facing Bo Jingxing with red eyes. \"It wasn’t me.\"","The man with his back to them was tall and burly. They couldn’t see his face, but they could feel his excitement.","\"Young Master Bo, believe me. It really wasn’t me.\" Jiang Tianzhi’s face dripped with sweat as he tried to explain himself. \"I have no reason to do this. Why would I betray the Ninth Branch? I...\"","Bo Jingxing, on the other hand, was cold. He only said calmly, \"Then explain why a problem happened on your end? Give me a convincing reason and I’ll believe you.\"","\"I—\" Jiang Tianzhi found it difficult to defend himself.","He stood in place, feeling as if a bucket of cold water had been poured over his head. A chill ran down his spine and his mind went blank.","\"I don’t know why there’s a problem...\"","\"Enough.\"","Bo Jingxing gestured for him to stop. He did not want to listen to his \"quibbles\" anymore. He took off his glasses and rubbed his swollen temples, his peach blossom eyes filled with gloom.","\"The Ninth Branch can’t tolerate traitors. I can’t tolerate such people either!\"","At this moment, from the corner of his eye, he saw Ye Maoshan and the rest coming in. He quickly stood up and greeted him, \"Elder Ye.\"","Then, he saw the two people behind him and hurriedly called out, \"Elder Wen.\"","As for Wei Lou, he was the same age as him.","He only nodded politely. \"Young Master Wei.\"","Ye Maoshan was the first to wave his hand, indicating the person standing in his room. \"Is he the mole you mentioned?\"","\"He’s the most suspicious person we’ve caught so far,\" Bo Jingxing said.","Ye Maoshan walked over and stood in front of Jiang Tianzhi. His sharp gaze seemed to pierce through his soul. \"Did you betray the Ninth Branch?\"","His tone was neutral.","However, it induced uneasiness in a person.","Jiang Tianzhi’s expression changed slightly, but he insisted on looking at him. \"I didn’t.\"","Ye Maoshan raised his eyebrows as if he did not expect him to retort. He looked at him without saying anything else.","Jiang Tianzhi looked into his eyes. His eyes were bloodshot, feeling pain and excitement. \"It really wasn’t me. I don’t know what happened either. Believe me!\""]},{"number":3747,"title":"Chapter 3747: Think About Who Betrayed the Ninth Branch","paragraphs":["Ye Maoshan’s eyes narrowed, and the corners of his mouth lowered.","He did not say anything.","Bo Jingxing walked over and said in a low voice, \"He has refused to admit guilt or tell who’s behind him.\"","Jiang Tianzhi’s heart was filled with sorrow. He knew it was useless to explain, but he still clenched his fists, gritted his teeth, and whispered, \"I really didn’t do it...\"","Bo Jingxing glanced at him, not saying if he believed him or not. The main reason was that they had only found Jiang Tianzhi. Just as he had said, Jiang Tianzhi was the most suspicious.","Bo Jingxing never used his emotions to judge right from wrong. He was more inclined to speak with evidence.","At this moment, Ye Maoshan said calmly, \"Other than him, there are no other suspicious people?\"","Bo Jingxing took a deep breath. \"Not yet.\"","\"Where’s Zongjin?\" Ye Maoshan walked forward and sat down.","Bo Jingxing said, \"Uncle Jiang is still checking that batch of defective chips. In addition, I also got someone to check the other chips to see how many are defective.\"","\"Elder Ye, what should we do now?\" Bo Jingxing was more concerned about this. \"We can slowly catch the mole, but there are just five days before the delivery time. If we can’t hand it over... it will definitely arouse Country C’s dissatisfaction. Secondly, this is the first time Beijing has accepted an order, and it has caused a farce of being unable to hand over the goods. It will affect our reputation greatly. This is not good news.\"","Ye Maoshan glared at him. \"Do I need you to tell me this?\"","Was this not obvious!","Bo Jingxing felt awkward.","Ye Maoshan was not bickering with him. It was just his temper flaring up. He thought for a moment and made arrangements. \"Quickly count how much is missing. Then, we’ll immediately get someone to start work. We’ll go without rest and see how much can be rushed out. You guys calculate the shortage of goods. I’ll go with Elder Wen and the others to Country C’s negotiating team to see if we can settle privately and extend the delivery time.\"","\"I’m afraid it’s a little difficult to talk to Country C...\" Bo Jingxing looked worried.","Ye Maoshan naturally knew that. He patted his shoulder and said slowly, \"There’s no other way. We’ll only know the outcome after we talk.\"","Bo Jingxing was speechless.","Ye Maoshan continued, \"I’ll contact Wangchuan and see if he has any ideas. In short, we’ll split up and try our best to resolve the matter. We can’t afford to stand here and debate who’s right and who’s wrong and who’s responsible.\"","\"Okay.\"","Bo Jingxing did not hesitate. He was born to act and immediately went to make arrangements.","On the other hand, Jiang Tianzhi was left on his own. He stood there cautiously and uneasily. He didn’t know whether to leave or stay. He was very embarrassed.","Ye Maoshan took a sip of water and glanced at him, then said in a dignified and calm voice, \"You should think about how this happened.\"","\"You... believe me?\" Jiang Tianzhi almost cried as he looked at him in disbelief.","Ye Maoshan lowered his eyes. There was not much expression on his face, still very much serious and oppressive. \"There’s no point in me believing you. You have to think of a way to prove your innocence yourself. Otherwise, relying on others won’t change the outcome. Think carefully about which part went wrong. If it wasn’t you, you have to think of some clues.\"","Jiang Tianzhi listened to his words and fell into deep thought.","He had conscientiously guarded his own process. Logically speaking, it was impossible for anything to go wrong, but Young Master Bo mentioned that only his part of the whole process had gone wrong...","Since it was impossible for him to miss a defect in the product, someone must have done something when he was not paying attention."]},{"number":3748,"title":"Chapter 3748: Actually, Everyone Knows","paragraphs":["He had been extremely careful these days. Moreover, Bo Jingxing had sealed off their production line. Outsiders couldn’t come into contact with the chip project.","A figure flashed across his mind as if a thunderclap had split open layers of fog. His vision suddenly opened up—but this person surprised him, and he was unwilling to believe it.","Before Ye Maoshan and the others left, he said in a hoarse voice, \"On the third day of the project, someone sent me an access card.\"","At the back, Wei Lou turned around and glanced at him. \"Who was it?\"","\"He’s my junior. He was supposed to participate in this project, but Master Cheng didn’t choose him. In the end, he gave me this opportunity.\"","Jiang Tianzhi took a deep breath and said a name with a complicated expression, \"Yu Wenhao.\"","After Yu Wenhao repeatedly targeted Qiao Nian out of jealousy, Master Cheng was extremely disappointed in him. Although he still allowed him to retain his identity as a direct disciple, he no longer relied on him.","Jiang Tianzhi could tell that Master Cheng wanted to use the cold treatment to temper his junior’s personality and lose his impetuousness.","However, Yu Wenhao did not notice Master Cheng’s deeper meaning. Ever since he returned from the weapons exhibition, his personality had become increasingly gloomy. He became a loner and did not interact with others.","However, he would occasionally talk to him.","He did not know how he lost his access card that day. Yu Wenhao picked it up and said he would return it to him. At that time, he accidentally knocked over the cup and wet his jacket.","He went to change his coat and was away for a while.","Jiang Tianzhi carefully explained the matter. \"He was still there when I returned. I asked him, and he said he was waiting for me to hand the access card in person. I didn’t think too much about it and thought he was just being responsible. Moreover, he left after giving me the access card. I didn’t notice anything wrong...\"","In fact, if not for Ye Maoshan’s reminder, he might not have been able to recall that day’s episode.","Jiang Tianzhi mustered his courage and looked at the corridor. \"If someone really destroyed the chip through me, it can only be... him.\"","\"Pfft.\" Wei Lou did not say anything. He waved his hand and left.","He hated these dirty tricks the most.","However, he had seen many people like Wei Ying and Shen Jingyan play tricks. He was very experienced in dealing with people who liked to play a cheap trick behind their backs.","Upon leaving, he turned to Ye Maoshan and Old Master Wen and said, \"I won’t go with you to see the representatives from Country C.\"","He turned to Ye Maoshan. \"I’m going to catch someone.\"","He was not good at negotiations.","The Wei Family was not in the business of negotiating.","He was better at catching villains.","Ye Maoshan looked at his flushed face and reminded him, \"Just capture him and see who’s behind this.\"","\"Okay.\"","Wei Lou could not help but say.","\"Actually, Old Master, you also know who it is, don’t you? Besides the Empress of Continent M, who else could have deliberately destroyed the cooperation project?\"","Ye Maoshan glared at him. \"You little brat.\"","However, he could tell from his tone that he did not mean to refute. It could be considered a tacit agreement with Wei Lou’s guess. However, he still said, \"It’s useless even if we guess correctly. We still have to find evidence.\"","Wei Lou hummed and turned to leave.","Ye Maoshan said to Old Master Wen, \"Let’s go. We’ll talk to them and see if we can extend the delivery time.\"","**","Ye Wangchuan received a call from Old Master Ye a few hours later."]},{"number":3749,"title":"Chapter 3749: Still Trying to Run At This Time","paragraphs":["At home, Ye Wangchuan was wearing pajamas. The belt around was loosely tied, revealing his fair collarbone. His skin was as fair as jade, and he was drinking water.","Hearing the suppressed anger in Ye Maoshan’s voice as he briefly explained the situation, he roughly understood. He lowered the glass and replied casually, \"So the current situation is that Country C is only willing to agree to a three-day delay, but Jingxing says it will take at least ten days to complete it. There’s a seven-day gap, and you can’t deliver it as scheduled...\"","\"You don’t have to repeat it for me.\" Ye Maoshan was already suppressing his anger. He suppressed his temper again and said, \"Country C is unwilling to relent no matter what. Do you have any way to make up for this batch of goods?\"","Ye Wangchuan casually placed the glass on the bar counter and sat on the high chair. His long legs were straight and well-defined. \"I’ll tell Ji Lin to look for the Leonard family. They should have excess stock.\"","\"They’re willing to help?\" Old Master Ye hesitated. \"Aren’t they from the reclusive families...\"","Ye Wangchuan supported his chin with one hand and said calmly, \"Didn’t you teach me since I was young that everything in the world is influenced and determined by benefits?\"","\"That’s true.\" Ye Maoshan still did not think that the Leonard family would stab Nie Qingru in the back.","\"As long as we give them enough benefits, there’s no reason for them to reject us. Wait for my news.\" Ye Wangchuan’s voice was light and unhurried, giving people a sense of security.","\"Be careful.\"","Ye Maoshan did not know his private forces, but there was no point in continuing at this point.","He thought of something and told Ye Wangchuan. \"By the way, the mole we caught this time, you and Nian Nian know him.\"","\"Who is it?\"","\"Yu Wenhao.\"","Ye Maoshan continued, \"It’s said that he’s Master Cheng’s last disciple. Because Master Cheng didn’t let him participate in the chip development, he was unhappy and caused trouble. That kid from the Wei Family has already gone to catch him. Let’s see if he has escaped. We can still catch him if he hasn’t left customs yet.\"","\"Okay,\" Ye Wangchuan replied calmly. He was not in a good mood.","\"Anyway, be careful outside. Also, take good care of your girlfriend. Don’t be so sloppy all day long!\"","Ye Maoshan hung up.","Ye Wangchuan looked at the dimming screen light and went into the kitchen to personally prepare Qiao Nian’s lunch.","...","There was a time difference between the independent continent and Beijing.","It was early morning on the independent continent, but it was already night in Beijing.","It was late winter, and the temperature was close to freezing. Beijing’s geographical location was not good, so it was destined that such a winter night would not be warm.","Around nine o’clock, light snow fell from the sky.","In the blink of an eye, the rain and snow turned into heavy snowfall, covering the ground with a layer of white.","The Beijing airport was bustling with people.","The central heating system was turned on, contrasting with the snow and ice outside.","Even though it was almost 10 p.m., many people were still coming and going in the airport. Some were chatting and laughing, while others were in a hurry.","In this lively space, a thin man stood beside the bathroom at Gate 231 of Terminal 3.","At the man’s feet was a red suitcase with a cotton jacket draped over it. However, the strange thing was that the man had taken off his jacket but did not take off his glasses and hat."]},{"number":3750,"title":"Chapter 3750: Yu Wenhao? That’s the Name, Right?","paragraphs":["The plane would take off in an hour.","Some people were already sitting at Gate 231 waiting for their tickets to be checked, but many seats were still empty.","However, the man beside the washroom had no intention of walking over. He held a paper cup, making small talk as he leaned against the corner and drank the water.","It was more like he was reducing his presence and killing time.","The reason was that he had not finished the half-filled paper cup for almost an hour. He just sipped it from time to time.","His behavior was really strange.","However, most people at the airport were only here to catch a plane. No one would notice his strangeness.","Most people did not look at him.","Occasionally, one or two young girls would sneak a glance at him and discuss with their friends. \"Hey, do you think the person over there is a celebrity? Look, he’s even wearing glasses and a cap. He’s even covering his chin with a scarf. Isn’t this the standard for celebrities to hide from the paparazzi?\"","\"Him?\" Another girl glanced at the man seeking cover near the washroom and said half-jokingly, \"Look at his panicked expression. He doesn’t look like a celebrity hiding from the paparazzi. He looks more like someone who committed a crime and is on the run.\"","\"Hehe, your mouth is so foul.\"","\"I’m just telling the truth.\"","The two of them whispered a few words and changed the topic to celebrities. They never looked at him again.","They discussed the hottest top celebrity, Jiang Li, to the stage scandal not long ago, and then to the 18th-tier female celebrity, Tang Ning...","They talked enthusiastically.","Suddenly, one of the girls’ eyes lit up. She grabbed her friend’s arm excitedly and shook it nervously. \"Oh my god, oh my god! Look at the three o’clock direction. A top-notch handsome man! Hurry up and look. If you don’t look, you’ll be down on luck for a year!\"","\"Where?\"","The other girl looked in the direction she pointed. Sure enough, she saw a man with a buzz cut walking towards them.","\"Gosh! This must be a celebrity!\"","\"You think so too? Perhaps he’s newly debuted? I’ve never seen him before! That height and looks... Could he be from the modeling industry?\"","\"It’s possible...\"","They suppressed their excitement and wondered where the handsome man came from. Next, they stared as the man in a leather jacket brushed past them, bringing with him a gust of wind.","The two girls held their breaths and only dared to grab each other’s hands after he left. They screamed, \"So handsome!\"","...","Their voices were not soft, attracting the attention of some people.","The man absent-mindedly leaning against the wall looked up warily. Then, he immediately stuffed the paper cup into the waste bin, grabbed his suitcase, and prepared to run.","Unexpectedly, just as he took a step, a long leg blocked his path.","Yu Wenhao looked down from the tip of the other party’s shiny shoes to his long legs, to the other party’s good waist and strong face.","His gaze then met a pair of amorous peach blossom eyes that did not match his face.","\"Yu Wenhao?\" The man’s voice was neither fast nor slow, but he blocked his way. He even took a lighter from his pocket, as if he wanted to light a cigarette.","However, the other party quickly realized this was the airport and stuffed the lighter into his pocket. He used his height advantage to size him up from above.","\"That’s the name, isn’t it?\"","Silence.","Yu Wenhao felt an invisible grip on his heart, feeling it was about to jump out of his chest. His throat was so dry that he could not immediately refute."]},{"number":3751,"title":"Chapter 3751: Caught the Mole","paragraphs":["Wei Lou put his hands in his pockets as he looked at him. \"That’s not your name?\"","Yu Wenhao gulped and finally found his voice. \"You’ve got the wrong person.\"","As he spoke, he tried to skirt around with his luggage.","The man moved aside to let him pass. Just as he secretly heaved a sigh of relief, a hand grabbed the handle of his suitcase, and the man grinned at him. \"Looks like it’s you.\"","Buzz!","Yu Wenhao’s mind went blank for a moment. Then, he suddenly let go and ran away without caring about his luggage.","It looked like he was running for his life as he charged forward crazily.","Unfortunately, Wei Lou was already prepared and chased after him almost as he started running.","He kicked Yu Wenhao from behind.","\"Ah!\" The person fleeing in panic fell to the ground and slid half a meter before stabilizing himself. He couldn’t care less about his distorted face as he tried to get up to continue running.","However, it was too late.","Wei Lou had already stepped on the back of his hand, which was about to lift off the ground, and crushed it forcefully. He sneered. \"Why did you run? You dare to betray the Ninth Branch, and you’re still afraid of being caught?\"","Yu Wenhao was shocked. Realizing that he could no longer escape, he gritted his teeth and raised his blood-red eyes, saying hoarsely, \"I-I want to see Teacher!\"","\"Tsk.\" Wei Lou squatted down and pinched his chin. He sneered. \"You still have the cheek to see Master Cheng?\"","Yu Wenhao’s throat was dry, but he was more afraid. His eyes were filled with horror, and he could not imagine the future. He felt that everything was over, and his mind was in darkness.","\"I-I want to see Teacher.\"","He could only repeat this sentence, as if he could still be forgiven after seeing Master Cheng. \"I’m not telling you. I want to see my teacher.\"","Wei Lou’s cold smile disappeared. There was no warmth in his peach-blossom eyes as he bent down, twisted his collar, and pulled him forward like he was grabbing a chick. \"Alright, I’ll take you there.\"","The people at Gate 231 were all stunned. Everyone looked at them, and their mouths were wide open as if they were on the set of a police drama.","Soon, airport security arrived.","Wei Lou told them the situation and asked for handcuffs. Then, he threw Yu Wenhao into the back of the car.","He did not waste his breath on him. \"I have a bad temper. You’d better be honest. If you cause trouble on the way, I don’t mind sending you to see God.\"","Yu Wenhao’s thoughts were instantly extinguished. He could only lie on the ground in the back, looking miserable and pitiful.","**","Qiao Nian’s cell phone was on silent in the laboratory. Even if someone called or sent her a message, she would not know.","Therefore, when she found out about the problem in Beijing, it was already time for Ye Wangchuan to deliver food to her.","Ye Wangchuan’s dishes were light, and he only made her one spicy dish. Qiao Nian was not picky with her food, but she would still eat the spicy dish first.","Ye Wangchuan saw her staring at the spicy chicken and gestured for her to eat some vegetables.","Qiao Nian looked at him cynically, but she did not say anything. She silently picked up two pieces of vegetables and frowned as she ate.","Ye Wangchuan saw that she was eating silently again and was unwilling to pick up food. He helplessly broke the principle of not talking while eating. \"You’re on your period. You’ll feel better if you eat more vegetables.\""]},{"number":3752,"title":"Chapter 3752: Don’t Mention That Person’s Name Next Time","paragraphs":["\"It’s the third day.\" Qiao Nian couldn’t even be bothered to look up, looking very reasonable. \"It’s already the third day. There’s no need to pay attention to these things.\"","In the past, her life had been even rougher. When she had her period, she would take a painkiller to withstand the pain. She would still do what she had to do. She wouldn’t postpone her matters for her period.","The past few days, she had been sleeping early and waking up late according to Ye Wangchuan’s request. She also drank brown sugar water. It was enough to nourish her body.","It was so healthy that she suspected that she was not in her early twenties, but that she was about to die in her seventies or eighties.","However, the person who was usually easy to talk to was very stubborn on this matter. He would stare at her every time until she rested.","Ye Wangchuan did not say anything. He picked up the serving chopsticks and got a piece of crispy chicken and green vegetables. Then, he said casually, \"Eat. Eat some.\"","Silence.","Qiao Nian had never been gentle. She sighed and raised her hand to signal surrender. Then, she picked up her chopsticks and continued eating.","She ate very attentively and did not speak much.","Ye Wangchuan waited for her to finish eating before passing her a bowl of chicken soup.","Qiao Nian hesitated for half a second as she stared at the bowl. She took it ruthlessly, pinched her nose, and finished it in one breath.","She looked like she was taking medicine.","Ye Wangchuan couldn’t help but smile, filled with helplessness and compromise.","\"I stewed it all morning...\"","Qiao Nian returned the bowl and said weakly, \"So I drank it all.\"","She wouldn’t have drunk it today if she didn’t know that he had specially made chicken soup for her.","Sigh.","Gentleness was not a sin.","However, some people’s gentleness was quite fatal!","After eating and drinking her fill, she was so lazy that she did not want to move. She looked as Ye Wangchuan put away the food box and slowly told her about Beijing.","Qiao Nian listened nonchalantly at first, about to fall asleep. Her eyelids drooped, hiding her beautiful black eyes.","But when Ye Wangchuan said that Old Master Ye and Jiang Zongjin were very anxious, she finally opened her eyes and looked over alertly. \"I can ask Lu Zhi for help.\"","Qiao Nian hesitated a little. However, she knew that Ye Wangchuan would not think wrongly.","Unexpectedly, as soon as she finished speaking, a well-defined hand covered her eyes and prevented her from looking. He said slowly, \"I can solve it. There’s no need to look for him.\"","Qiao Nian blinked and asked noncommittally, \"How do you plan to resolve it?\"","Ye Wangchuan looked at her face that was so close to him. Her eyelashes even gently brushed the shocked electric current in his palm. He pursed his lips slightly. \"I asked Ji Lin to look for the Leonard family. The matter is already 70 to 80% confirmed.\"","\"You looked for the Leonard family?\" Qiao Nian was really a little surprised. She thought for a moment before saying, \"If Nie Qingru knew, she would be angered to death.\"","\"Mm.\" His gaze landed on the girl’s red lips. A little distracted, he suddenly called out, \"Nian Nian.\"","Qiao Nian couldn’t see. She only heard his hoarse voice and was stunned for half a second. \"Hm?\"","The corners of Ye Wangchuan’s mouth curled up slightly, and stars fell from his eyes. He looked at the girl’s fair face without blinking, his Adam’s apple moving up and down. \"Kiss?\"","Silence.","Without waiting for Qiao Nian’s reply, he suddenly pulled her into his arms and lowered his head.","After the kiss, he buried his head in the girl’s neck and said softly, \"Remember not to mention that person’s name next time.\"","\"What?\" Qiao Nian caught her breath before realizing who he was talking about.","Ye Wangchuan had already sorted out his emotions and sat up straight. Then, he explained to her the deal between Ji Lin and the Leonard family."]},{"number":3753,"title":"Chapter 3753: Because of Qiao Nian, Didn’t You Give Up on Me Long Ago?","paragraphs":["Qiao Nian listened to his small talk, about how he planned to resolve this dilemma.","She was not in a good mood.","Halfway through, she grew a little distracted, the scene of the kiss kept replaying in her mind.","Qiao Nian pressed her forehead, not understanding what was wrong with her. She took a deep breath and tried to focus.","Finally, Ye Wangchuan finished explaining his plan.","Qiao Nian pulled down her baseball cap and leaned back lazily. \"Alright, we’ll do as you say.\"","**","Beijing.","Wei Lou personally brought the guy back.","Yu Wenhao kept clamoring to see Master Cheng, saying that if Master Cheng didn’t come, he would not answer any questions.","Wei Lou knew what he was up to. After bringing him back to the Ninth Branch, he asked Bo Jingxing to inform Master Cheng and the others to come over.","Because this matter also involved Jiang Tianzhi, he was also brought over.","In the blink of an eye, the room was filled with people.","Ye Maoshan, Master Cheng, and Jiang Zongjin were all present.","Apart from them, Bo Jingxing, as the one in charge of the Ninth Branch, definitely could not be absent. In addition, there was also Jiang Tianzhi and Wei Lou... The small meeting room was filled with people.","Yu Wenhao had never seen such a scene before.","After entering, he lowered his head and stared at his toes with a pale face. He did not speak, as if he was a block of wood.","Wei Lou put his hands in his jacket pockets. Seeing him silent, he sneered and kicked him from behind, urging impatiently, \"Tell me. The person you want to see is here. Are you pretending to be mute now?\"","\"Ah.\" Yu Wenhao had already injured his knee from the fall. Suddenly kicked from behind, his leg bent and he almost knelt on the ground.","Wei Lou looked at his pitiful appearance and said coldly, \"Don’t act like someone bullied you. No matter how pitiful you are now, you can’t act like a victim. Save your performance!\"","Yu Wenhao’s face alternated between green and white. He looked up at the people in the room and his gaze landed on Master Cheng. He stammered, \"T-Teacher.\"","Master Cheng immediately turned his head away. He was disappointed in him and was unwilling to even look at him.","Yu Wenhao’s heart went cold at his reaction. He shouted even more sorrowfully, \"T-Teacher, I’m sorry!\"","Master Cheng suppressed the anger and disappointment in his heart and finally turned to look at him again. \"Who asked you to tamper with the program?\"","Yu Wenhao met his stern eyes and hesitated before saying, \"Will you forgive me if I say it?\"","\"Heh?\" Master Cheng was so angry that he almost laughed. \"Are you bargaining with me? You’ve made such a huge mistake. Have you ever thought you were letting down your seniors, your fellow disciples working day and night, and the people from Qing University’s scientific research team... Until now, you’re still thinking about how to get yourself out. Wenhao, you’re too disappointing!\"","Yu Wenhao felt as if he had been hit on the head. His brain buzzed.","Looking up at his teacher’s angry and disappointed expression, he was silent for a moment before blurting out, \"Didn’t you already feel disappointed in me?!\"","Master Cheng paused and frowned. \"What are you talking about?\"","\"You’ve long given up on me.\" Yu Wenhao pinched his palms, his eyes red. \"From the day I offended Qiao Nian, you’ve been disappointed in me! Isn’t that why you didn’t let me participate in this chip project? So don’t tell me that you’re only disappointed now... Do you believe this hypocritical excuse... Ah!\""]},{"number":3754,"title":"Chapter 3754: How Much Do You Think Your Rotten Life Is Worth?","paragraphs":["Before Yu Wenhao could finish speaking, the left side of his face was slapped hard. His eardrums buzzed, and his face jerked to the side. Blood filled his mouth.","Master Cheng’s hand was still in midair, and his hand trembled. It was unknown if he was angry or disappointed, but he did not give him any face.","\"You’re selfish, narrow-minded, and only see yourself. That’s why I’m disappointed in you!\"","Silence.","Master Cheng’s chest heaved violently. He slowly lowered his hand, extremely disappointed in him. \"You’re right. I’m not worthy of being your teacher. Apart from teaching you knowledge, I couldn’t teach you how to be a person. It’s my negligence. Just pretend that you don’t have me as your teacher!\"","In the beginning, Yu Wenhao was still unconvinced after being slapped. Now that Master Cheng wanted to sever ties with him, he became anxious and reached out to grab Master Cheng’s clothes. \"Teacher, I was wrong.\"","Master Cheng avoided his hand and turned to Bo Jingxing and the others. \"I’m sorry, I’m tired. Let’s deal with this matter as it should be. I was in the wrong this time. I’ll write a self-reflection letter after this matter is settled.\"","Everyone watched Master Cheng leave.","Jiang Zongjin looked at Master Cheng’s departing figure and paused. He tilted his head and said to the person beside him, \"I’m going out for a while.\"","Only Old Master Ye and the rest were left in the room.","Once Master Cheng left, the others did not have that much patience with Yu Wenhao.","With his arms crossed, Bo Jingxing adjusted his glasses and smiled. He looked gentle and harmless as he walked to the dejected Yu Wenhao and raised his chin.","\"How is it? Have you figured it out? Tell me.\"","\"I can say.\"","Yu Wenhao’s eyes met his. He hesitated and insisted, \"But you have to promise you’ll let me go after I’m done. You can’t make things difficult for me.\"","\"Pfft.\" Bo Jingxing laughed.","Looking at Yu Wenhao’s ashen face, he suppressed his laughter. \"I’m sorry, what did you say? I didn’t hear you clearly. Say it again.\"","Yu Wenhao vaguely sensed danger, but at this juncture, he had to fight for the greatest benefit for himself.","Hence, he braced himself and looked at Bo Jingxing as he repeated himself. \"I want to ensure my safety.\"","\"Oh.\"","This time, Bo Jingxing responded without a change in expression.","The next second, he suddenly grabbed his shoulder and hit his stomach with his knee.","Yu Wenhao’s vision turned black from the pain. He knelt on the ground and held his stomach for a long time.","Bo Jingxing wiped his fingers with a handkerchief grabbed from somewhere and squatted down. He grabbed his chin again and raised his face to look at him.","\"Who gave you the confidence to talk to me like that?\"","\"You...\"","\"Do you know how much trouble you’ve caused and how many people have to pay for what you have done?\"","Yu Wenhao’s angry eyes shrank. He felt guilty.","Bo Jingxing looked down at him and forced him to listen. \"It took the Qing University scientific research team ten years for this chip breakthrough. It took us a year and a half to negotiate this order with Country C. And you, to vent your dissatisfaction, ignored the efforts of so many people and almost ruined everything.","\"You still have the cheek to try to negotiate with me? Do you think you’re shameless enough or do you think your rotten life is worth enough?\"","Yu Wenhao’s shoulders trembled in fear when he saw his life was on the line. \"You can’t punish me in private.\""]},{"number":3755,"title":"Chapter 3755: She’s Just an Emotionless Machine","paragraphs":["\"Tsk, are you afraid of death?\"","Bo Jingxing let go of his hand and stood up, looking at him from the corner of his eye. \"Don’t worry, a dirty thing like you is unworthy of me attacking you.\"","\"Phew.\"","Yu Wenhao lost all his strength and sprawled heavily on the ground.","Bo Jingxing’s heartless voice announced the outcome of his treatment. \"I’ll hand you over to the police. What you did is enough to sentence you to more than 20 years in prison. You can spend the rest of your life in prison!\"","\"No!\" Yu Wenhao’s head jerked up, and his eyes widened in disbelief. \"Impossible. No. I want to see my teacher!\"","He crawled in a panic, trying to stand up and rush out to find Master Cheng and ask for help.","When he touched Jiang Tianzhi, who had been silent the entire time, the latter pushed him away. He looked at him coldly, saying, \"Yu Wenhao, you brought this on yourself. If you still have a conscience, don’t try to implicate Master Cheng further. Take responsibility for your actions!\"","Yu Wenhao couldn’t hear anything. He only heard Bo Jingxing say that he wanted to hand him over to the police and sentence him to 20 years in prison...","He mumbled, \"I want to see Teacher. I want to see Teacher.\"","No one in the room paid him any attention.","Wei Lou felt a stinging in his eyes when he saw him pretending to be crazy. He straightened his back and said to Bo Jingxing, \"You guys continue. I’ll be leaving now.\"","Bo Jingxing watched him leave elegantly and said, \"Thank you.\"","Wei Lou raised his hand and said without looking back, \"I’m not helping you, nor am I helping your friend. I’m helping Qiao Nian.\"","Bo Jingxing narrowed his eyes as if he had thought of something interesting. The corners of his lips curled up like a fox. He took out his phone and sent a WeChat message to his good friend in the distant independent continent: [Master Wang, you have a lot of love rivals.]","After sending the message, he realized that Ye Maoshan was still there. He quickly put away his phone and walked over respectfully. \"Elder Ye, look...\"","\"I have nothing to see.\" Ye Maoshan came over to take a look at the mole. He had been making small talk and did not participate in the interrogation. \"We’ll do as you say.\"","In fact, they could deal with Yu Wenhao in private and even use some means to make him speak. However, Yu Wenhao was still Master Cheng’s last disciple. No matter how disappointed Master Cheng was in Yu Wenhao, they still had to show respect to this old man.","Handing Yu Wenhao over to the police was the best solution.","\"Okay.\"","Bo Jingxing immediately called the police.","His identity was special, so the police did not dare to be negligent. Soon, they sent a police car to pick Yu Wenhao up. The sirens at the entrance of the Ninth Branch whistled past...","**","Yu Wenhao did not manage to escape successfully and was even sent into the police car by the Ninth Branch.","Continent M received the news immediately.","Nie Qingru listened to her subordinate’s report, not even bothering to look up. She waved her hand indifferently. \"I understand. You can leave.\"","Her subordinate bowed slightly and asked carefully, \"Empress, are we not going to do anything?\"","\"Do anything?\" Nie Qingru looked at him in surprise and said coldly, \"Why should I care? From the beginning, he was destined to be discarded.\"","How could anyone be so cruel in this world?","The subordinate only felt a chill run down his spine, and he did not dare to raise his head. After bowing respectfully, he quietly retreated.","Shadow entered as the subordinate went out. He brushed past him and walked towards Nie Qingru. \"Empress.\""]},{"number":3756,"title":"Chapter 3756: The Old Demoness Just Found Out She’s Been Tricked by Master Wang","paragraphs":["\"Any progress?\" Nie Qingru swirled the wine in a good mood.","Shadow lowered his head slightly. \"The latest news is that Country C is only willing to delay the delivery for three days, but Yu Wenhao destroyed a large batch of chips. No matter how hard they work, they can’t finish it in three days.\"","\"Pfft.\" Nie Qingru sneered, feeling even happier. She held the wine glass and asked with a smile, \"Where’s that wolf cub? Does she know about this?\"","\"She should know.\"","\"Oh?\" Nie Qingru said unhurriedly, \"Then what does she plan to do? Get Lu Zhi’s help?\"","Shadow raised his head. The woman’s confident and flamboyant face was reflected in his eyes. No matter how many marks the years had left on her face, they could not hide her charm.","Back then, Nie Qingru was also an astonishing genius in the reclusive families. Otherwise, she wouldn’t have been chosen to marry the outsider.","Shadow knew very well that Nie Qingru had already bought all the chips in Tian Chen’s hands a few days ago. Even if Qiao Nian asked Lu Zhi, he wouldn’t be able to produce chips anytime soon.","This was Nie Qingru’s trap—a death trap!","Step by step, she forced the person into a dead end and watched as the person ran around like a rat. Then, she blocked the possibility of the person escaping.","This was Nie Qingru.","Seeing that he was distracted, Nie Qingru raised her eyebrows in dissatisfaction. \"I’m talking to you.\"","Shadow returned to his senses and lowered his head. \"She hasn’t done anything yet.\"","Nie Qingru’s smile faded slightly, and gloom immediately covered her brows. \"She hasn’t done anything?\"","Shadow repeated, \"Yes, Qiao Nian hasn’t done anything yet.\"","\"The wolf cub isn’t someone who waits for death.\" Nie Qingru wanted to see the other party’s move, but Qiao Nian didn’t do anything... This made her uneasy.","Shadow could see her worry. He wanted to go forward but did not dare to. He could only force himself to stand still and comfort her in a low voice. \"Empress, don’t worry. Everything is going according to our plan. Even if she makes a move, it will not change the outcome.\"","Nie Qingru exhaled. \"You’re right.\"","...","Soon, they would understand that Qiao Nian did not do anything because she was unbothered. Instead, she had already handed the matter to Ye Wangchuan.","She stayed in the laboratory and worked on the experimental data.","Nie Qingru found out that Ye Wangchuan had reached a collaboration with the Leonard family under her nose three days later. Beijing had successfully delivered the goods to Country C.","Upon getting the news, she sent someone to investigate where the goods came from. She did not know until she investigated. Only then did she realize that she had been tricked.","When she found out it was the Leonard family, her blood pressure surged and she was so angry that she almost vomited blood.","\"Prepare the car.\"","As soon as she got into the car, she coldly ordered, \"To the Privy Council!\"","Upon getting there, Nie Qingru got out of the car and went straight to Luke’s lounge.","She pushed the door open to see Luke talking to someone. The people in the lounge were shocked at the commotion. They turned around to see Nie Qingru coming in with a murderous aura.","Everyone tactfully made excuses to leave. \"Well, the Empress is looking for you. I’ll leave first.\"","\"Yes, yes. Let’s come back later.\"","Before leaving, they did not forget to greet Nie Qingru respectfully and call her Empress.","However, Nie Qingru’s temples were throbbing. She couldn’t control her emotions at the moment. She walked in with a straight face and ignored everyone.","She threw her handbag on the sofa and looked down at Luke. \"Tell me why it’s you.\""]},{"number":3757,"title":"Chapter 3757: Her Majesty, We Didn’t Know The Boss Behind It Beforehand","paragraphs":["Luke tidied up the documents on the table and calmly asked, \"What do you mean, Empress?\"","\"Heh! At this point, do you still want to play dumb with me?\"","Luke understood why she was looking for him. He folded the documents and put them back in the cabinet. Then, he turned around and sat down calmly. \"Her Majesty, are you talking about the chips?\"","Nie Qingru placed her hand on the desk and looked at him with a burning gaze. \"Why did you stab me in the back? Give me a reason.\"","Luke said bluntly, \"We didn’t know who the boss of that company was. Come to think of it, we only learned that person’s identity an hour before you did.\"","\"You didn’t know...\" This reason was really ridiculous.","Nie Qingru sneered mercilessly. \"You really didn’t know!\"","Her gaze was as sharp as a blade as it scanned Luke’s face, sinister and bloody.","It did not feel good to be targeted by a poisonous snake. Luke tugged at his collar and panted a little. He continued without change in expression, \"In fact, the other party’s offer was very good. It exceeded the market price by 50%. You’re also a businesswoman, so you should understand the difficulty in refusing such a premium cooperation. We reached a cooperation with the other party under such circumstances. Before this, we didn’t know that the boss behind this company was Young Master Ye.\"","Luke spoke methodically as if the truth was as he had said. The Leonard family had unintentionally cooperated with Ye Wangchuan, indirectly stabbing Nie Qingru.","Of course, the truth was not that simple.","In fact, not long after Mr. Ji Lin came looking for them, they found out the identity of the boss behind that company.","But so what?","The benefits offered by the other party were not something Nie Qingru could give them.","Moreover, Nie Qingru had protected Di Xicheng time and again, who touched the core interests of the Leonard family a few times...","Due to these reasons, the elders agreed to this cooperation after some discussion.","\"Your Majesty, I’m very sorry for what happened.\" Luke expressed his apology calmly as if he were indeed sincere.","Throughout the entire process, Nie Qingru’s viper-like eyes firmly observed his every word and action, as if she wanted to pry open his very being and see his soul.","After saying what he had prepared in advance, Luke shut up and sat on the chair, waiting for Nie Qingru’s reaction.","Finally, Nie Qingru propped herself up from the desk and dusted her clothes with half-closed eyes. She turned around and picked up her handbag on the guest sofa. Without turning her head, she said, \"This is the reply your family is giving me? Then I’ve received it.\"","She opened the lounge door and barged out.","Bang!","The door was slammed shut.","Looking at the closed door, Luke picked up the office line and called the elders. \"Hello, the empress just came to me for an explanation. I’ve done as you instructed.\"","He looked at the slammed door and continued unhurriedly, \"But it seems the Empress didn’t believe me.\"","The old man on the other end of the line comforted him and hung up.","Luke put down the receiver and composed himself before focusing on his work."]},{"number":3758,"title":"Chapter 3758: Interesting, Who Did It?","paragraphs":["The Leonard family was actually not worried that Nie Qingru would take revenge on them.","In fact, ever since Di Xicheng had reported the matter to force them to accept the order from Country C, their relationship with Nie Qingru had become delicate.","This time, everyone knew that it was revenge.","Nie Qingru also knew that the Leonard family was taking revenge, but it was just as difficult to flare up as they had evaluated beforehand.","In the car.","At some point, the driver had become silent.","He opened the door for Nie Qingru and carefully closed the door after helping her into the car. Then, he went around to the front and started the car.","He did not say anything meanwhile.","After a brief headache, Nie Qingru propped up her forehead and said to him with pale lips, \"I was tricked.\"","\"Empress, you should rest. Don’t think about it.\"","\"They didn’t look for Tian Chen, but Leonards. This Ye Wangchuan... I underestimated him.\"","She spoke through gritted teeth.","Nie Qingru had always been good at playing with people’s hearts. This was the first time she had been played around by someone before finally realizing that she had been played.","The feeling was not good.","\"What do you plan to do with the Leonards?\" Shadow asked in a low voice as he drove.","Nie Qingru had a headache. After thinking for a moment, she said gloomily, \"I can’t touch them. Xicheng’s conflict with them was not long ago, and then there was the account book loss farce. If I go against them at this juncture, I’m afraid the Leonard family will become our enemies.\"","Ye Wangchuan had accurately judged the situation before looking for them.","Nie Qingru’s temples throbbed. She closed her eyes and suppressed her unhappiness. \"My authority has already begun to decrease. If this continues, my right to speak will be lowered.\"","She then told Shadow what Luke said.","\"Now that the Leonards insist they didn’t know in advance, I can’t touch them under such circumstances. Otherwise, I would appear unreasonable.\"","The more Nie Qingru analyzed, the clearer she saw how the other party blocked her with a move, putting her in a dilemma.","If she fought with the Leonards to the end, she would lose an important partner in the Privy Council and turn them into enemies.","But if she did not do anything, her plans over the past few days, including the pawn she had given up on, Yu Wenhao, would have been in vain.","If she lost in one step, she would lose the entire game!","\"I remember that Xicheng will be discharged today. Let’s go to the hospital first.\"","Nie Qingru looked at the scenery outside the window as she ordered.","Shadow did not say anything as he drove towards the hospital.","**","\"How’s it going?\"","\"Beijing delivered the chips as scheduled. Country C is very satisfied. Both sides have reached a further cooperation.\"","\"Oh? Where did they get the chips?\"","\"It’s said that they were obtained from the Leonard family.\"","In the hospital.","Di Xicheng had already changed his clothes and was about to be discharged from the hospital. At this moment, he shook off the people Nie Qingru had arranged to protect him and hid at the staircase in a blind spot from the cameras.","A man in a nurse uniform stood opposite him, reporting the latest news.","\"The Leonards?\" Di Xicheng’s eyes lit up. He pursed his lips. \"Interesting. Who did it?\""]},{"number":3759,"title":"Chapter 3759: He’s a Madman","paragraphs":["He thought it was Qiao Nian.","Unexpectedly, it was not her.","\"Ye Wangchuan, the master of Bright Gate.\"","Di Xicheng became more and more unrestrained. \"Oh, him? You missed out on one thing. Other than being the master of Bright Gate, he’s also the master behind Dark Fort. He’s not someone to be trifled with.\" The harder something was, the more interested he was in it!","The man in the nurse uniform opposite him said in a low voice, \"The Empress doesn’t seem to intend to hold this betrayal against the Leonard family.\"","\"Heh.\" Di Xicheng was not interested in this at all. He only smirked as if he did not hear him and continued to play with his cell phone.","The man mustered his courage to say, \"Young Master Di, actually, the Empress did this... probably to protect you.\"","Before he could finish speaking, a metal edge suddenly pressed against his forehead.","It turned out that Di Xicheng had suddenly pointed the phone at his temple. Like a pistol, he pressed it against his forehead and pulled the \"trigger\".","He even chuckled and imitated the sound. \"Ah, bam!\"","The man’s heart trembled. He was so frightened that cold sweat broke out on his forehead. He did not dare to move. Even though he knew it was fake, he was still so frightened that his legs trembled.","At this moment, Di Xicheng put away his cell phone and looked at him with a mischievous smile. \"Are you frightened?\"","\"...Y-Young Master Di.\"","Di Xicheng waved the phone, looking gentle and easy to talk to. \"It’s a cell phone, not a real gun. What are you afraid of?\"","The man looked at his smiling face and felt even more afraid. His legs went weak and he wanted to kneel. \"Young Master Di, I was wrong.\"","\"What are you doing? Get up. Those who don’t know might think that I’m bullying you.\" Di Xicheng held him up and stopped him from kneeling.","The man maintained his half-kneeling posture. He did not know whether to continue or get up.","However, Di Xicheng did not let go. They were in a deadlock for half a second, but the man still stood up stiffly. He was so frightened that he lowered his head and trembled the entire time.","Di Xicheng saw his trembling legs and smiled meaningfully. \"Are you so afraid of me? I won’t eat you.\"","\"I’m sorry, Young Master Di.\" Di Xicheng was a lunatic. He did not dare to provoke him. He knew he shouldn’t have said anything. He didn’t know why he said that in a moment of hot-headedness.","Di Xicheng retracted his smile and looked at him indifferently. \"You’ve been with me for ten years, right?\"","\"11 years.\"","\"Then remember my rules. Do more and say less.\" Di Xicheng looked at the cold sweat on his forehead and reminded him with no change in expression, \"I’ll pretend I didn’t hear you this time. But if there’s a next time...\"","\"There won’t be a next time, Young Master Di.\"","Di Xicheng hummed in agreement and let him off. Then, he looked at the time on his watch and said, \"I’m leaving first. Wait here for another half an hour before leaving.\"","\"Okay.\"","Di Xicheng left the stairwell without looking back.","...","Nie Qingru and Shadow were already there when Di Xicheng returned to the ward.","Shadow frowned and asked, \"Where did you go? I asked the doctor and nurses, but they didn’t see you.\"","Di Xicheng raised the medicine in his hand. \"I went to get the medicine and then went to the washroom.\"","Shadow felt that he was lying. \"Why didn’t you ask the bodyguards to take it?\"","Nie Qingru rubbed her eyebrows and stopped him. \"Alright, I didn’t wait long.\"","Di Xicheng looked at Shadow provocatively and walked over. \"Aunt.\""]},{"number":3760,"title":"Chapter 3760: Sister Nian’s Focused on the Last Experiment","paragraphs":["As expected, Nie Qingru’s expression softened. She asked about his physical and rehabilitation over the past few days, including what the doctor said.","Di Xicheng answered her questions one by one.","Nie Qingru calmed down a little. \"Since the doctor told you to rest more, you should stay home and rest well. Don’t go out and run around if there’s nothing to do.\"","\"I know, Aunt.\" Di Xicheng lowered his eyelashes, looking very obedient.","Nie Qingru seemed to see another person through him. She was distracted for a few seconds before quickly returning to her senses. \"I know you’re unhappy about losing to her last time. I’ll find an opportunity to let you vent your anger, but not now. Don’t run around during this period. Also... try not to provoke the Leonard family.\"","Everyone present knew who she was referring to.","She was talking about Qiao Nian.","Di Xicheng felt his blood boil. He pressed the tip of his tongue against the roof of his mouth and tried his best to calm his surging heart. His head bent lower. \"Alright, I’ll listen to you.\"","Nie Qingru looked at him a few more seconds before finally saying softly, \"Your uncle’s ashes are with her. Don’t worry, I’ll snatch them back.\"","Di Xicheng’s smile disappeared instantly. It was unknown if it was because he had heard that his uncle’s ashes had been snatched or if it was just because he had heard about his uncle.","He quickly controlled his emotions. He did not smile, but he was calm enough. \"Thank you, Aunt.\"","Nie Qingru patted his shoulder. \"I have something to do. Get Shadow to help you with the discharge procedures later.\"","\"Okay.\"","Di Xicheng’s shoulders sank as he nodded.","Nie Qingru did not stay any longer and went out first.","Shadow walked behind her. Seeing the ambiguous expression on his face, he frowned slightly and warned him. \"The Empress has lost a lot because of you. If you still have a conscience, put away your little schemes. Don’t let her down!\"","Di Xicheng raised his head and looked at him. His eyes were emotionless, as if there was only empty coldness left in the two pools of cold water. \"Aunt has already given her granddaughter to me to vent my anger. What do I have to let Aunt down for? Uncle Ning, you’re overthinking.\"","Shadow couldn’t describe his feelings when he met his gaze. In short, he was very uncomfortable, especially with what he said.","Shadow did not say anything else and walked out. \"I’ll go settle the discharge procedures for you.\"","Di Xicheng clicked his tongue and watched them leave.","**","Independent continent.","First Research Institute.","The outside world had been in an uproar for the past few days. After Beijing delivered the chips as scheduled, Continent M suffered another loss in silence.","Recently, the dissatisfaction within the reclusive families toward Nie Qingru increased. Among the three giants of the Privy Council, only the conservatives still supported the Empress.","Nie Qingru’s own business also suffered countless losses every day because of this confrontation with Beijing.","It was obviously not a good thing to incur losses for such a long time.","The reclusive families kept having meetings to discuss whether they should continue to suppress Beijing.","The archbishop was the first to express his disapproval of suppressing Beijing.","The Leonards stood on the archbishop’s side for the first time. They also expressed their unwillingness to let the reclusive families continue to incur losses.","...","All of this had nothing to do with Qiao Nian.","She was fully focused on breaking through the last experiment. Besides Xu Yi and Feng Yu, she even asked Xie Tingyun for help."]},{"number":3761,"title":"Chapter 3761: Sister Nian Finally Solved the Last Experiment","paragraphs":["Xie Tingyun was indeed the number one person in physics.","With her participation, Qiao Nian found a solution to several challenging problems that she could not solve previously. The experiment became smoother.","In the next half a month, Qiao Nian became increasingly engrossed. Sometimes, she might not even see Ye Wangchuan when he came to deliver food to her.","Qiao Nian did not return to the villa at night and began to sleep in the laboratory.","She stayed like this for a full 20 days.","Finally, on the morning of the 21st day, Qiao Nian solved the last secret that Ji Qing had left on the USB drive.","It was the accurate data from a series of S+ experiments. The experiment was very difficult, but the final result looked simple on paper.","It was as simple as a string of meaningless numbers.","\"What does this mean?\" Xie Tingyun had been with Qiao Nian for nearly a month. She couldn’t hide her fatigue.","She looked at the series of strange numbers and symbols that Qiao Nian had copied down, stunned. A strange light appeared in her eyes.","\"Nian Nian, can you understand it?\" Unable to understand the paper’s content, Xie Tingyun could only ask Qiao Nian.","It wasn’t just her.","In the laboratory, Feng Yu, Shi Fu, and Xu Yi looked at the girl sitting on the table with grave expressions.","Qiao Nian held the fountain pen with lowered eyelashes. The light and shadow landed on her superior facial features and outlined an arc.","Seeming in thought, she did not answer immediately.","Xie Tingyun noticed her dry lips and reached for the paper. \"Forget it, don’t think about it for now. We’re not in a hurry. Go back, take a shower, and rest. What this number means, we’ll discuss it later...\"","However, before her fingers touched the paper, Qiao Nian slowly said in a hoarse voice, \"It’s Morse code.\"","Xie Tingyun’s hand paused. She was surprised. \"Morse Code?\"","Qiao Nian tilted her head and met her gaze. \"Yes.\"","Xie Tingyun could see the seriousness in her clear eyes. She did not seem to be faking it. She thought of something and started to drift off.","\"What... is she hiding?\"","Ji Qing would rather die than lose the USB drive. There were so many difficult S+ experiments in the flash drive, but the truth was still behind them.","What awaited them was another string of complicated and mysterious Morse code.","\"I don’t know,\" Qiao Nian answered bluntly.","After saying that, she folded the paper and put it into her pocket. Then, she stood up, grabbed her coat and cell phone from the cabinet, and turned to the four people. \"I remember finding an experiment record she left behind at home. There might be a way to unlock the password on it. I’ll go back first. Wait for my news.\"","Xie Tingyun opened her mouth, but the words that came out were different from what she was thinking. \"Take care of yourself and rest. There’s no hurry.\"","The girl nodded sensibly. \"Mm, I understand.\"","Xie Tingyun watched as she left, knowing she had agreed just to reassure her. In fact, she did not intend to rest at all.","She watched as Qiao Nian opened the laboratory door and left.","Smiling bitterly, she looked back at Feng Yu and the others. \"Dean, Deputy Director, I’m not feeling well. I’ll leave first.\"","\"Okay.\" Feng Yu knew she was not feeling unwell. It was just that she felt uncomfortable when thinking of her deceased friend. He gently advised her, \"You should go back and rest well too.\"","Xie Tingyun nodded politely and hurried off."]},{"number":3762,"title":"Chapter 3762: What’s Behind This Morse Code","paragraphs":["In the blink of an eye, only the three of them were left in the laboratory. Feng Yu sighed and said to the other two, \"Let’s disperse. Go home and rest.\"","**","Half an hour later.","Qiao Nian returned to the villa.","\"Sister Qiao!\"","\"Miss Qiao.\"","Gu San and Qin Si saw her at the same time and were both surprised and happy.","Qin Si even nagged, \"Where did you go? It’s been almost a week since you came back. I almost thought you weren’t coming back anymore.\"","\"Miss Qiao, let me do it.\"","Gu San handed Qiao Nian a pair of slippers and helped her carry her bag.","\"No need.\" Qiao Nian avoided his hand and put on slippers. She was expressionless, with no sign of fatigue to be seen. She was in a hurry. \"I want to work on something. I need a quieter space. Don’t bother me if it’s not important.\"","\"Uh, okay.\"","Gu San agreed.","Qiao Nian did not have the strength or energy to say anything else. She took her things and went to her room.","Qin Si watched as the girl went upstairs without looking back. When Gu San returned, he lowered his voice and asked, \"What did Sister Qiao say to you just now?\"","\"Nothing. Miss Qiao said she was going to work on something and asked me not to disturb her,\" Gu San replied seriously.","Qin Si scratched his head. \"Master Wang is coming back soon. Doesn’t she want to see him before entering seclusion?\"","\"I don’t know about that.\" Gu San thought and added, \"Miss Qiao was quite anxious. It should be something important.\"","This time, Qin Si could not say anything else.","If Qiao Nian was anxious, it was obviously something very important.","His heart ached for a certain man who had not seen his girlfriend for more than a week. Now that his girlfriend was back, he still could not see her.","**","Qiao Nian returned to her room and took a shower, then came out in a bathrobe.","Her hair was dripping, but she only wiped it with a towel. She did not blow-dry it and just pulled over a chair.","Taking advantage of the fact that she had just taken a shower and her mind was clear, she sat down, spread the paper on the desk, and looked at the string of strange numbers.","From the first moment she saw the string of numbers, she realized it was a special Morse code.","This was because she had once found a string of Morse codes of similar style in the airplane’s black box where Ji Qing had almost gotten into an accident.","The string of Morse code in front of her was even more difficult to decipher than the one from the plane’s black box. It belonged to the ciphertext of encrypted words.","If it were anyone else, it would take a lot of time.","However, Qiao Nian had the confidence to solve this string of strange numbers.","The towel became moist from the dampness. Qiao Nian stopped drying her hair and placed the towel aside. Then, she focused on deciphering the Morse code.","In her drawer were the disciplinary notes that Ji Qing had left behind in the First Research Institute’s information room.","Qiao Nian carefully searched for clues in Ji Qing’s old things. At the same time, she did not forget to use her computer to search for some rare top-secret encrypted words.","Time flew by.","To her, it was as if time had abandoned her and isolated her from everything else.","Qiao Nian did not even know when it became dark outside. She was completely focused on deciphering the code.","She had not eaten all day.","Perhaps because she was tense, even though she had not slept for a full day and had not consumed even a drop of water all day, she did not feel hungry or tired."]},{"number":3763,"title":"Chapter 3763: Finally Solved","paragraphs":["The excitement, the desire to collide and resonate with the wisdom of someone from a different time and space, urged her to hurry up.","Faster.","Faster.","Qiao Nian’s eyes narrowed as she enjoyed the sense of urgency.","She used the pen to leave a series of complicated formulas on the draft paper from time to time, again and again.","On the left was the string of simple characters she had left behind from Ji Qing’s experiment, and the draft paper she had taken again.","The draft paper was filled with all kinds of formulas. She had already used several pieces of paper to solve it, but it was still not enough.","In comparison, Ji Qing’s seemingly simple string of characters was shrouded in a layer of mysterious light, enticing her to decipher it.","Finally.","As the night was replaced by the morning sun and the orange-red clouds dyed half the sky, the girl who had been working on deciphering Morse code slid the last stroke on the draft paper.","The force of that stroke tainted the back of the paper and forcefully cut a long hole in it as if it were revealing the truth.","Qiao Nian looked at the truth and leaned back in her chair for a long time.","She watched the results in silence.","She finally understood why Ji Qing died.","**","Downstairs.","Qin Si yawned as he walked over and looked at Gu San bringing breakfast from the kitchen and greeted the man in the living room.","\"Good morning, Master Wang.\"","No one paid attention to him.","He looked around and did not see Qiao Nian. Qin Si immediately sobered up. He touched the back of his neck and smiled bitterly. \"Sister Qiao isn’t down yet, is she?\"","\"How long has it been?\" Qin Si sat down in depression. \"She didn’t even come down for dinner yesterday. Could she have stayed up all night?\"","Gu San placed the porridge on the table with a worried expression. He wiped his hands on the apron and carefully asked the man on the sofa, \"Master Wang, why don’t I go up and call Miss Qiao for breakfast?\"","Ye Wangchuan returned in the middle and woke up early in the morning. He had slept for at most three hours. Hearing this, he only lowered his eyelids and said lightly, \"Don’t disturb her.\"","\"Tsk!\" Qin Si gave him a thumbs up. He looked like he was watching a show and didn’t mind blowing things up. \"Master Wang, your thoughtfulness is almost comparable to your wife.\"","\"If you can’t learn to shut up, I can send you back.\" Ye Wangchuan was lazy and casual, but his words were not very gentle.","Qin Si quickly touched the back of his neck and shut up.","Alright, he couldn’t afford to offend him, but he could hide.","Qin Si stood up. \"I stayed up all night and haven’t slept enough. You guys eat. I’ll catch up on sleep and eat later.\"","Just as he finished speaking, his sharp eyes noticed someone coming down from the second floor.","Qin Si’s tone changed. \"Sister Qiao?\"","\"Ah, good morning,\" Qiao Nian replied. There was not much emotion on her excessively beautiful face. She did not look the least bit energetic, more like she had not rested well and did not like to talk to others.","Qin Si forgot about sleep.","He watched as the girl walked down step by step, greeted Gu San, and asked about breakfast. Then, she nodded at Ye Wangchuan.","Next, Qiao Nian walked to the dining table and sat down. She grabbed a piece of bread and bit into it. She poured herself a glass of water and began to eat.","Her natural actions stunned everyone. They couldn’t figure out if she was done working or not.","Anyway, they could tell that Qiao Nian was in a bad mood."]},{"number":3764,"title":"Chapter 3764: The Shocking Truth Behind It","paragraphs":["Ye Wangchuan walked into the kitchen. After a while, he walked over and changed the ice water by the girl’s hand into a cup of hot cocoa. \"Drink this to warm your stomach.\"","\"Oh.\" Seeing it was not milk, Qiao Nian took a sip. The rich fragrance of chocolate entered her mouth. The bread slices that matched her breakfast were not bad.","She finished the hot cocoa and two slices of bread. Her stomach finally felt full, but still, it felt inadequate, as if she had eaten, but also not really.","Seeing that she had lost her appetite, Qiao Nian pushed away the porcelain plate before her and leaned back in the chair. She covered her eyes with her hand, looking very tired.","Qin Si and Gu San looked at each other and saw in each other’s eyes: What should we do...","Ye Wangchuan also saw that the girl couldn’t hide her weariness. He said in a low voice, \"Go back to your rooms.\"","\"Ah, okay.\" Qin Si found a reason to quickly pull Gu San away and leave, leaving them alone.","Only Qiao Nian and Ye Wangchuan were left in the living room.","The girl was still covering her face, her eyes were closed, and she was leaning against the back of the chair to rest as if she couldn’t even be bothered to do anything.","Logically speaking, she should be relaxed and lazy, but she exuded a ruthlessness and tyranny that could not be concealed.","Even though she tried to control herself, Ye Wangchuan could still feel the waves hidden under her calm surface.","He could guess the reason without Qiao Nian saying anything.","\"You solved the last experiment.\"","Silence.","\"What’s the truth?\"","The girl opened her eyes and dropped her hand. Sitting up slightly, she did not look at him, leaving him with a cold side profile as she said in a hoarse voice, \"You don’t want to know.\"","This truth was really... nauseating.","Ye Wangchuan took her slightly cold hand and covered it. He did not force her to say anything. \"Alright, when you want to tell me, I’m willing to listen anytime.\"","Qiao Nian could feel the warmth coming from him flowing along her blood vessels and into her heart.","She pursed her lips, and her frozen heart softened. Her tense body relaxed as she leaned against the back of the chair. \"If you want to hear it, I can tell you.\"","She had never thought of hiding it from Ye Wangchuan.","At the very least, she never treated him as an outsider. As long as he wanted to hear it, there was nothing she could not say.","Without waiting for Ye Wangchuan to speak, Qiao Nian continued hoarsely, \"The result of the last experiment on the USB drive was a string of Morse codes. It’s the real hidden thing.\"","She tilted her head, her eyes clear and deep, revealing a bone-chilling coldness. \"Have you heard of an anti-nuclear interception system?\"","\"Interception system?\" Ye Wangchuan immediately knew what she was talking about. \"I’ve heard of it.\"","This system was not uncommon.","There were also some in Beijing.","It should be said that Master Cheng and the Ninth Branch had once studied similar defense systems.","Qiao Nian chuckled and said coldly, \"Ji Qing has also studied this. 20 years ago, she was studying this when everyone was still obsessed with black gunpowder.","\"If she only studied this, she wouldn’t be remembered by so many people. However, not only did she study defense systems, but she also developed the strongest anti-nuclear defense system.\"","The strongest anti-nuclear defense system... These words had an inexplicable meaning when Qiao Nian said them. Ye Wangchuan did not think she was talking about a simple system.","Qiao Nian exhaled and continued expressionlessly, \"She developed a substance that can achieve nuclear dissolution.\""]},{"number":3765,"title":"Chapter 3765: Sister Nian Is Going Out","paragraphs":["\"Nuclear dissolution...\" Ye Wangchuan took a deep breath, unable to hide his surprise.","Qiao Nian leaned on his shoulder as if she had lost all her strength. She was so soft that she did not want to move. Her expression was obscure. \"This is the reason why she had to die. Those people wouldn’t allow her to live.\"","Too many people’s interests were involved.","Ji Qing’s creation would undoubtedly turn the cutting-edge weapons they relied on to threaten others into a pile of scrap metal.","It was also for this reason that those people hunted her at all costs.","Among them was her biological mother.","\"Ha.\" Qiao Nian chuckled, but the smile did not reach her eyes.","Suddenly sitting up straight, she regained her usual cold arrogance and looked into Ye Wangchuan’s eyes. \"I’m going out for a while.\"","\"Where to?\"","\"Illegal District.\"","Qiao Nian did not hide it from him.","\"Besides unlocking the string of Morse code, I also found a symbol... I checked it. It’s the symbol of an anti-war organization.\"","\"Auntie also joined an anti-war organization?\" Ye Wangchuan was surprised.","Qiao Nian supported her chin with her fair hand and said sharply, \"The name of that anti-war organization is Nance Alliance. I’ve checked their recent activities online and found they’ve recently been active in the illegal district. I want to go over and take a look personally.\"","Her voice then slowed. \"If we can find someone, I’d like to ask how much they know about what happened back then.\"","Not many people knew about the huge hunt back then.","Ji Lingfeng didn’t even know who they were at the time.","However, the people in this organization might know the families involved—because they were very likely the only people who knew and had come into contact with Ji Qing’s research project.","\"I’ll go with you.\" Ye Wangchuan made a prompt decision, leaving no room for a retort. \"I’m worried about you going alone.\"","Qiao Nian glanced at him and said softly, \"Okay.\"","**","The Nance Alliance had not appeared for 10 whole years.","The news that someone had appeared in the remote mountainous area of the illegal district spread like a meteor.","Over the years, many people investigated their remaining members. However, such searches were carried out in the dark and were rarely disclosed.","However, this did not mean that the search’s intensity had decreased. In fact, until today, everyone’s search for the Nance Alliance had a tacit rule—kill them!","\"If you find any one of them, kill on the spot!\"","This was the order that Nie Qingru gave back then.","Therefore, when the Nance Alliance appeared in the illegal district, Shadow immediately headed to Nie Qingru’s residence.","\"Empress, there’s an urgent message.\"","Only now did he realize there was a familiar face in the living room besides Nie Qingru. Moreover, the other party was looking at him calmly.","The long dining table was filled with food meticulously cooked by a Michelin chef, and the vase on the table was still filled with Nie Qingru’s favorite calla lilies. Under the illumination of the high-hanging crystal chandelier, it was like a scene in a medieval oil painting, exuding extravagance and nobility.","Nie Qingru put down the knife and fork and picked up a handkerchief to wipe her lips. Then, she elegantly asked, \"Tell me, what’s the matter?\"","Shadow did not answer immediately. Instead, he glanced sideways at the young man sitting at the other end of the rectangular dining table. His meaning was obvious. This was not suitable for him to listen to.","Di Xicheng’s bright eyes curved as he stood up and tactfully said, \"Aunt, I’ll leave you to it.\""]},{"number":3766,"title":"Chapter 3766: Aunt, Why Don’t You Let Me Go","paragraphs":["\"Sit down,\" Nie Qingru said after a second after seeing his eyes, signaling him to sit down.","Di Xicheng sat down obediently and gave Shadow a provocative look when Nie Qingru was not looking.","It was as if he was replying to what he had just said: Look, it’s not that I don’t want to leave.","Shadow’s blood boiled. He looked away expressionlessly and placed his hands in front of him. He heard his loyal master say, \"Xicheng is not an outsider. Just make your report.\"","Shadow felt suffocated. He thought of Nie Qixing again and looked at Di Xicheng’s face with disgust. He suppressed it and said, \"Empress, we found the people from the Nance Alliance.\"","Nie Qingru’s expression grew slightly cold. \"Hmph, I didn’t expect them to still dare to show their faces. Looks like these people are to hold out hope until faced with the grim reality.","\"There’s only one person left in the Nance Alliance that we haven’t caught. His appearance this time should have something to do with his grandson.\"","Shadow said slowly, \"We couldn’t find where he was hiding. Someone thought of a way to trap him with information about his grandson. He fell for it.\"","Nie Qingru lowered her eyes and wiped her fingers with a towel. Under the light, her actions looked so elegant and noble, but her words were like that of a demon from hell. \"There’s only one person left from that batch of people back then. Since we’ve found him, we’ll deal with him cleanly. Find out if his grandson really exists or is just a bait. If it’s true, we’ll deal with both together.\"","\"Empress, that child... We interrogated the people we captured previously. They don’t know if Ji Qing hid that research. Moreover, they don’t know much. Just some insignificant matters.\"","\"If we don’t get rid of the roots, it will grow again when spring comes around!\" Her eyes and eyebrows were filled with the arrogance of good etiquette. She was as noble as a Buddha.","However, they showed no pity. There was only coldness and decisiveness, like a beast driven by benefits.","Nie Qingru was not persuaded. She said disdainfully, \"They’re unlucky in this life. Let them reincarnate into the next life. I’m doing a good deed. I’ll send them to start over early.\"","Di Xicheng couldn’t help but laugh.","At this moment, at this critical juncture, his uncontrollable chuckle was exceptionally abrupt.","Shadow immediately looked at him sinisterly. \"Young Master Di, what are you laughing at?\"","Nie Qingru was also looking at him, but obviously more patient than Shadow. She just pursed her lips, obviously unhappy.","Di Xicheng was not afraid of anyone. He waved his hand and explained, \"I just think what Aunt said makes sense. Uncle Ning, you’re too kind.\"","He lowered his eyelashes and lowered his voice. \"If they continue to live, they will be hiding. They might as well die and reincarnate earlier.\"","They seemed to talk sense.","They believed they could easily decide the life and death of others, and even said it in a dignified manner without any psychological burden. With just a few words, they had removed themselves from sin.","Di Xicheng’s eyelids twitched, and he looked up again. His eyes were clear and unreadable as he looked at Nie Qingru with bright eyes that were 50% similar to the man in the old photo. \"Aunt, it’s useless to stay at home. Why don’t you leave this to me?\"","\"Are you sure?\" Nie Qingru frowned, tidied up her clothes, and said slowly, \"Besides our people, other families are going this time. It will be very troublesome when the time comes.\""]},{"number":3767,"title":"Chapter 3767: The Feeling of Being Targeted by a Lunatic","paragraphs":["Regarding Ji Qing’s matters, the others were worried about leaving it to her.","The benefits involved were too great. The few families involved back then would definitely send people over. Everyone would supervise and resolve it together so no one would suspect each other.","Di Xicheng cracked his knuckles and smiled. \"I have nothing to do, anyway.\"","\"Mm.\" Nie Qingru nodded. \"Then I’ll leave this matter to you. Don’t disappoint me.\"","\"Okay,\" Di Xicheng agreed unsurprisingly.","Shadow did not find a chance to interrupt the whole process. When he wanted to stop her, Nie Qingru had already settled the matter with a few words.","He was most used to following Nie Qingru’s orders. Even though he felt it was inappropriate for Di Xicheng to go, Nie Qingru had already agreed. He could only follow Nie Qingru’s arrangements and prepare the manpower.","The lights inside were still on when Di Xicheng left the castle.","He got into the car, and his smile instantly disappeared.","The chauffeur was his man. He asked in a low voice, \"Young Master Di, where are we going now?\"","\"Let’s go back. I have to pack my luggage and go on a trip.\"","The man opened the window to let the wind in. Then, he took out his cell phone and turned it on, but did not unlock it. He rubbed the cell phone, and the corners of his mouth curled up.","It was the end of December, and the cold winds were like a knife in his face.","Di Xicheng looked like he was enjoying himself.","That happy expression of tasting pain made him look like a madman.","The madman licked his lips and muttered, \"I have a feeling I’ll be able to meet her again soon. This time, I won’t lose!\"","The chauffeur did not dare to speak. He just took it that he was deaf and blind. He drove quietly, not daring to move his hands away from the steering wheel.","Di Xicheng smacked his lips and tasted that name. It was as if he had already forced that person to a dead end in his mind. He saw that person kneeling in front of him with her legs broken, and he called out happily, \"Qiao Nian.\"","**","Qiao Nian still did not know that she was being targeted by a lunatic.","Three days later.","She gathered the matters of the First Research Institute and arranged various matters in the independent continent. She brought her laptop and other personal belongings, two sets of clothes, and prepared to leave.","This time, they were using Ye Wangchuan’s private plane.","Qiao Nian was the kind of person who could not be bothered to bring anything out. Whether it was a private plane or an ordinary flight, she would travel the world with a backpack.","It was the same this time.","Everyone else was carrying bags and suitcases.","She was the only one who had brought a bag. Ye Wangchuan had helped her carry it the entire time. She was alone and could do whatever she wanted. Of course, she walked quite quickly with her hands in her pockets.","Qin Si felt uncomfortable chasing after her.","\"Sister Qiao, slow down.\"","Gu San was not coming this time. He went to work for Ji Lingfeng in the independent continent.","Qin Si was brought along by Ye Wangchuan. Although he was asked to do odd jobs, anyone with a discerning eye could tell that Ye Wangchuan was using this opportunity to nurture him.","In addition to Qin Si, Guan Yan was also coming.","After all, she had to return to her old home in the illegal district. Guan Yan acted very comfortably, completely different from Qin Si. She pulled his suitcase and walked leisurely, leaving Qin Si behind, not forgetting to mock him.","\"Young Master Qin, you can’t even take this bit of hardship. You should go back.","\"Beijing is such a good place. You don’t have to do anything. A lot of people will be waiting on you. Why do you have to stay here and suffer? Right?\""]},{"number":3768,"title":"Chapter 3768: A Surprising Person Appeared","paragraphs":["Qin Si originally wanted to complain about being tired, but after being mocked, he immediately gritted his teeth, pulled his things, and chased after her.","\"I’m not going back!\"","\"If I go back, I’ll bring you along.\"","Guan Yan sneered and looked into his eyes. She narrowed her beautiful peach-blossom eyes and tapped his forehead with her fingertips, mercilessly saying, \"Dream on. There’s everything in a dream.\"","After saying that, she stepped even harder on her high heels and sped up, clearly wanting to shake him off.","Qin Si tried not to look bad. He was used to being served and really did not have the strength to drag two boxes and two bags.","He held his breath and silently chased after Guan Yan.","***","Ye Wangchuan ignored them. After boarding the plane, he went to the front cabin to get a cup of hot coffee and walked towards the girl. Then, he placed the coffee cup before the girl.","\"Drink some.\"","\"You can leave it there.\"","Qiao Nian had her laptop on her lap. The computer was running a tracking program, and the progress bar was at 66%.","She stared at the computer screen, waiting for the results.","Ye Wangchuan placed the coffee by her hand and sat down beside her. He turned on the sensor light and handed her a blanket and slippers.","There were also earplugs and eye masks.","He was meticulous.","The progress bar quickly jumped to 100%. A detailed map of the illegal district appeared on the screen. It was very detailed, with the names of every street and shop available.","She enlarged the location of the red dot. Her arrogant eyebrows raised slightly, and she was in a good mood. \"You’re quite smart. You know how to hide.\"","She had been helping that person erase his traces for the past three days.","From the location of the electronic communication equipment to the surveillance cameras that might have been captured by the radar... Qiao Nian knew where these were once she started checking. Basically, no one could catch the traces she had erased.","This was also why the grandfather and grandson pair could remain undetected for the past few days.","Apart from this...","Qiao Nian even asked Slim Waist Control to arrange for a few people from the Red Alliance to secretly help give some information to confuse Nie Qingru and disrupt the other party’s search direction.","After so many clueless attempts, they had successfully stalled until now without being caught.","\"Have some coffee and rest.\" Seeing she was done, Ye Wangchuan handed her the hot coffee again.","Qiao Nian took a sip and placed it on the table. \"Right away. I’ll erase the traces near their activities first.\"","Her fingers flew across the keyboard. After a while, the information about the red dot disappeared.","Done, Qiao Nian leaned back slightly. There was a hint of fatigue in her eyes as she pinched the bridge of her nose. \"I heard that Nie Qingru also sent someone.\"","\"Di Xicheng.\" Ye Wangchuan had more spies in Continent M than her and knew more specific information. \"He’s the one coming this time.\"","Qiao Nian did not comment and did not take it to heart. She only asked, \"Besides him, who else is coming?\"","Ye Wangchuan pushed aside the black hair covering her eyes, revealing her sharp eyebrows. Her eyes were beautiful and clear, but she had been too hostile recently.","His Adam’s apple bobbed. He did not want to say it, but he still went ahead. \"The Xie family. Old Madam Xie.\"","Xie Tingyun and Xie Yun’s Mom.","Ji Nan’s grandmother.","Ji Lingfeng’s mother-in-law.","Obviously, her appearance in the illegal district at this time meant that Old Madam Xie had participated in the hunt back then."]},{"number":3769,"title":"Chapter 3769: No One Has Privileges With Me","paragraphs":["Qiao Nian looked up, her slender neck tense like a bow. She closed her sharp eyes and said with a murderous tone, \"No one has any privileges with me.\"","**","Illegal district.","The terrain in the mountains was complicated, with poor and backward villages everywhere.","There were only a few decent buildings near the center of Liberty Square in the town. The other places were filled with illegal houses. The crooked houses were densely packed together without any layout. Many of them did not even have a sidewalk.","This also caused the town to be filled with small paths that could barely allow one person to pass through.","Apart from being a means for people to pass through, the path was also the only drainage channel.","The people in the illegal district were not highly educated.","This was a poor area. It was difficult for everyone to survive, let alone care about other things.","Therefore, even though there was only one narrow path, most people still threw the sewage and trash in the public area.","As a result, the originally narrow passageway was always filled with a stench, making it difficult to breathe.","Those searching for the person from the Nance Alliance were in such an extreme environment.","Every day that passed, they returned looking like they had nothing to live for and went to their rooms to take a cold shower.","Even so, they still did not find anything after searching for four days.","Previously, they had received news that the person seemed to have disappeared into thin air. No matter how hard they tried, they could not find any traces.","On this day.","The people went out to look and returned.","Two burly men couldn’t take it anymore. They cursed and went into their rooms to shower and change.","The other seven or eight people had completely given up struggling. They were used to letting themselves sit in the lobby.","One took off her gloves and threw them on the coffee table. Her beautiful face was especially eye-catching among the men, but she had a bad temper.","\"Where’s Young Master Di? Have your reclusive families not found Michel’s location yet? If we can’t find his location by satellite, we’ll continue to search door to door.\"","She spoke rather rudely.","The main reason was that they had suffered in this backward town these few days.","The locals did not dare to provoke them, but they did not cooperate either.","If they paid, they would get something out of them. If they did not pay, these people would not tell the truth. They looked fawning and polite, but in fact, they played tricks.","\"We’ve been here almost a week. We can’t go on like this.\" The woman brushed her hair. Not only did her flirtatious gesture fail to inspire beauty, but it also allowed her to smell the rancid smell of her hair.","Frowning, she resisted the urge to shower and wash her hair and complained, \"We’re here to look for someone with the reclusive families as the leader. Everyone has worked hard enough. The reclusive families can’t convince the public with this little ability!\"","The others in the lobby did not respond, but in fact, they were all thinking the same thing.","They had been searching for five consecutive days and were really getting impatient.","Only two of them were not sent out to look for someone.","One was an old lady from the Xie family.","Due to her age and seniority, they gave her some face and did not let her look for the target.","The other person was sent by Nie Qingru, who had the highest status here.","No one knew Di Xicheng’s position in the reclusive families.","However, these few days, everyone who saw him would greet him as \"Young Master Di\". It seemed his status was not low."]},{"number":3770,"title":"Chapter 3770: Young Master Di, Someone From the Xie Family is Outside","paragraphs":["Everyone tacitly agreed not to let him go out and take turns looking for the target.","However, this was Tian Chen’s territory.","Even if this slum was too barren and remote, and Tian Chen might not care about it, they had to keep a low profile in other people’s territory.","This time, each family only sent a few people. There were not many of them together.","It had already been a few days, and everyone on the roster had their turn.","If they could not find the people tomorrow, it would be their turn again.","This was the reason why the woman was so angry.","Who would want to shuttle through those smelly ditches, knock on the doors, and ask people one by one? How long would it take to find the person they were looking for?","\"Where’s Young Master Di?\" At this thought, the woman felt frustrated. She touched the arm of the man with the sharp mouth and monkey-like cheeks beside her and asked him out of the corner of her eye.","\"How would I know?\" The monkey-faced man from Continent F rolled his eyes.","Seeing that he was indifferent to a beauty like her, the woman scolded, \"Trash.\"","She sat down angrily and fiddled with her mottled manicure. \"Anyway, if you expect me to go tomorrow, that’s your wishful thinking.\"","Everyone came from different places and forces and had gathered together at the last minute. No one was willing to submit to each other, to begin with. The others also felt discouraged.","...","Upstairs.","The largest room was occupied by Di Xicheng, with secret guards trained by Nie Qingru guarding the door.","Knock knock.","A knock on the door interrupted him. Di Xicheng adjusted his glasses, took them off, and leaned back in his chair.","Soon, the secret guards came in.","\"Young Master Di, it’s someone from the Xie family.\"","\"Mm.\"","Di Xicheng looked a little tired as he responded. He did not care about Old Madam Xie and asked him directly, \"What’s going on down there? It’s so noisy.\"","The soundproofing of this hotel was not good, and the lobby was so noisy that Di Xicheng could hear the clamor upstairs.","The secret guard answered as if he was there. \"The people from the other families who went out to look for him have returned. They couldn’t find Michel and his grandson today. They’re feeling uncomfortable. Someone instigated and implied that they want you to give them a satellite map as soon as possible.\"","\"Who is it?\" Di Xicheng placed his hands on the table and asked calmly.","\"The eldest daughter of Country Y, Singh.\"","\"Oh, her.\" Di Xicheng remembered who she was and a face appeared in his mind. He smiled and said casually, \"I remember the stairs on the left are narrow and steep. Some people almost had accidents there. It would be terrible if Miss Singh accidentally broke her arm. This place is still three hours away from the city. Wouldn’t she have to endure three hours of immense pain before she can get to the hospital...\"","The secret guard replied, \"I understand, Young Master Di.\"","Di Xicheng smiled and raised his hand. \"Go ahead.\"","The secret guard did not leave immediately. He looked up. \"Young Master Di, the person from the Xie family outside...\"","Di Xicheng did not have a good impression of the people from the independent continent. He naturally hated them. He did not have much to do with Old Madam Xie, who liked to take advantage of her seniority. \"I’m not meeting her.\"","\"Yes.\"","The secret guard turned around and left swiftly.","Di Xicheng put on his glasses again and looked at the high-end computer before him. The blue screen was checking the location of a plane.","He typed a code, and the screen began analyzing the plane and hacking into its navigation system."]},{"number":3771,"title":"Chapter 3771: We Offended Qiao Nian, There’s No Way","paragraphs":["However, things didn’t go as smoothly as expected.","The plane’s navigation system was like an iron wall that could not be penetrated from outside. He could only use the reclusive families’ satellite to locate the area where the plane was now.","Nine nautical miles above the high seas of the illegal zone.","Di Xicheng estimated that the plane would arrive in about two hours. If nothing went wrong, the landing spot would be the airport in the center of the illegal district.","He rubbed his chin, and the lenses reflected the sophisticated data on the computer. The corners of his mouth curled up silently. \"Looks like they’re coming soon.\"","Di Xicheng had never liked sitting back and doing nothing. He pursued excitement and enjoyed the feeling of gambling with his life.","Therefore, after confirming that the opponent he was waiting for was on the plane, he could not wait to give her a welcome gift.","He thought so and did so.","He took an old phone from the drawer and made a call.","\"Two hours later, at the airport...\"","**","Outside.","For the third time, Old Madam Xie was blocked by Nie Qingru’s secret guards. She suppressed humiliation and anger and returned to her room, slamming the door.","\"Matriarch, are you alright? Is that Young Master Di... still unwilling to see you?\" The people from the Xie family saw she was angry and guessed the outcome. They couldn’t help but ask her carefully.","Old Madam Xie walked to the bed and sat down. \"Heh, what is this?! He’s not a Nie. I heard he’s just a relative of the Empress’s good friend. With such an identity, he still dares to put on airs before me. He really doesn’t know what he’s playing with!\"","\"The people from the reclusive families have always been arrogant.\" The servants did not know how to comfort her, so they could only persuade her, \"It’s fine if he doesn’t want to see us, but we don’t have to be on good terms with him.\"","Old Madam Xie pressed her temples, her face twitching. \"What do you know? Do you think I want to kiss someone’s cold ass at my age? And it’s the cold ass of a young brat. I’m doing this for the family’s sake.\"","\"Matriarch...\"","\"If Xinyao were still in the First Research Institute with Deputy Director Shi, I wouldn’t have come here to suffer. But as you can see, we’ve been having a hard time in the past two years. First, Xinyao offended her aunt and caused her to be unable to return home. She was even chased out of the First Research Institute. Then, Yun’er became at odds with me and wasn’t willing to help the family anymore. She was just short of drawing a clear line with us on the surface.\"","\"Matriarch.\" The servants were worried.","Old Madam Xie continued, \"The Xie family has relied on these connections to get to where we are now. Seeing that our two biggest backers are unwilling to help the family, I can only build a relationship with my old friends and see if I can rely on them.","\"We offended Qiao Nian, and only the reclusive families can offset the fact that she’s on bad terms with us... That’s why I have to talk to Di Xicheng.\"","Most of Old Madam Xie’s anger dissipated at this point. She comforted herself by saying, \"Forget it, I’ll think of another way. In short, we have to seize this opportunity to perform well. It’s best to build a relationship with the reclusive families... and the Empress.\"","\"Okay.\"","\"By the way, have you found any clues about Michel?\" The Xie family had a certain amount of connections in the illegal district. They were slightly more influential than the others and were not like headless flies."]},{"number":3772,"title":"Chapter 3772: Sister Nian Is Here","paragraphs":["Besides sending people to search the town according to Di Xicheng’s request, she had also secretly used her connections to search for the fish that had escaped the net.","\"Not yet.\"","Old Madam Xie frowned. \"He can even turn into a butterfly and fly away.\"","The Nance Alliance was called an organization, but they were actually a group of hot-blooded and ambitious anti-war people. Most of them were just ordinary people.","It was just an accident that Ji Qing joined them.","In fact, Ji Qing had only stayed with them for two years, usually participating in humanitarian rescue activities.","Ji Qing wouldn’t have implicated them.","They were just unlucky. They happened to interact with Ji Qing during the two years when her research results were exposed. This made the reclusive families uneasy.","Especially Nie Qingru, who was the first to suggest a plan to kill them.","They were afraid that some of these people knew or hid Ji Qing’s research results, which touched their core interests and could not be spread.","Therefore, these people might be innocent, but to them, rather than caring if they were innocent, they were more willing to have them become dead and solve their troubles.","This was a world where the strong preyed on the weak. It was incomparably cruel and realistic.","\"I’ll get someone to investigate again,\" the Xie family servant said in a low voice.","Old Madam Xie had had enough of staying in this dilapidated hotel. However, she suddenly thought of something difficult for others to think of. \"Find the family who adopted that child and ask them if that child has contacted them or has mentioned where he was going.\"","\"Alright.\" The servant turned to leave.","Old Madam Xie impatiently waited in the room. For some reason, she felt uneasy, like something was about to happen.","However, only her eldest son knew she was here to investigate the Nance Alliance people who went missing back then. It was unlikely that anything could happen.","Besides, Ji Qing’s death back then was a huge secret. Besides the families that participated in the hunt, no one knew the truth.","Ji Lingfeng did not know what Ji Qing had done.","What was she feeling uneasy about?","Old Madam Xie clutched her chest. She couldn’t say what she was feeling uneasy about, but the intense uneasiness lingered in her chest for a long time, making it difficult for her to breathe.","A face appeared in her mind.","That girl’s unruly face.","There was also that pair of wolf cub-like eyes. Those eyes seemed to be staring at her through the illusion as if they had discovered the truth after 20 years and were about to come looking for her.","Old Madam Xie got up to get a glass of water, secretly blaming herself for overthinking. \"No one will know this secret anymore after we get rid of the last person.","\"Soon. Let’s wait a little longer.","\"It’ll be over soon.\"","**","At the airport.","The plane landed on the runway, quickly stopping after taxiing for a while.","Qiao Nian took off her eye mask.","She looked alright after sleeping, but her eyes showed frustration from being woken up by the landing.","She only had her shoulder bag and could leave right away.","Qin Si had already gotten off the plane.","Guan Yan was discerning and did not come looking for her.","Ye Wangchuan grabbed her shoulder bag and stood up to make way. Then, he extended his other hand to her. \"Let’s go.\"","Qiao Nian looked at his hand—his fingers were long and slender, and the flesh was well-proportioned. It was fair and beautiful, comparable to a work of art."]},{"number":3773,"title":"Chapter 3773: Someone Follows Sister Nian the Moment She Returns","paragraphs":["She stared silently before grabbing his hand and standing up. Then, she unhurriedly said, \"I’m going to the Red Alliance to get something.\"","Ye Wangchuan held the girl’s hand and did not let go. A smile appeared on his thin lips as he said lazily, \"Okay.\"","***","The group alighted from the plane.","The car Guan Yan had arranged was already waiting for them.","Qiao Nian and the others got inside, and the driver drove towards the Red Alliance’s headquarters.","The scenery on both sides of the road quickly passed by.","Guan Yan sat alone in the front passenger seat with her head turned as she introduced the illegal district to the people in the back row.","\"Our illegal district isn’t as big as the independent continent, but the situation is basically the same. There’s no clear management here, only forces and groups of various sizes. The largest force is Tian Chen which you already know of.","\"There are also the Red Alliance, the K Organization, and so on under Tian Chen. There are many other forces in the illegal district besides these. As for the relationships between the various large forces... It’s not as fierce as in the independent continent. No one can bear to see anyone having a good relationship with each other. However, it’s not a good relationship between brothers. It’s fine if they don’t provoke each other usually, but if they do provoke each other, it’s hard to say what will happen.\"","At this point, Guan Yan looked in the girl’s direction with her peach-blossom eyes and noticed the girl pulling down the brim of her cap to reduce her presence.","Guan Yan sensed something and said, \"Actually, the illegal district was similar to the independent continent initially, with fighting and killing every day. It seemed that if they didn’t do something every day, everyone would live a boring life. But it changed later on...\"","\"Why did the illegal district change, when it was like the independent continent?\"","Among the five people in the car, besides the driver and herself, only Qin Si was listening to her seriously.","Guan Yan glanced at him and hesitated before glancing at the rearview mirror from the corner of her eye. Frowning, she said to the chauffeur in a low voice, \"Look at the Buick behind us. Did it follow us all the way?\"","\"Which one?\" The chauffeur was a burly man wearing a baseball cap. The tattoos on his arms were especially eye-catching.","He had not spoken since he picked them up. His personality was similar to Qiao Nian’s—a dull type that did not say much.","If Guan Yan had not suddenly spoken to him, Qin Si would have thought he was mute.","Guan Yan gestured with her chin. \"The black Buick following us. I noticed it from the last traffic light. They have been following us.\"","Previously, she wasn’t sure if the other party was following them, but after two traffic lights, the other party was still following them at a distance of two cars.","She had to be vigilant.","The tattooed man did not say much. \"Let’s find out.\"","Guan Yan raised her eyebrows.","He turned to the people in the back row and said, \"Everyone, sit tight.\"","Next, he suddenly turned the steering wheel and stepped on the accelerator. The car suddenly changed speed and went towards the left fork.","Guan Yan had long been prepared and so was not affected by the change in speed. She sat steadily in her seat and turned her head to observe the car following them.","Sure enough.","The black Buick followed after seeing them suddenly accelerate and change lanes. It seemed they did not have the time to bother whether they were being exposed.","Guan Yan’s expression turned serious and her eyes went cold. Then, she turned around and ordered Qin Si, \"Close the window.\"","Silence.","Not knowing what was happening, Qin Si held his aching forehead and quickly pressed the window button."]},{"number":3774,"title":"Chapter 3774: F*ck, Are They All So Wild in the Illegal Area?","paragraphs":["Almost as soon as he closed the window, the black Buick accelerated and got beside them, turning into a side-by-side drive.","Moreover, the other party was squeezing their space as if he had gone crazy and wanted to cause an accident.","The road they had turned into at the last minute was one-way. The road was not wide, with a green belt at the side. At this moment, the two cars were sharing a tight space, and the other car’s rear bumper kept brushing past theirs. It was extremely dangerous.","Qin Si spent most of his time in Beijing. Even in the independent continent, he stayed in Ye Wangchuan’s territory. He had never seen such a scene.","His handsome face immediately paled and he muttered, \"Oh my god, do these people want to die!\"","Guan Yan was relaxed and even had the mood to tease him. \"You just found out? This is the characteristic of the illegal district. Young Master Qin has seen too little of the world.\"","\"Don’t talk. Hold the armrest tightly,\" Qin Si shouted at her. He really did not know why this woman was so unafraid of death. She was still in the mood to joke at a time like this.","Guan Yan wanted to mock him again, but seeing his genuine concern through the rearview mirror, she subconsciously swallowed her words. \"Forget it.\"","Qin Si did not notice what she said. He turned to the man beside him nervously. \"Master Wang, what’s going on?\"","Ye Wangchuan pulled the back of the seat in front of him with one hand and protected Qiao Nian with the other. His face was emotionless as he said calmly, \"Someone wants to give us a greeting gift.\"","\"Who the f*ck is that?\"","\"Di Xicheng,\" Ye Wangchuan said firmly.","Qin Si frowned. \"I’ve never heard of him. Who is this guy? Someone from the reclusive families?\"","Ye Wangchuan chuckled lazily. \"I guess so.\"","Seeing that he was still in the mood to laugh, Qin Si’s head buzzed with pain. \"Master Wang, aren’t you afraid...\"","\"Qin Si, lower your head,\" the girl reminded him in a low voice before he could finish.","\"Ah?\"","At this moment, the shattering sound from the window on his side scared him.","He immediately turned around and saw that the car opposite them had rolled down its window. A masked man pointed a black muzzle still emitting white smoke in their direction. Clearly, he had already fired a shot just now.","\"F*ck!!!\" Qin Si had never seen such an exciting scene. His face was pale and he could not believe his eyes.","\"The security here is too poor! What kind of f*cking movie set is this?\" Although he said that, his body was honest and tried its best to avoid the window. As he hugged his head, he didn’t forget to ask, \"Sister Qiao, is this car of yours good? Will the second shot directly explode on my head?\"","Before Qiao Nian could say anything, Guan Yan kindly answered, \"It’s bulletproof glass. Don’t worry.\"","The other party clearly did not know that this ordinary-looking off-road vehicle was equipped with something as advanced as bulletproof glass.","The first shot did not shatter the glass. The person opposite did not give up and fired two more shots. They hit the glass and bounced off.","Even so, shooting at such a close distance still caused the glass to be densely covered in spiderwebs, looking shaky and unsafe.","Qin Si was never so close to death before.","He always talked regardless of the situation, but now he was speechless."]},{"number":3775,"title":"Chapter 3775: Listen to My Command Later","paragraphs":["Qiao Nian rubbed her eyebrows and said to him, \"Let’s change seats.\"","\"Sit properly. I’ll do it.\" Ye Wangchuan seemed to know what she was going to do. He stopped her and changed seats with Qin Si.","Then, he directed the tattooed man in front, \"How long before we can leave this road?\"","\"Three minutes.\"","\"What kind of place is this road?\" Ye Wangchuan asked methodically.","Tattoo Arm thought for a moment. \"It should be the business district outside Tian Chen.\"","Since it was a business district, people and traffic must be substantial.","Ye Wangchuan nodded. He knew what to do and instructed him calmly, \"To prevent them from emptying our tires, listen to my instructions later.\"","Tattoo Arm glanced at him but did not immediately agree.","The girl coldly ordered, \"Listen to him.\"","\"Yes, Sun.\"","Tattoo Arm straightened his attitude and agreed without another word.","...","The two cars were side by side. The man in the Buick couldn’t break the glass even after firing a few shots. He quickly realized this off-road vehicle’s specialness.","\"Damn, they’ve bulletproof glass. I can’t break it.\"","There were another three people in the car.","A person looking like a veteran said without panicking, \"What’s the hurry? We’ll hit their tires since we can’t break the window. Boss only told us to scare them, he didn’t say we have to shoot them to death. A car accident is also fine.\"","\"Okay.\"","The shooter immediately calmed down and reloaded his gun. Then, he aimed the muzzle downwards at the SUV’s rapidly spinning tires.","At this moment, he saw the window opposite roll down. Then, he was stunned to see a man’s outstanding handsome face.","What was going on? They had come knocking on his door?","In a daze, he heard the man’s low, commanding voice. \"Charge over!\"","What?","The man subconsciously felt something was wrong, but everything happened too suddenly and he did not have enough time to react.","He saw the black SUV suddenly accelerate towards them.","An accident happened at this moment.","As the cars crashed, he subconsciously wanted to raise his gun, but someone grabbed it and pulled it out of the car along with his upper body.","Hiss.","He was so frightened that he gasped. His expression changed, and he hurriedly called for his companions. \"Save me. Hurry up and catch me!\"","The little friend behind him reacted quickly and grabbed his leg, managing to pull him back, but the gun had already been snatched away.","Just as he was about to catch his breath after the thrilling scene, he heard a muffled gunshot.","Chi—!","Their car started to spin uncontrollably.","It was like a roller washing machine inside, making them dizzy.","He barely managed to stabilize himself. He leaned against the back of the driver’s seat and shouted, \"What are you doing? How can you drive like this? Hurry up and stabilize the car!\"","\"F*ck, the tires are flat. What can I do? Sit tight!\" The driver was also shouting.","The car spun out of control before crashing into the greenery with a bang.","After the impact, their blurry vision saw the black SUV drive away.","They also spotted the weapon that had been snatched from them on the ground."]},{"number":3776,"title":"Chapter 3776: Arriving at the Red Alliance Headquarters","paragraphs":["\"F*ck!\" His eyes were covered in blood. He was so angry that his face turned red, but there was nothing he could do. He could only quickly kick open the door and pull all his friends out of the car.","Panting, he took out his cell phone and called the number at the top. \"Hello, Young Master Di. We have failed.\"","**","After shaking off the Buick, they finally arrived at the Red Alliance’s headquarters.","\"We’re here.\"","The black SUV steadily stopped before a white bungalow, and Guan Yan told everyone to get off before taking out her phone to make a call.","After the shock just now, Qin Si was still unable to calm down. Still a little pale, he asked the girl, \"Who is she calling?\"","Qiao Nian looked at the person he was pointing at and realized it was Guan Yan. She put her hands in her pockets and casually replied, \"Should be Slim Waist Control. She’s probably asking him to investigate those people’s background.\"","Slim Waist Control always stayed in the illegal district and was most familiar with matters here.","Unfortunately, Slim Waist Control was not in the illegal district right now.","Qin Si did not ask further. He looked at the white bungalow in front of him in disbelief. \"... This is the Red Alliance’s headquarters?\"","Qiao Nian had already walked in.","Tattoo Arm threw him a bottle of mineral water. He smiled at his expression. \"Why? This doesn’t look like our headquarters?\"","\"It’s just a little unbelievable.\" Qin Si touched the bridge of his nose without hiding anything before catching the bottle. \"I thought the Red Alliance’s headquarters would look... different.\"","For example, a building complex the size of the Ninth Branch or a manor-like courtyard like the Ji family’s. How could it be an ordinary house that looked no different from where one lived?","Tattoo Arm seemed to know he would say that. He nonchalantly took out another water bottle from the car and handed it to the graceful man.","His attitude was much more respectful than toward Qin Si.","Ye Wangchuan took the bottle and said, \"Thank you.\"","Tattoo Arm looked at him with admiration. He patted his shoulder and said in approval, \"Brother, you’re quite skilled!\"","Guan Yan saw this scene after finishing the call.","The high and mighty Young Master Ye smiled gently, not looking the least bit arrogant.","\"Are you from the East? Are you also from Rao City?\"","\"No, I’m from Beijing.\"","\"Oh. How did you meet Sun? Is Sun usually quiet and cold...\"","Guan Yan couldn’t stand it anymore. She patted his back in anger. \"What are you guys talking about? Let’s enter!\"","Before Tattoo Arm could speak, Guan Yan politely invited Ye Wangchuan. \"Young Master Ye, please.\"","Young Master Ye...","The Tattoo Arm vaguely remembered hearing this term somewhere before, but for the life of him, he couldn’t remember it at this moment.","In this moment of distraction, he fell behind.","He could only enter the western building with Qin Si.","**","After entering, they realized that not only did this bungalow look ordinary from the outside, but there were also some ordinary furniture and daily necessities inside.","The only difference was that apart from the furniture in the living room, there were a few computers in the dining room.","The desktop computers were divided into two levels. Although no one was using them, their professional level was apparent."]},{"number":3777,"title":"Chapter 3777: Sister Nian Came Back to Take a Weapon","paragraphs":["Qiao Nian was no longer in the living room.","After they entered, Tattoo Arm tactfully acted as the butler and made tea for the three of them.","This was Guan Yan’s lair, to begin with.","She naturally sat down and slowly drank the tea.","Compared to her, Qin Si looked much more uncomfortable.","He walked around the house before realizing this was a living place. The furnishings were simple and nothing special.","He picked up a small lion statue casually placed on the shelf and turned to the woman. \"I say, this place doesn’t look like a headquarters at all.\"","\"Then what do you want the headquarters to look like? Isn’t headquarters where people like us stay? We also have to eat and sleep. Instead of a flashy building, why not this? Everyone can live comfortably. What’s wrong with that?\"","Qin Si couldn’t refute her twisted logic. Just as he was about to say something, he saw the girl coming down from the room upstairs.","Qiao Nian distributed the things she brought down to each of them, her movements straightforward and expressionless. \"To protect yourselves.\"","Qin Si barely caught it. Looking down, he realized what Qiao Nian had thrown at him was a small Burke pistol. His expression changed slightly, and he looked up with a complicated expression.","\"Sister...\"","The girl did not wait for him to finish speaking before frankly saying, \"This is an illegal area, so these are all legal possession. Take them with you for self-defense. You don’t have to use them.\"","She handed one to Ye Wangchuan as well. \"Here you go.\"","Ye Wangchuan took it and tested the feel of it. Then, he loaded the gun and took aim. \"When are you going to set off to find him?\"","Guan Yan had one herself.","She also gave Tattoo Arm one.","At his question, her thin eyelids became fan-shaped and the corners of her eyes narrowed. Her eyes were sharp and lazy.","\"Tomorrow.\"","\"Why wait until tomorrow? Can’t we set off now?\" Qin Si asked.","Guan Yan replied in Qiao Nian’s stead, \"You don’t understand Sun’s value. Countless people have been paying attention to us ever since we landed in the illegal district. If she goes to look for him now, she will only bring everyone’s attention to that old man.","\"It’s easy to deal with an old man, but he has a child with him. To ensure their safety, we have to get rid of some spies.\"","Guan Yan was annoyed.","\"Oh right.\" She thought of something else and gloated. \"The news of Sun getting ambushed after leaving the airport will soon spread throughout the illegal district. The illegal district is going to be lively again.\"","In the past, the illegal district was the same as the independent continent. The various large factions did not submit to each other.","Later, Tian Chen and the Red Alliance became stronger, and the two families had a close relationship. With Qiao Nian taking the lead, many forces in the illegal district did not dare to act rashly. There was less and less time to fight, and the illegal district became more and more peaceful...","It could be said the news of Sun being intercepted after leaving the airport was the most explosive news in the illegal district in many years. It would definitely spread.","Qiao Nian happened to pass by her. \"If you have time, deal with the spies outside. Don’t talk rubbish here anymore.\"","Guan Yan said confidently, \"Don’t worry. I’ve already informed Slim Waist Control. Cars will drive out of our base non-stop later. If those people want to follow us, let them. We’ll leave after they follow seven or eight cars. I guarantee we’ll have shaken off most of the spies!\""]},{"number":3778,"title":"Chapter 3778: Offending the Red Alliance Is The As Offending Tian Chen","paragraphs":["Because Qiao Nian had not left after entering the Red Alliance’s headquarters, the various large factions in the illegal district had not been able to obtain first-hand news.","Everyone only knew that Sun had been ambushed not long after leaving the airport, but no one knew if she was injured.","***","K Organization","\"How is it? Haven’t you found anything yet?\"","\"No. The Red Alliance’s territory is quiet. No doctors were called in, and no outsiders entered. We can’t figure out the situation for now. However, I heard from the people at the airport that four people came back this time. Besides the main member, Guan Yan, the other two are men.\"","\"She hasn’t appeared in the illegal district for a long time. I wonder why she’s back this time,\" the K Organization’s leader muttered.","His subordinate did not know much about the Red Alliance. He said disapprovingly, \"Boss, why should we care about her? No matter how powerful she is, she’s just a hacker.\"","The leader looked over murderously. \"Just a hacker? Ha. Don’t talk like that when you go out. Don’t f*cking drag me down with you if you want to die.\"","His subordinate was shocked, and his expression changed. \"Boss, is that Sun so... scary?\"","The leader sneered. \"Hackers aren’t scary. What’s scary is that these hackers have the most advanced weapons in the world. Looking at the entire illegal district, how many factions dare to challenge the Red Alliance? Look at their small building. It’s built at the intersection of the major factions. That place is the center. There are dozens of halls around it. Who dares to approach within ten kilometers of that area? Everyone tacitly agrees that that area is restricted!\"","The lackey’s expression turned ugly.","So impressive?","\"Hmph! And you’re asking me what’s so scary about Sun. Let me tell you, when the Red Alliance was established, she built that house there. At first, a faction disagreed and said that it was too close to them. They insisted on snatching territory and chasing them away. The next day, that faction disappeared from the illegal district.\"","The lackey’s legs went weak. He barely grabbed the sofa to remain standing. \"Tian Chen... doesn’t care?\"","Tian Chen had the final say in the illegal district.","\"Tian Chen...\" The leader was silent for a moment. He had a guess but could not tell his subordinates. He only said, \"Tian Chen and the Red Alliance have a complicated relationship. Anyway, Tian Chen won’t care about the Red Alliance and won’t let anyone offend them. Offending the Red Alliance is the same as offending Tian Chen.\"","The lackey was on the brink of tears. \"Boss, are we still keeping an eye on them?\"","\"Of course!\" The leader gritted his teeth. \"Sun suddenly came back. We have to at least find out why.\"","Most spies monitoring the Red Alliance’s headquarters had the same thought.","They didn’t dare to kill Qiao Nian. However, seeing Qiao Nian suddenly return to the illegal district, they had no choice but to be vigilant. They wanted to see what this big boss, who had not returned for a long time, wanted to do.","That was all.","The leader lowered his head and thought about it. Then, he sneered. \"I wonder who’s so bold to try to kill Sun this time. Recently, many monsters have been sneaking into the illegal district. I wonder if Tian Chen will make a move...\"","Previously, he received news that several foreign forces had secretly come to the illegal district in search of someone.","Those people went to the mountains as soon as they arrived.","Because they had been moving in the mountains and did not affect those in the central area, no one paid much attention to these people."]},{"number":3779,"title":"Chapter 3779: He Doesn’t Take the Initiative to Call","paragraphs":["Not surprisingly, the person who intercepted Sun was definitely one of these people.","As for the person they were looking for, it was probably related to Sun’s sudden return to the illegal district.","The leader thought momentarily before going back inside to make a call.","...","\"You’re saying they got into a fight on the road because they were looking for the same person?\" The woman’s voice was cold and capable.","The leader replied carefully, \"Yes. That’s my guess. I don’t know if I’m right.\"","Jian Jin asked expressionlessly, \"Then, do you know who those people are looking for?\"","\"This...\" The leader thought before replying, \"Someone from the Xie family found us through their connections and asked us to ask a couple for some information. It’s said they’re looking for a child and an old man. The child and grandfather the couple took in. There’s nothing special about them. I don’t know why those people are looking for them.\"","\"I understand.\"","Jian Jin hung up and went to see Lu Zhi.","She pushed open the office’s glass door and walked in. Seeing the man sitting behind the wide desk with his eyes closed, she couldn’t help but slow down.","\"Boss.\"","Lu Zhi’s eyes opened, showing a little fatigue. He didn’t say anything, as if he did not see her. He picked up his fountain pen and was about to open the document. \"Speak.\"","\"Qiao’s back.\"","Lu Zhi gripped the fountain pen until his knuckles turned slightly white. \"She still knows how to come back.\"","Jian Jin did not tell him that Qiao Nian had been ambushed on the way. She only told him that Qiao Nian might have returned to search for someone.","She observed Lu Zhi’s expression as she spoke. \"She came from the independent continent. I’m afraid those two people are related to her Mom.\"","Lu Zhi did not answer immediately. Instead, he put down the fountain pen in his hand and tapped the table, seeming to think about something.","\"What’s Nie Qingru doing?\"","\"She’s still dealing with the Beijing mess.\" Jian Jin almost wanted to laugh at the mention of this. \"The dissatisfaction within the reclusive families is getting stronger and stronger. She probably won’t be able to hold on for long before reaching an unconditional settlement with Beijing. It depends on whether Beijing is willing to reconcile. That Old Master of the Ye family is not to be trifled with. He has always been unyielding. I’m afraid that even if she wants to reconcile, Old Master Ye won’t be willing to let go easily. She can be considered to have shot herself in the foot.\"","\"Mm.\"","Lu Zhi seemed very tired. After a few seconds of silence, he muttered, \"Then let’s not be anxious. We’ll talk about it when she asks us for help.\"","Silence.","Jian Jin looked at him, and she couldn’t help but ask, \"Boss, aren’t you going to call Qiao?\"","It was rare for Qiao Nian to return.","What a great opportunity!","Why couldn’t Big Boss Lu figure it out? He actually wanted to wait for Qiao to call them. If Qiao did that, she would not be Qiao!","Did he still have no idea about Qiao Nian’s personality after all these years?","Lu Zhi did not even raise his head as he calmly said, \"No, let’s wait.\"","Jian Jin was impressed. \"Okay, whatever.\"","She did not want to talk anymore. It hurt to talk about it. Besides, her boss never listened to advice. She might as well mind her own business. \"As long as you don’t regret it.\"","Lu Zhi glanced at her. He did not seem to have any intention of regretting.","Jian Jin was completely speechless. She simply turned around and left.","**","At the same time, in a hotel in the town.","Di Xicheng also received news that the interception had failed."]},{"number":3780,"title":"Chapter 3780: Oh Right, Qiao Nian Is Here Too","paragraphs":["Not the least bit surprised, Di Xicheng instructed the secret guards, \"Deal with those people. Do it cleanly. Don’t let anyone catch you red-handed.\"","\"Yes.\"","The secret guards were used to it and went out to do their work.","Di Xicheng’s eyes narrowed as he got up for a breather.","Just as he opened the door, he bumped into Old Madam Xie, who happened to come out at that moment.","Old Madam Xie’s eyes lit up when she saw him. She smiled and strode over to greet him. \"Young Master Di, I finally bumped into you. I have something to talk to you about.\"","Di Xicheng did not want to see her, but since they bumped into each other, he had to give her face. \"Matriarch wants to talk to me?\"","Old Madam Xie could tell he was being perfunctory. She smiled and suppressed her discomfort. \"I’ve found him.\"","Di Xicheng did not expect this. He smiled in disbelief. \"Oh? Matriarch, you’re not mistaken, right? So many people have been searching these few days, but we can’t find him. You’ve been staying in the hotel all this time, but you actually found him.\"","Old Madam Xie told him how she found the person. Then, she said, \"They’re hiding in a house in the town. The building is too dilapidated, with many miscellaneous people living there. If we go straight to catch them, we might alert them and let them run away.\"","She was slightly smug. \"So I thought of a way to send them a message, saying that his parents have arranged to meet him in the small forest. The child must miss his parents. We just have to wait for them to get there before sweeping in.\"","Di Xicheng looked at the old lady’s fierce and mean expression. He thought of something, and his eyes filled with mockery. The corners of his lips curled up slightly. \"As expected of someone from the independent continent.\"","Old Madam Xie did not catch the mockery in his words and thought that Di Xicheng was praising her. Smiling, she tidied her head scarf slightly before saying, \"If we eradicate the last hidden time bomb this time, I hope Young Master Di can put in a few good words for the Empress.\"","\"Of course.\"","Di Xicheng agreed readily.","Old Madam Xie secretly heaved a sigh of relief. Her attitude became warmer, and she told him the agreed-upon time and place.","In order to lower the grandfather’s and grandson’s guard, Old Madam Xie cunningly scheduled the meeting at six in the morning.","People were the most relaxed and easily swayed at this time. It also matched the mentality of parents wanting to see their children.","After all, no one would meet in the forest in the middle of the night. It was too dark to see clearly.","\"If they don’t come...\"","\"They’ll definitely come.\" Old Madam Xie was very confident. \"I told the person who sent the message to add that his adoptive mother is sick. She’s seriously ill and only wants to see him one last time.\"","Even if it was fake, that was simply how people were. Their hearts would soften when kinship was involved.","Once their hearts softened, they would take the risk.","Di Xicheng’s lips curled up, and his usually cold eyes saw her in a new light. \"I didn’t expect Matriarch Xie to be so... capable.\"","This time, Old Madam Xie could tell the other party was mocking her. Her smile faded, but she didn’t dare to flare up because of the other party’s identity.","She was secretly annoyed.","What did Di Xicheng mean?","She had thought of a way to lure them out, but he was still being sarcastic. How ridiculous!","Fortunately, Di Xicheng did not say anything else and started walking. \"I’ll inform everyone to make arrangements and prepare to reel in the net.\"","He did not forget to say to Old Madam Xie, who was standing there, without looking back, \"Oh, right, Qiao Nian is here too. We have to hurry up.\""]},{"number":3781,"title":"Chapter 3781: Chase, Don’t Let Them Run Away","paragraphs":["Old Madam Xie felt as if she had been struck by lightning. Goosebumps appeared on her body. What was Qiao Nian doing here? Could it be that she knew something?","**","5:30 A.M.","The first rays of dawn shone in the town, and the sky grew bright.","In a dilapidated building, a bearded man in shabby clothes opened the door and peeked out.","After not seeing anyone, he quietly made way and said to the old man and the boy behind him, \"I’ve looked. There’s no one outside. You can come out now.\"","After a while, a thin old man and a six- or seven-year-old little boy stepped forward. The old man held the little boy’s hand and thanked the man. \"Ryan, thank you. I’ve troubled you these two days. If it weren’t for you...\"","The bearded man supported him and vaguely said, \"Old Mi, don’t thank me. I should be thanking you. If it weren’t for the Nance Alliance helping our village back then, I wouldn’t have survived until now.\"","\"Grandpa, let’s go.\" The little boy seemed anxious as he tugged at the old man’s clothes.","The old man ruffled his hair and comforted him gently. \"Be good, wait a little longer. Grandpa will be done talking to Uncle in a moment.\"","The man called Ryan looked at him and then at the pouting child. He rubbed his eyebrows and finally persuaded, \"Old Mi, I shouldn’t be saying too much, but you’re my benefactor, so I still want to remind you. This news came too suddenly. I’m afraid this is a trap...\"","\"I know, thank you.\" The old man rubbed the little boy’s head again and looked up at him with a helpless expression.","He had been hiding all these years, so how could he not know how ’fake’ the news of the so-called adoptive mother wanting to see them was? However, the child insisted on seeing his mother.","There was nothing he could do.","Michel said in a low voice, \"I’ve been hiding for so many years. At most, I’ll just give them my life.\"","**","The small forest was not far from town. The further they walked, the more desolate it became.","There were no pedestrians at this time, and the surroundings were terrifyingly quiet.","\"Grandpa, where do you think Mom will be waiting for us?\"","\"Didn’t she say the grove?\"","\"Grandpa, can we find Mom?\"","Silence.","As they walked into the forest, it grew abnormally quiet.","The old man’s heart sank. Not in the mood to comfort the child, he looked around vigilantly and grabbed the little boy firmly.","What would come would come.","Just as they completely stepped into the forest, they heard a series of giggles and approaching footsteps.","The old man’s expression changed drastically. He grabbed his grandson’s hand and shouted instinctively, \"Run!\"","He grabbed his grandson and ran.","The forest was interspersed with all kinds of winding paths. The terrain was very complicated.","The old man was obviously familiar with this terrain. He threw down a smoke bomb and dodged the first wave of pursuit. In the blink of an eye, he disappeared with the child.","\"F*ck, they got away!\"","\"Cough cough, this old man even brought a smoke bomb with him!\"","Old Madam Xie was the angriest. She immediately shouted, \"What are you waiting for? Chase them!\"","After the thick smoke dissipated a little, the group immediately split into three and went in three different directions. They were determined to catch them."]},{"number":3782,"title":"Chapter 3782: A Strong Light Shot His Eye","paragraphs":["At the same time.","Di Xicheng also moved.","He did not run around like a headless fly like the others. Instead, he went to the southeast with a clear target.","There was a mountain pass to the southeast of this forest. Only through there could one go up the mountain.","If one wanted to avoid being tracked, they would have to hide in the mountains.","As it turned out, he was right.","An old man and a child were destined not to be able to run fast. He did not waste much time chasing after the duo.","\"Ah! Grandpa.\" As the child accidentally kicked a rock, the old man finally stopped running as if he had given up.","The old man helped up his grandson, who had fallen to the ground and was crying. Not looking at the person who had caught up to him, he said without turning his head, \"You’ve been chasing me for 20 years because you want to bury all the projects she researched back then... I’ve said it many times, I don’t know anything. Whether you believe it or not, from the moment we knew each other to the moment we went our separate ways, we only did things related to humanitarian aid. The research and projects you mentioned... I don’t know anything!\"","\"I believe you,\" Di Xicheng replied calmly from behind. A smile could be detected in his voice, gentle and easy to talk to.","The old man did not believe the other party would say that. It was as if a desperate person had suddenly seen a glimmer of hope.","Di Xicheng was undoubtedly a young man.","He was wearing a hood that covered most of his face, but his eyes were dazzling and hearty, making people let down their guard.","\"You...\"","\"Shh.\" Di Xicheng gestured for him to shush. He took a gun from his pocket and loaded it casually in front of the old man.","The old man’s expression changed slightly. He shielded his grandson and looked at him in disbelief. \"Didn’t you say you believe me...\"","\"Yes, I believe you.\" The sound of the pistol being loaded and his sloppy voice formed a deliberate harmony.","Di Xicheng looked into his eyes and suddenly smiled. \" ’Just because I believe you doesn’t mean I’ll let you off.’ Have you heard of this saying?\"","Silence.","\"In this world, only the dead can put people at ease!\"","After saying that, he aimed the black muzzle at the old man’s temple.","After hiding for 20 years, he finally faced this day. The old man couldn’t tell if he was more afraid or relieved.","His mouth was dry from nervousness as he looked at the young man and said his last plea, \"My grandson doesn’t know anything. He’s still young. Can you send him back to my friend’s house after I die? Since you’ve found me, you should know where I’m hiding.\"","It was his only request.","Di Xicheng’s lips curled up, but his heart didn’t soften. \"He will accompany you right after you die. This way, you can take care of him yourself. Won’t you feel more at ease?\"","\"You won’t even let a child off?!\"","The old man’s expression changed. He pulled the little boy back two steps in disbelief, angry and afraid.","\"He doesn’t know anything!\"","Di Xicheng did not want to talk to him anymore and was about to shoot.","Suddenly, the sound of a motorcycle whistle came from the small forest. It buzzed from all directions, as if many people were coming this way.","Di Xicheng’s first reaction was to think of an old enemy. He dropped the frivolous look in his eyes and hurried to shoot the old man.","At this critical moment, a strong light shot into his eyes from the opposite side."]},{"number":3783,"title":"Chapter 3783: Still Shot","paragraphs":["Under the pain, Di Xicheng’s finger on the trigger slipped. That momentary pause was enough for the person to take the old man and the young boy away.","\"Hold on to me.\"","The girl’s voice always had the power to calm people down.","When Di Xicheng finally adapted to the strong light, he only saw the back of a motorcycle driving away.","The old man and the young boy who were not far away from him a moment ago had already been taken away by the other party.","His expression suddenly turned cold. He aimed at the motorcycle. If not for the limited time, he would have shot it a few times.","With his skills, he could still get the tires.","However, his blind shots were also very accurate. He saw small sparks when the bullets collided with the metal shell.","Di Xicheng still couldn’t keep the motorcycle. He watched helplessly as it accelerated, disappearing from his sight.","His expression turned cold as he took out his phone and made a call. \"Qiao Nian is here. Let’s retreat.\"","**","Almost at the same time.","The girl riding the motorcycle was also talking to someone through the walkie-talkie in her ear. \"I’ve picked them up. Don’t linger. Leave quickly.\"","\"Okay.\"","Without another word, Guan Yan ordered Tattoo Arm and the others to retreat. Their goal today was only to snatch the grandfather and grandson pair, not to fight to the death with those people.","The sound of the roaring motorcycle receded.","Two SUVs were parked outside. The man in a white shirt and black pants leaned against the side of the car and waited for them to emerge. Soon, he heard the sound of a motorcycle.","\"Sister Qiao and the others are out.\" Qin Si stood up straight.","Sure enough, they soon saw the people coming out.","Qiao Nian had just landed in the illegal district when she was ambushed. Coupled with her identity as a big boss, many people were eyeing her.","To avoid trouble, she did not want to cause a large-scale commotion this time. She only brought a few capable people from the Red Alliance.","Since they couldn’t make a big scene, they definitely couldn’t go head-to-head with this large group of people.","Therefore, when Qiao Nian found out that Michel and his grandson had left their hiding place, she came up with a last-minute solution to snatch them away through the nimble movements of the Mech.","Things were pretty rushed. Fortunately, they arrived in time.","Qiao Nian was the first to come out.","Qin Si heard the sound of brakes, and then he saw the girl take off her helmet and shake her hair.","Oh shit, she’s so cool.","Qin Si was stunned for a second.","Qiao Nian hung the helmet on the handle and turned around to say to the people behind her, \"Get down.\"","Behind her car was an old man and a young boy.","The younger one got down obediently.","The old man’s situation was not so optimistic.","\"He’s been shot.\" Ye Wangchuan helped the old man down and spoke to the girl in a low voice.","Qiao Nian saw the blood seeping out of the old man’s clothes. She looked at the old man who was on his last breath and did not say anything. How could she not understand?","Her expression was a little ugly. She lowered her voice and looked at the silent old man with her dark eyes. \"Why didn’t you say you were shot?!\"","When she heard the gunshots behind her, she knew that Di Xicheng had reacted and fired.","At that time, she did not expect the person behind her to be shot.","Because she’d have never thought someone would forcefully endure after being shot.","The old man was on the verge of death. His eyes were fixed on the little boy as he said weakly, \"I don’t want to cause trouble for you.\""]},{"number":3784,"title":"Chapter 3784: Sister Nian: Save Him First","paragraphs":["Although old and not knowing where these people came from, he had a feeling.","These people were here to help him.","In fact, he felt this way for the past few days. Someone had been helping him in the dark. That was why he and his grandson had not been found these past few days...","Ye Wangchuan held the girl’s wrist and said in a low voice, \"He’s seriously injured. Let’s not talk about it for now. Let’s send him to the hospital first.\"","Qiao Nian took a deep breath. \"Carry him into the car. I’ll give him an emergency bandage. Otherwise, he’ll lose blood and go into shock before he reaches the hospital.\"","\"Okay.\"","Ye Wangchuan called Qin Si to help and moved the old man into the car.","Qiao Nian bandaged the old man’s wounds to prevent him from bleeding to death.","At this moment, Guan Yan and the others came out one after another.","Seeing this scene, she was more surprised than happy.","\"What’s going on?\" Guan Yan walked over.","Qin Si roughly told her the situation, but he did not have time to elaborate.","The girl had already bandaged the old man and left the car. Ignoring the blood on her hand, she said to the group, \"He’s been shot. We have to get to the hospital to get the bullet out. Let’s not waste any more time. Let’s go.\"","\"Sun, over here...\" Guan Yan frowned and pointed to the people in the forest, asking how to deal with them.","Compared to dealing with the people in the forest, Qiao Nian wanted to save the old man’s life more. Thus, she said indifferently, \"Save him first.\"","\"Alright.\" Guan Yan could roughly understand her desire to save the old man.","No matter what, this old man was related to Sun’s mother. It was also because of Sun’s mother that he was hunted down.","There was nothing wrong with Sun wanting to save him first.","As for those people...","Guan Yan looked at the dark forest, and her beautiful lips curled into a smile. \"We’re still in the illegal district, anyway. They can’t escape.\"","Qiao Nian’s goal this time was only to save the grandfather and grandson pair. Since the person they were looking for had been accidentally shot, they moved quickly.","Soon, the spot outside the forest grew silent again.","***","In the small forest.","More than 20 people from the few families had already gathered.","Old Madam Xie’s reaction was the biggest, and she looked the most embarrassed.","\"You said that Qiao Nian saved him?\"","\"Why is she here?\"","\"She knows?\"","Old Madam Xie anxiously asked one question after another, as if Qiao Nian was even more terrifying than the King of Hell.","\"Impossible... How could she know this secret?\" She seemed afraid that Qiao Nian would find out what happened back then.","But this time, she couldn’t comfort herself.","Because the truth was obvious in front of them.","If Qiao Nian didn’t know anything, why would she appear in the illegal district and save that old man?","Since she appeared, the secret of their killing of Ji Qing back then could no longer be hidden!","At least Qiao Nian knew some of the truth.","Just thinking about this made Old Madam Xie’s heartbeat accelerate. Her heart was about to jump out of her throat, and her face became paler and paler.","\"What’s she trying to do? What’s she trying to do?!\" she muttered with a heavier tone, her heart in a panic.","She knew that Ji Qing’s death back then was not scary. What was scary was Qiao Nian’s attitude in pursuing the matter to the end!","What was this?","Did she want to settle scores with them?"]},{"number":3785,"title":"Chapter 3785: We Have to Leave the Illegal District Immediately","paragraphs":["Di Xicheng did not waste his breath and simply said, \"We have to leave immediately.\"","\"Now?\"","\"Where to?\"","Many people were skeptical.","Di Xicheng’s expression did not change. \"Leave the illegal district.\"","Leave the illegal district?!","Everyone was stunned.","People looked at each other, seeing surprise and confusion in each other’s eyes. Then, they quickly looked away and frowned.","Singh refused. \"It wasn’t easy for us to find that person’s whereabouts. We just accidentally let him slip away. Are you crazy to ask us to leave the illegal district after failing?\"","Old Madam Xie’s heart turned cold. She knew very well why Di Xicheng was in a hurry to leave.","Not feeling at ease, her expression was terrible as she grabbed Singh and said with a dark face, \"Just listen to him. If we don’t leave soon, none of us will be able to leave later!\"","Singh shook off her hand. \"What the hell are you talking about? We’re about to get them. I’m not leaving.\"","The others did not know which side to stand on upon seeing this.","A thin, monkey-like man tried to smooth things over. \"Alright, alright. We’re all together in this. What are you guys doing? We have to discuss this peacefully. Don’t quarrel.\"","Singh had long been dissatisfied with Di Xicheng. Now that she had seized the opportunity, she became even more domineering and unforgiving. She crossed her arms and sneered. \"I wouldn’t dare to quarrel with the Empress of the reclusive families. But I also have a mission this time. The people have run away, and the mission hasn’t been completed. I’m not going anywhere.\"","\"This...\" The monkey-like man had also come with a family mission. He immediately looked at Di Xicheng. \"Young Master Di, why don’t you ask the Empress?\"","The reclusive families had always been their leader.","Now that the situation had come to this, everyone naturally looked to the reclusive families for a solution.","Unexpectedly, Di Xicheng turned around. \"Forget it if you don’t want to leave. Don’t blame me for not reminding you later.\"","He left without looking back. He actually left so many people behind!","As soon as he left, the guards Nie Qingru had sent for him also left. In the blink of an eye, only a few families were left in the small forest.","Singh kicked a tree fiercely, her face contorting in anger. \"F*ck, what does he mean! A member of the reclusive families? Is this their attitude?\"","The others did not expect Di Xicheng to leave without giving them any face.","Everyone’s expressions turned ugly.","Someone caught the main point and asked calmly, \"Who are those people who came today? Why did they save Michel? Are they also related to the incident from 20 years ago?\"","20 years ago, the hunting of Ji Qing by the various large families was a secret. Only the family members who participated in the hunting back then knew about this secret.","Over the years, it had not spread outside. It could be said to be very secretive.","Now, there was only one person left in the Nance Alliance. As long as they dealt with him, this secret would be completely buried.","However, someone threw a wrench in their plan...","None of the 20 or so people felt good at this moment. The feeling of being intercepted at the last moment was indescribable. They were aggrieved and indignant.","\"Who exactly is Qiao Nian?\"","Everyone looked at Old Madam Xie."]},{"number":3786,"title":"Chapter 3786: They’re On Someone’s Territory","paragraphs":["That was because she was the only one who had the biggest reaction when Di Xicheng said that name. It was obvious that she knew the people who came today.","More than 20 pairs of eyes stared at her, their eyes filled with curiosity.","Old Madam Xie was silent for a while before squeezing a sentence from her stiff muscles. \"She’s Ji Qing’s daughter. Before dying, Ji Qing hid her in the Rao City orphanage, and only recently has she been found...","\"But that’s not the point.\" She couldn’t be bothered to explain so much to these people. She looked at everyone with an ugly expression before continuing, \"The point is that this is the illegal district.\"","\"What’s wrong with the illegal district?\" Even the woman who had just been angered by Di Xicheng was curious.","Old Madam Xie’s facial muscles twitched. Then, she clenched her fists and gritted her teeth. \"The illegal district is her territory.\"","\"She’s Sun.\"","Boss of the Red Alliance.","Sun.","Even the most inexperienced people had heard of this name.","This time, everyone’s expression changed.","Old Madam Xie couldn’t care less and reluctantly said, \"Let’s quickly go back and listen to the reclusive families. Michel isn’t important anymore. The main point is that since she has investigated and found her way here, we soon won’t be able to leave even if we want to.\"","**","Reality proved that Di Xicheng was smart and reacted quickly.","He was already downstairs when the group returned to the hotel.","Seeing that everyone had just returned, he looked down at them. \"... All our fake IDs are already on the blacklist of the illegal district. We can’t leave the country.\"","The illegal district was the same as the independent continent.","Access control was strict.","However, no matter how strict the management was, loopholes always existed. They had used fake identities to come to the illegal district this time in order to keep a low profile.","Upon returning, Di Xicheng tried to use his fake identity to buy a plane ticket. It was at that point that he realized his fake identity had been blacklisted.","Since he was on the blacklist, the others’ fake identities would definitely suffer the same outcome.","Sure enough.","At first, the others did not believe it and tried to use their ID cards to buy plane tickets, boat tickets, and other means of transportation that could leave the illegal district.","But they soon realized that Di Xicheng was right—they had been exposed!","No matter how they tried to refresh the page, the notification on their phones always said there was something wrong with their identity documents.","\"F*ck!\" Singh’s expression changed.","Old Madam Xie trembled, requiring the help of the people around to barely keep standing. Her face was filled with panic. \"What does she want... What exactly does she want...\"","She intuitively guessed what Qiao Nian wanted to do.","However, it was precisely because she had guessed Qiao Nian’s thoughts that Old Madam Xie could not find peace and was in a state of panic.","She grabbed the arm of the servant beside her and suddenly thought of something. Composing herself, she said to the others, \"I’ll go upstairs first.\"","Then, she hurriedly went upstairs to her room.","Passing by Di Xicheng, she did not try to make connections. She looked anxious as if she had thought of a solution.","However, everyone was anxious about being blacklisted, so no one noticed Old Madam Xie’s cheap shot.","Only Di Xicheng sneered when he saw her rushing up, his eyes filled with mockery. \"You’re still dreaming.\"","...","Upstairs.","Old Madam Xie returned to her room and immediately tried to contact her family in the independent continent.","Fortunately, although Qiao Nian restricted their entry and exit, she did not cut off their signal. They could still contact the outside world."]},{"number":3787,"title":"Chapter 3787: No One Would Give Face For Such a Matter","paragraphs":["The call soon went through, and Father Xie’s voice could be heard on the other end.","Old Madam Xie told him about the situation and hurriedly begged him. \"Hurry up and help me think of a way. It’s best if you ask your sister to speak up for me. No matter what, she has to at least ask her to let me return.\"","\"Mom, are you saying that Qiao Nian is over there?\"","\"Who else could it be but that bastard! Anyway, I’m trapped in the illegal district with the others. I’m afraid I won’t be able to leave if this drags on! After all, we’re different from them. At least we have some relationship with that bastard... Go to Yun’er and the others. No matter what, ask her to let me go...\"","Father Xie had been confused, but now he understood what Old Madam Xie meant. \"Tingyun and the others don’t know you participated in the tragedy 20 years ago. If they knew...\"","\"So what if they know? I’m their biological mother. Are they going to watch me die?!\" Old Madam Xie did not care.","\"Hurry up and ask them for help. I have to leave this place as soon as possible.\"","Father Xie couldn’t say anything else, seeing how confident his mother was. He just felt that, this time, he was not as optimistic as Old Madam Xie.","Putting aside whether Xie Yun and Xie Tingyun were willing to help, based on Qiao Nian’s attitude, he did not think she would give their family face.","After all, this matter involved a life. No one would give them face for this.","However, the person trapped in the illegal district was his biological mother, after all. She had participated in that matter for the family’s sake.","Father Xie couldn’t ignore her plight.","\"I understand.\"","\"I’ll wait for your good news.\"","After hanging up, Old Madam Xie finally felt more at ease. Her tightly furrowed brows relaxed slightly, and she wondered where Qiao Nian had found out the truth back then.","Also, if Michel fell into her hands, would Qiao Nian know what Ji Qing had studied back then?","However, she overruled it as soon as this idea popped up.","The Nance Alliance probably didn’t know about Ji Qing’s research. Moreover, the research was lost at sea with Ji Qing; no one knew about it anymore.","That thing probably wouldn’t appear again.","At this thought, Old Madam Xie threw her worries to the back of her mind and stopped dwelling on them.","**","At the hospital.","Ye Wangchuan immediately sent the old man to the operating theater.","Retrieving shrapnel was a complicated and lengthy process.","The surgery lasted for nearly five hours. It was the afternoon when the door of the operating theater opened and the doctor walked out.","\"How is it, doctor?\" Qin Si was the first to ask.","The doctor took off his mask, revealing a tired face. Then, he revealed a relaxed smile. \"The surgery was successful. The patient is out of danger.\"","\"Phew.\" Qin Si heaved a sigh of relief.","The doctor glanced at the people waiting in the corridor and said dutifully, \"Although all the shrapnel has been removed, the patient is still under anesthesia and unconscious because of his age. The patient might take some time to wake up. You have to take good care of him during this period...\"","\"I understand.\" Qin Si nodded and thanked him solemnly. Then, he said, \"I’ll go with you to get the medicine and understand the situation.\"","\"Okay.\"","He followed the doctor away."]},{"number":3788,"title":"Chapter 3788: Sister Nian Still Has Something to Do","paragraphs":["\"Tsk.\" Guan Yan watched as Qin Si handled these interpersonal relationships with ease. She smacked her lips, straightened her back, and walked before stopping in front of the girl. \"Boss, the person you saved still needs time to wake up. What are we doing now?\"","She asked with uncertainty, \"When he wakes up and asks, we’ll...?\"","Qiao Nian had been sitting on the bench provided for the family members in the corridor. Hearing this, she raised her baseball cap and revealed a bright face. \"I have nothing to ask him.\"","\"Uh.\" Guan Yan was straightforward. \"Why did you save him if you’ve nothing to ask?\"","She thought that Qiao Nian must have rushed to this godforsaken place to save him because she wanted to find out something from this person.","Qiao Nian rubbed her furrowed eyebrows and looked down indifferently. \"Nothing. I just wanted to save him.\"","Guan Yan did not understand.","However, Ye Wangchuan understood what she meant. He walked over and handed her a cup of warm water before gently saying, \"Since he’s fine, drink some water to moisten your throat.\"","Qiao Nian took the paper cup. The warmth she felt through the paper cup went straight to her heart, dispelling the coldness.","She took a sip of hot water. The ice and snow in her eyes gradually melted, and her lips turned warm. \"I just want them to know I already know the truth.\"","The things those people had tried so hard to hide, and even killed innocent people for, were now in her hands.","Just thinking about this, Qiao Nian could imagine how upset Nie Qingru would be if she knew.","With Nie Qingru’s suspicious personality, she would probably not be able to eat or sleep.","Qiao Nian didn’t immerse herself in this emotion for long. She suddenly looked up and asked Guan Yan, \"By the way, have you done what I asked?\"","\"You mean to not let them leave?\" Guan Yan made an \"OK\" gesture and smiled. \"I’ve already blacklisted all their fake identities. It won’t be easy for them to leave now.\"","It was all thanks to Ye Wangchuan’s help.","These people were very cunning and had used fake identities. She had originally missed a few, but Ye Wangchuan gave her a complete list.","She didn’t know where he got this list from, but it didn’t seem to be from the illegal district. If she wasn’t wrong, he should have gotten it from Continent M...","The name list was very interesting.","The big families of several continents were involved. Even the independent continent’s Xie family was involved.","If correct, this list was the most basic. Besides these, some families had probably not come this time.","\"Two hours ago, they tried to go through the exit procedures. They should have realized that they can’t leave by now.\"","Qiao Nian pulled down her baseball cap. Her wrist bones protruded, showcasing her fair and bright skin. Her eyes glowed with a casual killing intent. \"Continent M doesn’t know I’ve interfered.\"","Guan Yan looked over in confusion. So...?","Qiao Nian smiled and licked her dry lips. She was rather arrogant and cold. \"Of course, I have to let my good grandmother know about this. Otherwise, what’s the point of having no audience when the stage is set up?\"","She got up to leave the hospital.","\"Inform her. At least let her know that the person she cares about the most is trapped in the illegal district. She’ll come looking for me.\"","\"Alright,\" Guan Yan agreed.","After handing the old man and child to Qin Si, Qiao Nian directly left.","She had another important thing to do."]},{"number":3789,"title":"Chapter 3789: You’re in the Wrong Place, Right?","paragraphs":["Qiao Nian didn’t go far.","She took a taxi to the black market.","The black market in the illegal district was located on an inconspicuous street north of the central city. Outsiders who didn’t know would only think this was an ordinary road.","But people in the illegal zone all knew this road’s unusualness.","Besides those who stayed in the black market all year round, no one else dared to get close to this street.","The taxi driver stopped at the edge of the block and said to Qiao Nian, \"I can’t go further, I can only park here. Young lady, you have to walk there yourself.\"","\"Okay.\" Qiao Nian pulled down the brim of her cap, scanned the QR code, and transferred the money. Then, she opened the door and got out.","The driver waited for her to leave the car before stepping on the accelerator. It was as if he did not want to stay on this street for too long, as if there was a ferocious beast here...","Qiao Nian put her phone into her pocket and walked forward.","From the moment she entered the street, countless pairs of eyes stared at her from both sides.","The entire street looked ordinary.","However, in the shops on both sides of the road, be it the store managers or the small workers carrying goods, everyone was filled with curiosity and scrutiny upon seeing an unfamiliar face.","They were not obvious.","At the very least, they did not think so.","They watched until the girl disappeared into the depths of the black market street.","A bald man biting a cigarette butt turned to his friend beside him. \"Hey, did you see that? A girl just entered. She doesn’t look older than 20. Why did she come to the black market street? Did she come to the wrong place?\"","From the moment Qiao Nian entered the street, everyone had noticed her.","The bald man’s friend naturally saw the girl walking into the depths of the black market. He bent down to pick up his goods and replied coldly, \"Mind your own business.\"","Then, he left with his goods.","The bald man spat out the cigarette butt and followed him into his small shop while cursing.","The small shop’s shelves, less than 10m2, were mainly filled with cigarettes, alcohol, and snacks, looking the same as the side-food shops that could be seen everywhere on the roadside.","However, only those who knew the ropes would know.","In addition to cigarettes, alcohol, and snacks, they sold all kinds of guns and ammunition that did not circulate in the outside world.","The black market was well-stocked.","However, this entire street had such characteristics. On the surface, it looked ordinary. Only those who knew the place could buy what they wanted here.","Otherwise, this would be an ordinary commercial street...","**","Qiao Nian walked along the black market street to a shop selling fishing gear. She stood at the door with raised eyebrows, then walked in.","Ding-Dong.","The electronic sensor at the door rang. The shop assistant, dozing at the counter, seemed to wake up from his afternoon nap. He rubbed his eyes and yawned. \"Coming. What do you want to buy?\"","The girl pulled down her baseball cap and walked in.","Only then did the shop assistant notice the appearance of the ’guest’.","She looked extremely young, no more than 20 years old, with a typical Asian appearance.","And it was a woman.","He froze for a moment and instinctively frowned, then said, \"Uh, you’re in the wrong place, right?\"","When did such an unfamiliar face enter the black market street?","He subconsciously treated Qiao Nian as a little girl who walked into the wrong place. Impatient from being woken from a good dream, he waved his hand and tried to chase her out. \"Tsk~ We don’t have anything you want to buy here. Get out now.\""]},{"number":3790,"title":"Chapter 3790: Sister Nian’s Here to Buy Information","paragraphs":["Unexpectedly, the girl did not leave obediently. Instead, she walked to the counter, took a ring from her pocket, and placed it on the glass counter.","Her voice was deep.","\"I’m looking for your boss.\"","\"We—\"","The shop assistant was just about to roll his eyes and say, \"Is our boss someone you can meet just because you want to?\", but in the next second, he saw the snake-shaped ring that Qiao Nian had placed in front of him. The snake eyes were decorated with dark green gems. It almost seemed to come alive under the light.","This was not the point.","Most importantly, this snake-shaped ring resembled the letter S.","The shop assistant’s expression changed slightly, and he suddenly sized up the girl standing in front of him. She was wearing a baseball cap and looked mysterious and low-key.","For some reason, he recalled the outside world’s description of the big boss in the illegal district. She always wore a baseball cap and usually kept a low profile.","\"Sun...?\" The shop assistant couldn’t believe he would meet this big boss face-to-face. After he blurted it out, he reacted quickly. His expression changed again and again. He did not dare to delay for a second, nor did he dare to ask the girl to answer him. He held the ring with both hands and said seriously, \"Please wait a moment. I’ll call our boss immediately.\"","The shop wasn’t big.","However, besides the area outside where all kinds of fishing gear were displayed, there was also a whole other universe inside.","The shop assistant lifted the cloth curtain and quickly walked inside.","Qiao Nian waited in boredom for about 10 minutes before a fair and chubby middle-aged man walked out.","\"Oh my, what brings you here?\" A middle-aged man as fair as a steamed bun walked out smiling. He rubbed his hands together before returning the ring. \"What does the Red Alliance want to buy from me?\"","He was smart enough not to call Qiao Nian by her name like the shop assistant. Instead, he addressed her as \"you\".","\"Please keep your ring well.\"","\"Mm.\"","Qiao Nian took the snake ring from him and put it in her pocket. Not wasting any time, she looked at him casually and concisely said, \"I want to buy some information.\"","\"Go ahead.\"","This fishing equipment store was originally in the business of buying and selling information.","Of course, the price was not cheap.","Qiao Nian happened not to lack money. \"The Di family in Continent M. I want information about them. Anything works.\"","\"The Di family?\" The fat man was a mobile database. His eyes darted around, and he immediately recognized the person she was talking about.","He definitely knew what Qiao Nian was going to ask. With a troubled expression, he looked up slightly and said carefully, \"This information... I’m afraid I can’t sell it.\"","He didn’t dare to offend the reclusive families, nor did he dare to offend Qiao Nian.","He racked his brains to think of a way to explain. \"Firstly, we don’t know much. Secondly, someone disallowed us to investigate this family.\"","He dropped the ’you’ and said awkwardly, \"Sun, look, it’s not that I’m unwilling to sell you the information. It’s just that... I have the intention but am powerless.\"","Qiao Nian did not waste time and directly offered, \"50 million yuan.\"","\"Phew.\" The fat man took a deep breath, clearly shocked by her generosity.","He hesitated, deliberating over whether he should do this business. \"Sun, even if I sell you the information, I don’t know much. I’m afraid you’ll be unsatisfied.\"","He was telling the truth.","Back then, Nie Qingru had specially blocked all news related to the Di Family in Continent M. Even here, they only had bits and pieces of information."]},{"number":3791,"title":"Chapter 3791: We’re Closed for a While","paragraphs":["But of course, what little they had here could not be found outside.","However, he felt uneasy about charging 50 million yuan for such a small amount of information.","Of course, if she was not offering 50 million yuan, he was unwilling to risk offending the reclusive families to sell this information.","The chubby man observed Qiao Nian’s reaction and opened his mouth. \"Sun, why don’t...\"","\"50 million is not a small sum.\" Qiao Nian took a silver lighter from her pocket and played with it. Her eyes were cold and impatient. \"I’m only buying information. Whether I’m satisfied or not is my business. I won’t find trouble with you.\"","The chubby man understood she wanted to buy the information, so he did not hesitate. He turned around and shot the shop assistant a look before smiling apologetically to the girl. \"Please wait for a moment. I’ll go get the information.\"","If he sold information on the black market, it would be in a leather bag.","It was filled with what the buyer wanted. It would be written clearly on it.","As for how the buyers would deal with the contents of the leather bag, they were not responsible.","Moreover, they wouldn’t sell the same information twice. The leather bag was equivalent to a buyout.","After a while, the shop assistant took it out.","The chubby man handed the leather bag to the girl and continued worriedly, \"... There’s very little news about the Di family. Everything we know is inside this bag. The information is meagre, and you’ve offered such a high price. I can’t take advantage of you. Therefore, we’ll give you another piece of information for free.\"","Qiao Nian looked up. \"Speak.\"","The chubby man looked at her. \"I heard that the Little Young Master has inherited the Di family’s remaining power. He’s a big shot.\"","Qiao Nian looked at him.","The chubby man lowered his eyes and avoided her scrutinizing gaze, as if afraid of being involved in this mess.","Qiao Nian saw through him and smirked. She tucked the leather bag under her arm and turned around to leave. \"I’ll transfer the money to your account.\"","\"Take care.\"","The chubby man watched her leave before his smile faded.","They naturally had their own channels to sell information on the black market. They also knew many secrets that outsiders did not know.","For example...","Sun’s background was inextricably linked to that person from the reclusive families.","He also knew that Di Xicheng was in the illegal district, and Sun had come from the independent continent... If something happened to Young Master Di in the illegal district...","The chubby man immediately said to the shop assistant, \"Pack up. We’re going to close for a while.\"","\"Boss?\"","\"Hurry up.\"","They would offend people from time to time when selling information. Sometimes, they would also encounter such things that needed to be avoided.","Usually, when encountering such a situation, they would close shop for some time and wait for the limelight to pass.","The shop assistant was quite familiar with this operation, so after the chubby man’s order, he quickly went to do it.","**","Qiao Nian called Guan Yan after receiving the Di family’s information.","Not long after, a fiery red sports car stopped at the intersection of the black market street.","Guan Yan lowered the window and greeted the girl walking over. \"Boss, this way.\"","Qiao Nian opened the door and got inside. She sat in the front passenger seat and fastened her seatbelt. Then, she lowered her eyebrows and said irritably, \"Let’s go back.\"","\"Alright.\" Guan Yan saw the leather bag from the corner of her eye and asked, \"You’re here to buy information?\""]},{"number":3792,"title":"Chapter 3792: Our Situation Will Be Worse","paragraphs":["\"I checked the Di family out.\" Qiao Nian did not hide it from her. She casually placed her hand on the window and glanced at the unopened leather bag. \"From the information seller’s tone, it seems like Di Xicheng is the only one left in the Di family.\"","Guan Yan had half a foot on the accelerator and was about to turn the steering wheel when she heard this. She was stunned for a second and doubted her ears. \"What do you mean?\"","\"Pfft, I want to know what it means too,\" Qiao Nian replied casually. \"We’ll know when we get back.\"","She felt that the relationship between Di Xicheng and Nie Qingru was very subtle.","Moreover, she had always wanted to investigate Di Xicheng’s background but couldn’t find anything useful through other channels.","Coincidentally, upon returning to the illegal district this time, she wanted to come to the black market street and personally buy information.","Seeing that she had yet to check the leather bag’s contents, Guan Yan did not speak about it again as she turned the car around. \"Alright, let’s go back first.\"","The fiery red sports car sped away.","**","At the same time, in Continent M.","Nie Qingru had already received the news that Qiao Nian had gone to the illegal district. She had even trapped everyone who went to the illegal district, including Di Xicheng.","Her expression had been dark since this morning, and no one dared to approach her easily.","This situation lasted until Shadow brought the old man back. She suppressed her gloominess and squeezed out a polite smile. \"Elder Xue, you’re here.\"","The Conservatives were still on her side. As the Empress, Nie Qingru had to rope them in. With a warm attitude, she asked the servants to make a cup of tea for him.","People in Continent M liked to drink black tea.","The Earl Grey’s rich fragrance wafted in the living room. Elder Xue took a sip before asking, \"Your Majesty, why did you call me here?\"","\"It’s nothing much.\"","Nie Qingru took a deep breath and stared into his eyes with a sharp eagle-like gaze.","\"Qiao Nian knows what happened back then.\"","This was the first bombshell.","Nie Qingru knew that this information alone was not enough to get this sly old fox to help her, so she threw out a second bomb right on the heels of the other party’s daze.","\"The last person from the Nance Alliance fell into her hands. If... I mean if... that person really has something left behind by Ji Qing, then if that research result fell into her hands, the effect would be even worse than coming directly from Ji Qing.\"","Nie Qingru straightened her shawl and said indifferently, \"Ji Qing at least considered my feelings and never announced that research result. However, if it falls into the hands of that evil creature, not to mention what she will use that research for, as long as it becomes a reality, our reclusive families will forever be controlled by others!\"","Their weapons would turn into bubbles and no longer pose a threat.","As per her wish, the green-robed old man’s expression changed. Only now did she calmly make her request. \"Xicheng is still in the illegal district. Qiao Nian has already restricted their access. If she catches one or two more people and finds out how Ji Qing died tragically in the sea, our situation will become even worse.\"","She looked at Elder Xue and said warmly, \"I remember you still have a force you haven’t used in the illegal district. It’s time to put it to use.\"","Elder Xue’s expression constantly changed. Forgetting the tea, he remained silent for a long time.","Nie Qingru wanted the power he had cultivated for many years. It could be considered his number one trump card.","\"Empress, I need to think about this.\"","Nie Qingru could tell his heart was wavering. She narrowed her eyes and placed her hands on the table, then slowly said with an inexplicable expression, \"Elder Xue, time waits for no man.\""]},{"number":3793,"title":"Chapter 3793: Too Little Information About the Di Family","paragraphs":["Red Alliance’s HQ.","Guan Yan drove Qiao Nian back to the inconspicuous white bungalow.","Ye Wangchuan and Qin Si were still at the hospital.","Qiao Nian tossed aside the leather bag and went to get a glass of water. Then, she sat on the sofa and sipped water before picking up the leather bag. She untied the string and pulled out the information related to the Di family.","50 million yuan for a thin piece of paper recording information related to the Di family.","Guan Yan saw that she was reading the information and couldn’t help but lean over to take a look.","\"How’s it, Sun? What’s the background of this Di family?\"","\"Tsk.\"","Qiao Nian read through the contents quickly. Her mouth twitched, and she lowered her eyelashes. She roughly understood why the seller gave her some additional inside information before she left.","She handed over the sheet of paper. \"See for yourself.\"","Guan Yan took it and curiously looked down at the contents. The more she read, the more she frowned. \"Continent M; a family that specializes in information technology. Just this...?\"","The information was pitifully meagre.","Guan Yan wondered if this was really all the information the black market had gathered. How could it be so thin?","She continued reading patiently. \"The Dis have a total of 16 members, and the most famous one is Di Xiao, who is known as a genius musician.\"","She seemed to grasp the main point and immediately looked at the girl. \"Is this Di Xiao Nie Qingru’s lover?\"","Qiao Nian did not comment.","Guan Yan took it as a tacit agreement.","Then, she continued to read the information. Soon, she reached the last sentence. \"18 years ago, there was a fire in the Di residence. None of the 16 members of the family managed to escape. Not a single person was left alive when the rescue team arrived.\"","The contents of the paper ended there.","Guan Yan was dumbfounded. Then, she frowned. \"Then what’s going on with Di Xicheng? This says that no one from the Di family survived, but Di Xicheng is clearly alive.\"","There were many aristocratic families on several continents.","The Di family was not considered one of the top families in Continent M. There were no exceptional talents among them.","Whether such a family existed or was destroyed, it was very difficult to attract attention.","Not many people cared about the fire back then, and this was also why nothing about the fire came up when Qiao Nian searched for news online.","If not for this file on the black market street, Nie Qingru would have wiped out all the news about the Di family’s fire long ago. It would be impossible to find any traces...","But why did Nie Qingru want to erase this information? Did the fire that almost erased the Di family have anything to do with her?","Qiao Nian didn’t know what the connection was. She only vaguely felt that Di Xicheng was a dangerous person, the kind of dangerous person that even Nie Qingru could not control.","Seeing she seemed to be in a daze, Guan Yan silently put down the piece of paper and asked in a low voice, \"Sun, there’s nothing useful in this information. What do you plan to do next? Those people are still trapped in the illegal district. If you want to deal with them, it’s best to do it as soon as possible. Otherwise, with their methods, one or two might escape the net...\""]},{"number":3794,"title":"Chapter 3794: They’re All Trapped Here by the Red Alliance","paragraphs":["She was telling the truth.","Although the illegal district was their territory, the Red Alliance was not omnipotent.","At the very least, compared to David’s power in Continent F, the Red Alliance did not have that many people in the illegal district. They were mainly hackers, not very familiar with killing and arson.","Qiao Nian was still thinking about the connection between the fire and Nie Qingru. At the mention of those people, her fair fingertips curled up slightly, and she tapped on the table. After a while, she said casually, \"I want to see someone.\"","**","The weather in the illegal district was freezing in winter.","It was much colder in the town near the mountains than in the city.","Old Madam Xie was old and her body was not as strong as young people. These two days, when the temperature dropped at night, she would be unbearably cold.","The lack of updates from Father Xie was one of the reasons why she could not sleep or eat in peace.","\"How long are we going to be stuck here?\"","\"I’m sick of this godforsaken place!\"","Downstairs, the families gathered again. Some complained indignantly about the damned weather, others complained they couldn’t stand life here.","But even so... everyone knew very well that they couldn’t leave for now.","\"The people monitoring us outside haven’t left yet?\" Singh’s face was dark, and her delicate face was visibly haggard.","She was wearing a red dress. The design made the dress look like a blooming gardenia, making her look beautiful and charming. She was a stunner that all men would take a second look at.","However, no one’s eyes were on her. Everyone was paying close attention to the unfamiliar faces outside.","Some people leaned against the side of the car and smoked, while others looked like residents who came out with trash bags.","Without exception, these people’s auras were all vicious. They were not the ordinary people they portrayed themselves to be.","Back then, the families that could participate in the hunt for Ji Qing were not ordinary. The last survivor of the Nance Alliance was also a junior from their own family.","These people, like Singh, had usually seen the world.","They knew very well how many people and how many snipers might be hiding in the dark.","They had not left the hotel since realizing the outside world was different. They had been holed up in the hotel, forming a subtle confrontation with the people outside.","\"What’s the Red Alliance trying to do?\"","\"That Sun hasn’t appeared since that day. She also won’t let us go. What’s this? Are we prisoners?\"","Singh had a sharp tongue. She was so angry that her chest heaved up and down as she sat down.","She did not understand what Qiao Nian wanted to do and was about to go crazy from the tense and oppressive atmosphere.","\"Have you contacted the family? What did they say?\" someone asked her.","\"Hmph.\" Singh sneered and looked over angrily. \"What else can they say? My family said that they’re still thinking of a way.\"","In fact, other than closely monitoring them, Qiao Nian and the Red Alliance did not cut off their contact with the outside world.","They could still make phone calls and go online.","Other than being unable to leave, that person did not seem to have restricted their movements. No one could figure out what she was trying to do.","The more Singh thought about it, the more frustrated she became. At this moment, she saw Old Madam Xie coming down from upstairs. She immediately raised her willowy eyebrows. \"Didn’t Matriarch Xie say that she could leave this place soon? Why is she still here like us? Could it be that she hasn’t contacted her family yet?\""]},{"number":3795,"title":"Chapter 3795: No One Knows What Sister Nian Is Thinking","paragraphs":["Old Madam Xie’s face immediately darkened, and she glared at her fiercely. \"I’ll leave sooner or later!\"","\"Tsk.\" Singh found it boring and turned her head away, too lazy to argue with her.","She could tell this old woman was not as close to Sun as she had said. What she had said previously about her being able to leave this place soon was just bragging.","These people had a grudge against Sun.","How could the boss of the Red Alliance let them off so easily?","The changes in the past two days had made everyone tense. Everyone was in a bad mood and had already quarreled several times in private.","Now, they couldn’t even leave and could only stay together.","\"If I had known I would encounter such a thing, I wouldn’t have agreed to come to the illegal district. I didn’t participate in what happened back then at all. Why should I bear all this?\"","\"That’s right. Whoever is involved, look for them. We’re here to look for someone according to our family’s request. Who knows if we’ll be implicated in this kind of thing?\"","Some continuously complained.","The meaning between the lines was that they had been implicated.","As the only one present who had participated in the hunt back then, Old Madam Xie was undoubtedly embarrassed.","She was about to return to her room upstairs with a dark expression.","Suddenly, there was a knock on the door.","Everyone in the lobby looked in the direction of the sound.","A black car had stopped outside at some point, and a young man alighted. His double-breasted trench coat accentuated his tall figure, his face like jade, and his body exuded a noble aura. His phoenix eyes raised slightly as he looked inside. He looked very easy to talk to. \"May I ask if Matriarch Xie is inside?\"","There was dead silence.","At this juncture, they were all trapped here.","How could the person who came to find them at this time be an ordinary person? Moreover, the other party had asked for one of them immediately.","There was no need to say whose man it was.","Singh swallowed her saliva. \"You are?\"","The man looked easy to talk to, but in fact, that was the furthest from the truth. At least, he did not pay attention to Singh. He didn’t even look at her. \"I’m looking for Matriarch Xie for something. Can someone help me call her?\"","Silence.","Everyone looked at each other warily, but no one moved.","About 10 seconds passed.","The smile disappeared from the man’s eyes. His slender fingers tugged at his clothes, and the corners of his lips curled up slightly. \"Looks like no one is unwilling to help.\"","The atmosphere, which was already close to freezing, got even colder. Everyone could feel the pressure from the stranger.","Singh keenly sensed the danger and pointed at Madam Xie, who had not gone far. \"She’s over there.\"","**","Upstairs.","The secret guard understood the situation below and reported to the young man in the room.","\"Young Master Di, Ye Wangchuan is here.\"","\"Matriarch Xie has been taken away.\"","\"Those people watching us out there haven’t left.\"","Di Xicheng stood by the window and watched as Old Madam Xie got into the car and left.","A dark glint flashed across his eyes, and he indifferently said, \"She finally can’t help but find someone to settle the score from back then.\"","The secret guard couldn’t figure out his thoughts and peeked at him in confusion.","Di Xicheng seemed to have eyes on his back. Although he did not turn around, he knew what the secret guard was thinking. He said lightly, \"Ha, Qiao Nian is not the kind of person to take revenge indiscriminately.\""]},{"number":3796,"title":"Chapter 3796: I Want the List of People Who Participated Back Then","paragraphs":["\"Since she came for someone from the Xie family, she’s probably looking for those involved in the incident back then. As for the people trapped downstairs... she doesn’t care about exacting revenge on them.\"","The people downstairs were just juniors sent by their families. Other than the Matriarch of the Xie family, none of the old fellows who had participated back then had come.","Since Qiao Nian had found out the truth from back then, she must know that these people were just small pawns of their families.","The reason she did not let them go was probably for those old things who participated in the matter back then to be unable to sit still.","\"Young Master Di, then we...\" The secret guard roughly understood what he meant.","Di Xicheng sneered, retracted his gaze from the window, and turned around. \"We?\"","There was mockery and sarcasm in his gaze, but he was not afraid. \"We’re different. I have a grudge against her.\"","Back then, he had used Simon to plot against Qiao Nian in the independent continent.","Later on, Qiao Nian attacked him in the open sea.","They were on the same level, and neither was willing to let go of the other.","\"There’s no news from Continent M?\" Di Xicheng asked softly, unhurried.","Just as the secret guard was about to respond, he held his breath and lowered his head. \"The Empress asked you not to worry. She will help you leave soon.\"","\"Oh?\"","Di Xicheng knew well how bad Nie Qingru’s situation was right now. He had his own means to leave, but he did not use them.","He smiled, but the smile did not reach his eyes.","\"Then I’ll wait for Aunt to save me.\"","**","Qiao Nian did not have to wait long for Ye Wangchuan to return with his men.","She heard a car stopping outside.","\"Sun, she’s here.\" Guan Yan glanced outside and raised her chin slightly, indicating for her to look outside.","Sure enough, Qiao Nian quickly saw Old Madam Xie following Ye Wangchuan inside.","Old Madam Xie had been uneasy all the way here. Now, finally seeing the girl standing in the living room, the uneasiness in her heart reached its peak.","However, she was good at pretending. Even at this point, she still squeezed out a smile and greeted the girl. \"Qiao Nian, I heard that you were looking for me.\"","Guan Yan clicked her tongue in admiration. She admired the old lady for being able to act like a familiar elder in this situation.","She was quite good at pretending.","Guan Yan was used to the straightforward personality of people in the illegal district and did not like to interact with people like Old Madam Xie. She told the girl, \"Sun, I’ll go to my room. You guys take your time to chat.\"","\"Alright.\"","Qiao Nian responded and casually walked towards Old Madam Xie, stopping in front of the person pretending to be familiar with her.","\"Long time no see, Matriarch Xie.\"","Old Madam Xie couldn’t figure out what she meant. She forced a smile and pretended to be nonchalant. \"Yes, it’s been a long time. I didn’t expect to see you here. Why did you come to the illegal district...?\"","That day, she had only heard from Di Xicheng that the person who had kidnapped the last person from the Nance Alliance was Qiao Nian. She had not seen it with her own eyes.","Hence, she still hoped that Qiao Nian was not here for what had happened back then.","Unexpectedly, her delusion was soon shattered.","\"I want a list of the people involved in that incident.\"","Silence.","Old Madam Xie was extremely shocked. She pinched her palm and forced herself to calm down. She still wanted to deny it. \"I... I don’t know what you’re talking about. I don’t know what happened back then.\""]},{"number":3797,"title":"Chapter 3797: Sister Nian Knows Everything","paragraphs":["Qiao Nian pulled a chair and sat down, looking obedient. \"You don’t know?\"","Sweat broke out on Old Madam Xie’s back, but she did not dare to wipe it. She forced herself to pretend to be stupid. \"I really don’t know what you’re talking about.\"","Silence.","Qiao Nian looked away after a few seconds. Her slightly lowered bangs covered her eyebrows, making them look even sharper as she played with a lighter.","Old Madam Xie watched as she flicked the lighter, and a blue flame lit up.","It was a simple action, but the killing intent hidden in it was obvious.","Qiao Nian wanted her dead.","This realization caused Old Madam Xie to gasp. A chill ran up from the bottom of her feet to her scalp. She looked at the girl’s pursed lips and did not speak in horror. Before the other party could speak, she said in a low voice, \"You’re at least acquainted with Tingyun and Yun’er. I’m considered half an elder to you. According to the family’s seniority, Yun’er is your aunt. You should still call me Grandma...\"","She had the cheek to say that.","Unfortunately, these words were useless against Qiao Nian. Instead, they revealed her guilt.","Qiao Nian raised her eyebrows as she pleaded for mercy. Her eyes were cold and emotionless.","\"My patience is limited.\"","Old Madam Xie was still unwilling to say it.","Qiao Nian flicked on the lighter and lazily reminded her, \"If I didn’t know anything, I wouldn’t have asked you to come. Since I’ve come to the illegal district, I wouldn’t look for you for no reason. So if I were you, instead of pretending to be stupid, I might as well be straightforward. This way, it’ll be better for everyone. Perhaps for Auntie Xie’s sake, I’ll let you live.\"","\"How much do you know?\" Old Madam Xie wasn’t stupid.","Qiao Nian had already said so much. It was unrealistic for her to pretend anymore.","She wasn’t sure how much Qiao Nian knew.","\"All of it.\"","Silence.","Old Madam Xie inhaled a breath of cold air, which entered her stomach and caused a convulsive pain, causing her temples to ache.","She did not completely believe Qiao Nian and probed, \"So you know why Ji Qing died?\"","Qiao Nian did not answer immediately.","Old Madam Xie’s surprise gradually calmed down. She clenched her fists and said calmly, \"Qiao Nian, I advise you not to pursue this matter. The dead are already dead, and the living have to live! I admit that you’re very powerful, even more powerful than Ji Qing...\"","Her tone changed and suddenly became sharp. \"But you have to be clear that even if Ji Qing were in your place, once she gets involved in this matter, she would still die without an intact corpse!\"","Her righteous warning did not seem to be fake. The meaning between the lines seemed to speak on Qiao Nian’s behalf. Even if she was not sincere, it sounded like an elder’s concern for a junior.","However, the girl only glanced at her lightly and casually asked, \"Because of nuclear dissolution?\"","\"You?!\"","Old Madam Xie was frightened. Her hair stood on end, and she looked at her as if she had seen a ghost.","\"Y-You know?\"","Her tongue did not seem to belong to her as she stuttered.","Her shock did not diminish at all.","Qiao Nian knew?","How did Qiao Nian know about this?","This was a secret among secrets!","If Qiao Nian knew even this, then what she said before was true. She really knew everything!"]},{"number":3798,"title":"Chapter 3798: You’re Not Qualified to Negotiate Terms With Me","paragraphs":["Qiao Nian stood up at this moment. She was half a head taller than Old Madam Xie. When they stood together, she looked disdainful.","\"Are you saying that I know about nuclear dissolution, or that I know about that anti-nuclear defense system... or that you guys hunted her because of this?\"","\"You, you, you...\"","Old Madam Xie trembled as if she were having a stroke. Unable to control her expression any longer, she looked at Qiao Nian as if looking at a lunatic.","\"What are you trying to do! Since you know all this, why are you still asking me for a list of the people who participated back then? What do you want to do? Do you really want to avenge Ji Qing?!\"","\"Why not?\"","Silence.","Old Madam Xie choked on her words.","However, her mind was filled with crazy thoughts.","Qiao Nian was crazy.","This matter involved several continents and more than 10 families. They were all top families, including the reclusive families.","Qiao Nian wanted to avenge Ji Qing. How ridiculous and crazy was that?","Did she know that once the people outside heard that she knew about ’nuclear dissolution’ and ’anti-nuclear defense system’, they would take the initiative to look for her even without her finding them?","She wanted to fight everyone on her own.","What was she thinking?","\"Aren’t you afraid of death?\" Old Madam Xie did not care about Qiao Nian’s life. She just could not understand what Qiao Nian, Ji Qing, and these people were thinking.","Qiao Nian did not answer her question directly. She only said coldly, \"You just need to give me the name list. Whether I’m afraid of death or not is my business. It has nothing to do with you.\"","Old Madam Xie looked at her deeply and took a deep breath. The bulging veins on her forehead relaxed as if she had understood something, and she silently asked, \"If I tell you, will you let me off?\"","She did not make deals that didn’t benefit her.","Qiao Nian wanted her to give this list, meaning she had to betray the people she had worked with back then. She couldn’t offend those people for nothing.","However, Old Madam Xie knew well that the current situation did not allow her to think so much. She would think about the future later. What she urgently needed to resolve was the current predicament.","\"I’ll give you the name list, but you have to let me off. This is my condition. You can agree or not... But let me say this first. If you don’t, I definitely won’t say anything.\"","\"You’re not qualified to negotiate with me.\" Qiao Nian’s dark eyes swept over her. \"As long as you’re alive, I have a thousand ways to make you talk.\"","Old Madam Xie looked aggrieved. She gritted her teeth and squeezed out, \"Qiao Nian, you’re a member of the Ji family, after all. I’m your elder!\"","\"So?\" The girl looked over mockingly. \"Isn’t Ji Qing your junior?\"","Old Madam Xie immediately felt as if she had swallowed a fly. The resentment in her stomach turned into bubbles and dissipated silently. She really did not have the confidence to argue with the other party on this matter.","In the end, Qiao Nian did not promise to let her off. She threw her a pen and left her alone in the living room. \"I’ll give you an hour to think about it.\"","With that, Qiao Nian turned around and went upstairs.","**","At the same time, the independent continent.","Father Xie had been waiting outside the Ji family’s old residence for a few days before finally meeting Xie Yun coming out to go to the hospital.","He didn’t care about his dignity as he instructed the chauffeur, \"Block the way!\"","The Xie family driver obediently turned the car around and stopped in front of the black Bentley, blocking the other party’s path."]},{"number":3799,"title":"Chapter 3799: Mom Is Doing It For You","paragraphs":["In the Bentley.","He Lin turned around and whispered to the noblewoman in the backseat helplessly, \"Madam, it’s your brother’s car.\"","Xie Yun had hit her forehead by the sudden brake. Upon hearing that it was Father Xie’s car that blocked them, she was instantly distraught.","She opened the door. \"Wait for me inside.\"","He Lin watched her get out and meet up with Father Xie. He hesitated momentarily before sending a message to Ji Lingfeng.","...","Outside.","Xie Yun saw her brother. She knew why he was here. Before the other party could speak, she expressed her attitude concisely. \"Brother, you don’t have to say anything. I can’t talk to Nian Nian. I can’t!\"","Faced with her resolute attitude, Father Xie looked defeated as he spoke in a hoarse voice, \"I know you’re in a difficult position, but she’s our mother, after all. She gave birth to us and raised us. Even if everyone blames her, as her children, we can’t abandon her...\"","Xie Yun turned her head away with a frown. \"Brother, stop talking!\"","She did not want to hear this.","Father Xie didn’t give her a chance to leave and asked in a low voice, \"Qiao Nian took Mom away! Are you really not going to care about her?!\"","Xie Yun suddenly turned around to look at him.","Father Xie’s anxiety wasn’t fake. Seeing that she was looking at him, he smiled bitterly and did not let go. \"I just received a call. Mom has been taken away for two hours and hasn’t returned... If I weren’t anxious, I wouldn’t have blocked your way.","\"Xie Yun, even if you don’t want to interfere in this matter, at least help me ask if Mom... is still alive.\"","On one side was her biological mother, and on the other side was her biological brother.","Xie Yun’s heart was divided and thrown into the pot of oil to suffer. She couldn’t do anything ungrateful, nor could she watch Old Madam Xie die.","Xie Yun pinched her palm and dug her nails into her flesh to barely stabilize her mind. \"...So why did she participate in that kind of thing back then?! I don’t understand why she did that.\"","Father Xie’s expression became even more bitter. \"S-She did it for you.\"","Xie Yun was stunned. \"For me?\"","Father Xie took a deep breath. \"You should know Lingfeng’s feelings for his sister. Mom did it for the family back then, but it was also for you.\"","Xie Yun and Ji Lingfeng’s marriage concerned the fortitude of the Xie and Ji families’ alliance. Back then, Old Madam Xie realized that Ji Qing was special and, wanting to stabilize her marriage, participated in the hunt.","Otherwise, with the Xie family’s situation, they didn’t have nuclear weapons. There was no reason for her to go after Ji Qing.","To put it bluntly...","Her interest was not in Ji Qing’s research, but in wanting Ji Qing to disappear.","\"I didn’t ask her to do that!\" Xie Yun was smart. Father Xie only needed a few words to make her understand.","Her face was pale as she looked over angrily.","Father Xie knew that Xie Yun was innocent, but it concerned Old Madam Xie’s life and death. He could only make use of his sister’s guilt, even if it were just a trace. \"I know you didn’t ask her to do that, but on account that Mom was thinking for you... Can you look after her?\"","Xie Yun’s palm hurt, and her nails bled. The pain could not compare to the feeling of Father Xie’s words stabbing her heart."]},{"number":3800,"title":"Chapter 3800: Sister Nian Won’t Answer the Phone","paragraphs":["After a long silence, she still did not give Father Xie a clear reply. \"Nian Nian has helped me too much.\"","\"Xie Yun...\"","\"She saved Ji Nan and Lingfeng. Even if she asks me to repay her with a life, I won’t have a second word.\"","Father Xie’s expression changed. \"But—\"","Xie Yun did not give him a chance to speak and said expressionlessly, \"I’m going to the hospital to get my medicine.\"","Father Xie wanted to stop her, but He Lin got out of the car.","Afraid of Ji Lingfeng and the Ji family, he did not dare to block their way and could only watch as Xie Yun entered the car.","He Lin walked over and said politely, \"Mr. Xie, about the car...\"","He was referring to Father Xie’s car blocking the way.","Father Xie’s face twitched. \"I’ll tell the chauffeur to move it away immediately.\"","\"Then I’ll have to trouble you.\" He Lin said that, but he turned back honestly without looking back.","Father Xie stood on the spot for a moment before getting into the car with a dark expression. He instructed the chauffeur to move out of the way.","As soon as their car moved away, the black Bentley drove past them.","The chauffeur could feel the heavy atmosphere and asked nervously, \"Sir, should we follow them?\"","Father Xie’s temples throbbed. He rolled up the window and closed his eyes in resignation. \"No need. Let’s go to the suburban manor!\"","Xie Yun refused to call Qiao Nian, so he could only look for Xie Tingyun and Nan Tianyi.","However, Xie Yun was unwilling to help. Xie Tingyun had been more independent and cold than Xie Yun since she was young, so the possibility of her agreeing to help was minimal.","If it weren’t for the fact that this matter concerned Old Madam Xie’s life and death, Father Xie really did not want to go to her to look for trouble. However, he had no choice.","He could only give it a try.","**","Qiao Nian received a call from Xie Yun in the evening.","The caller continued calling, and she did not answer. She left the phone in the room before turning around.","Qiao Nian was wearing a loose bathrobe, and her short hair was still dripping. She casually dried her hair with a towel. When her hair stopped dripping, she threw the towel to the side and sat on the sofa, placing her laptop on her lap.","She had just turned on her computer when her cell phone on the table lit up again.","Qiao Nian glanced over and saw that it was still Xie Yun.","She rubbed the space between her eyebrows, feeling a little frustrated.","She knew very well why Xie Yun was calling at this time. That’s why she did not want to answer.","They weren’t on the same side. Even if she answered the call, they would only feel awkward.","Qiao Nian didn’t answer. The cell phone lit up for more than ten seconds before the other party gave up.","She shifted her gaze to her computer, opened the communication software, and sent a message to Slim Waist Control asking how matters were in Beijing.","Slim Waist Control probably did not see the message since he didn’t reply immediately.","Qiao Nian wasn’t in a hurry. She opened her email account and dealt with the emails one by one.","In addition to some bills, there were also important reports from Continent F and Cheng Feng Corporation. Qiao Nian didn’t like to deal with these things. She would have a headache every time she saw these complicated reports. However, as one of the important bosses, she definitely could not ignore them.","Qiao Nian got up to drink water before slowly reading the reports..."]}]);
